#: ../../export/content/applications/websites.rst:5
msgid "Websites"
msgstr "網站"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:3
msgid "Blog"
msgstr "網誌"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Odoo Blog** lets you manage blog pages and posts, and customize them with "
"the website builder."
msgstr "**Odoo 部落格**讓您管理部落格頁面和貼文，並使用網站建立器自訂它們。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:8
msgid ""
"Install the :guilabel:`Blog` app by clicking :guilabel:`New` on the website "
"builder, then selecting  :guilabel:`Blog Post`, and "
"clicking :guilabel:`Install`."
msgstr ""
"在網站建立器上按一下\\ :guilabel:`新增`\\ ，然後選擇\\ :guilabel:`部落格貼文"
"`\\ ，並按一下\\ :guilabel:`安裝`\\ ，以安裝\\ :guilabel:`部落格`\\ 應用程"
"式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Blogs [video] <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"blogs-6935>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 教學：部落格 [影片] <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/blogs-6935>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:15
msgid "Blog posts"
msgstr "部落格文章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:17
msgid ""
"To create a blog post, click :guilabel:`New` on the website builder and "
"click :guilabel:`Blog Post`. Select a :ref:`blog <blog/blog-pages>`, define "
"a :guilabel:`Blog Post Title`, and click :guilabel:`Save`. Write the post's "
"content and customize it using the website builder."
msgstr ""
"若要建立部落格文章，請按一下網站編輯器上的\\ :guilabel:`新增`\\ 並按一下"
"\\ :guilabel:`部落格文章`\\ 。選取一個\\ :ref:`部落格 <blog/blog-pages>`\\ ，"
"定義\\ :guilabel:`部落格文章標題`\\ ，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ 。撰寫"
"文章內容並使用網站編輯器進行自訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:21
msgid ""
"To publish a post, toggle the :guilabel:`Unpublished` switch in the top-"
"right corner of the page."
msgstr "若要發佈文章，請切換頁面右上角的\\ :guilabel:`未發佈`\\ 開關。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:23
msgid ""
"To delete a blog post, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Blog "
"post`. Select the blog post to delete, click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`Delete`."
msgstr ""
"若要刪除部落格文章，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 網站 --> 部落格文章"
"`\\ 。選取要刪除的部落格文章，按一下\\ :icon:`fa-cog`\\ :guilabel:`動作`\\ ，"
"然後按\\ :icon:`fa-trash-o`\\ :guilabel:`刪除`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:27
msgid "Customize blog posts"
msgstr "自訂部落格文章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:29
msgid ""
"To customize the layout of all blog posts, open one and "
"click :menuselection:`Edit --> Style`. Under the :guilabel:`Blog Page` "
"section, different categories of options can be used to customize the posts:"
msgstr ""
"若要自訂所有部落格文章的版面配置，請開啟其中一篇，然後按一下\\ "
":menuselection:`編輯 --> 樣式`\\ 。在\\ :guilabel:`部落格頁面`\\ 區段下，可以"
"使用不同類別的選項來自訂文章："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:164
msgid ":guilabel:`Layout`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`版面配置`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:35
msgid ":guilabel:`Breadcrumb`: display the breadcrumb trail."
msgstr ":guilabel:`導覽列`：顯示導覽路徑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Style`: choose how the post's title and cover are arranged:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`樣式`\\ ：選擇如何排列文章標題和封面："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Title Above Cover`: display the title above the cover. "
"Enable :guilabel:`Full Width Cover` to make the cover use the page's full "
"width."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`標題在封面上方`\\ ：將標題顯示在封面上方。啟用\\ :guilabel:`全寬封"
"面`\\ ，讓封面使用頁面的完整寬度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Split Cover`: display the title on the left and the cover on the "
"right."
msgstr ":guilabel:`分割封面`\\ ：左側顯示標題，右側顯示封面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:41
msgid ":guilabel:`Title Inside Cover`: display the title over the cover."
msgstr ":guilabel:`標題在封面內`\\ ：將標題顯示在封面之上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:43
msgid "Then, select the elements to display in the post's header:"
msgstr "接著，選取要在文章頁首顯示的元素："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:45
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:60
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:71
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:196
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: create or select existing :ref:`tags <blog/tags>` and "
"display them on the post."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`標籤`：建立或選取現有的\\ :ref:`標籤 <blog/tags>`\\ 並在文章上顯"
"示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:47
msgid ":guilabel:`Author`: display the post's author and publication date."
msgstr ":guilabel:`作者`\\ ：顯示文章作者及發佈日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Share Links`: add clickable icons that link to your social "
"network profiles. This option is not available with the :guilabel:`Title "
"Inside Cover` style."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`分享連結`\\ ：新增可點選的圖示，連結到您的社群網路個人檔案。此選項"
"不適用於\\ :guilabel:`標題在封面內`\\ 樣式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Container Size`: choose the width of the post's "
"content: :guilabel:`Small`, :guilabel:`Regular`, or :guilabel:`Full`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`容器大小`\\ ：選擇文章內容的寬度：\\ :guilabel:`小型`\\ 、\\ "
":guilabel:`一般`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`完整`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:55
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Small` size is not available with the :guilabel:`Split Cover` "
"style."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`小型`\\ 大小不適用於\\ :guilabel:`分割封面`\\ 樣式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:57
msgid ":guilabel:`Content`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`內容`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Share Links`: add clickable icons that link to your social "
"network profiles."
msgstr ":guilabel:`分享連結`\\ ：新增可點選的圖示，連結到您的社群網路個人檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:61
msgid ":guilabel:`Comments`: allow visitors to comment."
msgstr ":guilabel:`評論`\\ ：允許訪客留言評論。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bottom`: display another post at the end of the page; by default, "
"the next post of the same blog. Use the :guilabel:`Recommended Post` field "
"to select another post instead."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`底部`\\ ：在頁面底部顯示另一篇文章；預設為同一部落格的下一篇文章。"
"請改用\\ :guilabel:`推薦文章`\\ 欄位來選取其他文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:65
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:201
msgid ":guilabel:`Sidebar`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`側邊欄`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Author`: display the post author."
msgstr ":guilabel:`作者`：顯示文章作者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Table of Contents`: display a table of contents for the post."
msgstr ":guilabel:`目錄`\\ ：顯示文章目錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Share Links`: add clickable icons that link to your social "
"network profiles and a subscription field for your newsletter."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`分享連結`：加入可按一下的圖示，連結至您的社群網路個人檔案，以及電"
"子報的訂閱欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Blogs List`: display links to all :ref:`blog pages <blog/blog-"
"pages>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`部落格列表`\\ ：顯示所有\\ :ref:`部落格頁面 <blog/blog-pages>`\\ "
"的連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Archive`: allow visitors to view all posts from a specific month "
"by selecting it."
msgstr ":guilabel:`封存`：允許訪客透過選取特定月份來檢視該月份的所有文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:76
msgid ""
"The sidebar is only displayed if at least one of its options is enabled."
msgstr "側邊欄僅在至少啟用其中一個選項時才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:78
msgid ""
"To add tags or customize the cover of a specific post, click the cover and "
"use the following settings under the :guilabel:`Blog Post Cover` section:"
msgstr ""
"若要加入標籤或自訂特定文章的封面，請按一下封面並在\\ :guilabel:`部落格文章封"
"面`\\ 區段下使用以下設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:81
msgid ":guilabel:`Tags`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`標籤`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Background`: add an image by clicking the :icon:`os-"
"camera` :guilabel:`(camera)` icon, or use a background color by clicking "
"the :icon:`fa-ban` (:guilabel:`None`) icon and selecting a color."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`背景`：按一下\\ :icon:`os-camera`\\ :guilabel:`（相機）`\\ 圖示加"
"入圖片，或按一下\\ :icon:`fa-ban`（:guilabel:`無`）圖示並選取顏色來使用背景顏"
"色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Size`: select the size of the cover (:guilabel:`Full "
"screen`, :guilabel:`Half screen`, or :guilabel:`Fit text`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`尺寸`：選擇封面的尺寸（:guilabel:`全螢幕`、:guilabel:`半螢幕`"
"或:guilabel:`符合文字`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filter Intensity`: choose the cover filter's intensity "
"(:guilabel:`Low`, :guilabel:`Medium`, :guilabel:`High`) or disable it by "
"selecting :guilabel:`No filter`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`濾鏡強度`：選擇封面濾鏡的強度（:guilabel:`低`、:guilabel:`中"
"`、:guilabel:`高`），或選擇\\ :guilabel:`無濾鏡`\\ 來停用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:92
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:210
msgid "After applying the desired changes, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "套用所需變更後，按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:95
msgid ""
"Illustrate your posts with copyright-free images from :doc:`Unsplash </"
"applications/general/integrations/unsplash>`."
msgstr ""
"使用來自\\ :doc:`Unsplash </applications/general/integrations/unsplash>`\\ 的"
"免版稅圖片來說明您的文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:97
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`Plausible <analytics/plausible>` to track traffic on your blog."
msgstr "使用\\ :ref:`Plausible <analytics/plausible>`\\ 追蹤您部落格上的流量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:98
msgid ""
"Customize blog building blocks through the website editor. For example, "
"filter by the :guilabel:`Latest blog posts` or :guilabel:`Most viewed blog "
"posts` and determine which blog to display in the building block."
msgstr ""
"透過網站編輯器自訂部落格建構模組。例如，依\\ :guilabel:`最新部落格文章`\\ 或"
"\\ :guilabel:`最多瀏覽的部落格文章`\\ 篩選，並決定要在建構模組中顯示哪個部落"
"格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:103
msgid ""
":doc:`Building block documentation <website/web_design/building_blocks>`"
msgstr ":doc:`建構模組使用說明 <website/web_design/building_blocks>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:104
msgid ":doc:`Odoo rich-text editor documentation <../essentials/html_editor>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Odoo 豐富文字編輯器使用說明 <../essentials/html_editor>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:109
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/forum.rst:285
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/information.rst:100
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "標籤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:111
msgid ""
"Tags let visitors filter blog posts that share a specific tag. They are "
"displayed at the bottom of each post."
msgstr ""
"標籤讓訪客可以篩選共用特定標籤的部落格文章。標籤會顯示在每篇文章的底部。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:114
msgid ""
"To create a tag, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Tags` "
"and click :guilabel:`New`. Fill in the:"
msgstr ""
"若要建立標籤，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 標籤`\\ 並按一下"
"\\ :guilabel:`新增`。填寫："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:117
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:118
msgid ":ref:`Category <blog/tag-category>`"
msgstr ":ref:`類別 <blog/tag-category>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:119
msgid ":guilabel:`Color`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`顏色`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Used in`: to apply tags to existing blog posts, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`使用於`：若要將標籤套用至現有的部落格文章，請按一下\\ :guilabel:`"
"加入資料行`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:122
msgid ""
"Add and create tags directly from posts by clicking :menuselection:`Edit --> "
"Style` and selecting the post's cover. Under :guilabel:`Tags`, "
"click :guilabel:`Choose a record...`, and select or create a tag by writing "
"a new name."
msgstr ""
"直接從文章加入和建立標籤，方法是按一下\\ :menuselection:`編輯 --> 樣式`\\ 並"
"選擇文章的封面。在\\ :guilabel:`標籤`\\ 下，按一下\\ :guilabel:`選擇記"
"錄...`，然後選擇或輸入新名稱來建立標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:129
msgid "Tag category"
msgstr "標籤類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:131
msgid ""
"Tag categories let you organize tags displayed on the sidebar into groups."
msgstr "標籤類別讓您可以將側邊欄上顯示的標籤整理成群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:133
msgid "tag categories"
msgstr "標籤類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:136
msgid ""
"To create tag categories, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --"
"> Tag Categories` and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"若要建立標籤類別，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 標籤類別`\\ 並按"
"一下\\ :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:142
msgid "Blog landing pages"
msgstr "部落格登入頁面"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:144
msgid ""
"To create multiple blogs, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --"
"> Blogs` and click :guilabel:`New`. Next, enter the :guilabel:`Blog Name` "
"and the :guilabel:`Blog Subtitle`."
msgstr ""
"若要建立多個部落格，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 部落格`\\ 並按"
"一下\\ :guilabel:`新增`。接著，輸入\\ :guilabel:`部落格名稱`\\ 和"
"\\ :guilabel:`部落格副標題`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:147
msgid "The :guilabel:`Blog` menu gathers all the blogs and their posts."
msgstr ":guilabel:`部落格`\\ 選單會匯集所有部落格及其文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:150
msgid ""
"With two or more blogs, the blog landing page (/blog) aggregates posts from "
"all blogs and lets visitors choose which blog to view."
msgstr ""
"若設有兩個或更多部落格，部落格登陸頁面（/blog）會彙總所有部落格的文章，並讓訪"
"客選擇要檢視的部落格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:154
msgid "Customize blog landing pages"
msgstr "自訂部落格登陸頁面"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:156
msgid ""
"To customize the blog landing pages, go to :menuselection:`Edit --> Style` "
"and use the available options as desired."
msgstr ""
"若要自訂部落格登陸頁面，請前往\\ :menuselection:`編輯 --> 樣式`\\ 並視需要使"
"用可用選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:160
msgid ""
"The settings are shared by the page listing the posts of all blogs (`/blog`) "
"and the page of each individual blog. Only two options "
"differ: :guilabel:`Top Banner` is available on the page of an individual "
"blog, and :guilabel:`Show Title` on the page listing all blogs."
msgstr ""
"這些設定由列出所有部落格文章的頁面（`/blog`）及各別部落格頁面所共用。僅有兩個"
"選項不同：\\ :guilabel:`頂部橫幅`\\ 僅適用於各別部落格頁面，而\\ "
":guilabel:`顯示標題`\\ 則適用於列出所有部落格的頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Top Banner`: display the blog's cover image and subtitle at the "
"top of the page:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:168
msgid ":guilabel:`Full Width`: make the banner use the page's full width."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:170
msgid ":guilabel:`Show Title`: display the title at the top of the page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:171
msgid ":guilabel:`Style`: choose how the posts are listed:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:173
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Thumbnails`: display the posts in a grid. Two additional options "
"are available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:175
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promote Last`: emphasize the most recent post by displaying it in "
"a larger size."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:176
msgid ":guilabel:`Cards Design`: display the posts with the *card* effect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Grid`: display the posts in a grid with borders around each post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:179
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Split`: display the latest post in a fixed column on the left and "
"the other posts in a scrollable grid on the right."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:181
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimal`: display the posts in a list showing only their title "
"and date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Compact`: display the posts in a list showing only their date, "
"title, and tags."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:183
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Regular`: display the posts in a list with all their information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:184
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Large`: display the posts in a larger list with all their "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:186
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Grid` style, or the :guilabel:`Thumbnails` style "
"when :guilabel:`Promote Last` is disabled, use the :guilabel:`Size` option "
"to choose the number of columns."
