#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:35
msgid ""
"When clicking the :guilabel:`Add to Cart` button, the customer remains on "
"the product page by default."
msgstr "按下\\ :guilabel:`加入購物車`\\ 按鈕時，客戶預設會留在產品頁面上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:38
msgid ""
"On the **e-commerce landing page** (`/shop`): if the selected product is "
"configurable (i.e., it has configurable attributes and/or multiple "
"packagings), a :guilabel:`Configure` pop-up opens to let the customer choose "
"the desired options."
msgstr ""
"在\\ **電子商務登陸頁面**\\ (`/shop`)\\ 上：如果所選產品可進行設定（即具有可"
"設定屬性和/或多種包裝），將會開啟\\ :guilabel:`設定`\\ 彈出視窗，讓客戶選擇所"
"需的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:41
msgid ""
"On a specific **product page**: attributes/packagings configuration is done "
"directly on the page."
msgstr "在特定\\ **產品頁面**\\ 上：屬性/包裝設定直接在頁面上完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:43
msgid ""
"If the product has linked :ref:`optional products <ecommerce/products/"
"cross_upselling>`, a :guilabel:`Configure` pop-up opens on both the shop "
"page and the product page. The customer can then choose "
"between :guilabel:`Add to Cart` (to stay on the product page) "
"and :guilabel:`Go to Checkout` (to be redirected to the cart)."
msgstr ""
"如果產品連結了\\ :ref:`可選產品 <ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`，購物頁"
