":guilabel:`加入購物車`\\ （停留在產品頁面）與\\ :guilabel:`前往結帳`\\ （重新"
"導向至購物車）之間進行選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:49
msgid ""
"When :doc:`loyalty programs </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>` with the :guilabel:`Promotions` :ref:`program type <sales/"
"loyalty_discount/program-types>` are configured, a progress bar toward "
