"loyalty_discount>`\\ 以及\\ :guilabel:`促銷`\\ :ref:`計畫類型 <sales/"
"loyalty_discount/program-types>`\\ 的忠誠計畫時，將商品新增至購物車會顯示邁"
"向\\ :ref:`獎勵 <sales/loyalty_discount/rewards>`\\ 的進度列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:56
msgid "Offer customers free shipping when they place a larger order. To do so:"
msgstr "當客戶下大額訂單時，為其提供免運費優惠。若要執行此操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:58
msgid ""
"Create a loyalty program and set the :guilabel:`Program Type` field "
"to :guilabel:`Promotions`."
msgstr "建立忠誠計畫，並將\\ :guilabel:`計畫類型`\\ 欄位設為\\ :guilabel:`促銷`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:60
msgid ""
"Set a :ref:`conditional rule <sales/loyalty_discount/conditional-rules>` "
"with the minimum order amount required to qualify for free shipping, e.g., "
"`$ 1,000.00`."
msgstr ""
"設定\\ :ref:`條件規則 <sales/loyalty_discount/conditional-rules>`\\ ，並填入"
"符合免運資格的最低訂單金額，例如 `$ 1,000.00`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:62
msgid "Define a :guilabel:`Free shipping` reward."
msgstr "定義\\ :guilabel:`免運費`\\ 獎勵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:64
msgid "Progress bar for reward."
msgstr "獎勵進度列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:70
msgid "Button customization"
msgstr "按鈕自訂"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:72
msgid ""
"You can replace the :guilabel:`Add to Cart` button with a :guilabel:`Contact "
"Us` button, which redirects users to the default contact form."
