msgid ""
"To display the :guilabel:`Contact Us` button, you need to :ref:`hide the Add "
"to cart button <ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>` for zero-priced products or "
"specific categories on the relevant product page(s). When the customer "
"clicks the :guilabel:`Contact Us` button, by default, they are redirected to "
"the contact form where the :guilabel:`Subject` field is already auto-filled "
"with the requested product's name."
