#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:171
msgid ""
"Restrict access to the :ref:`shop <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"and :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>` for "
"specific customers, e.g., in a :doc:`B2B <../ecommerce/configuration/"
"b2b_b2c>` business setup."
msgstr ""
"針對特定顧客限制對\\ :ref:`商店 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>`\\ "
"及\\ :ref:`結帳 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`\\ 的存取，例如"
"在\\ :doc:`B2B <../ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c>`\\ 業務設定中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:178
msgid "Order summary"
msgstr "訂單總覽"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:180
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Order summary` step allows customers to see the items they "
"added to their cart, adjust quantities, :guilabel:`Remove` products, "
"and :ref:`reorder products from a previous order <ecommerce/checkout/"
"reorder>`. Information on product prices and the taxes applied is also "
"displayed. Customers can then click the :guilabel:`Checkout` :icon:`fa-"
"chevron-right` button to continue to the :ref:`Address <ecommerce/checkout/"
"delivery>` step."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`訂單摘要`\\ 步驟允許客戶查看他們加入購物車的項目、調整數"
"量、:guilabel:`移除`\\ 產品，以及\\ :ref:`從先前的訂單重新訂購產品 "
"<ecommerce/checkout/reorder>`\\ 。產品價格和適用稅額的資訊也會顯示。然後，客"
"戶可以按一下\\ :guilabel:`結帳`\\ :icon:`fa-chevron-right`\\ 按鈕繼續前往"
"\\ :ref:`地址 <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`\\ 步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:186
msgid ""
"Open the website editor to :ref:`enable <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>` checkout options such as:"
msgstr ""
"開啟網站編輯器以\\ :ref:`啟用 <ecommerce/checkout/customize_steps>`\\ 結帳選"
"項，例如："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:189
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Suggested Accessories`: to showcase :ref:`accessory products "
"<ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建議配件`：用於展示\\ :ref:`配件產品 <ecommerce/products/"
"cross_upselling>`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promo Code`: to allow customers to redeem :ref:`gift cards "
"<ewallet_gift/gift-cards>` and apply :doc:`discount codes <../../sales/sales/"
"products_prices/loyalty_discount>` or :ref:`promotional codes <ecommerce/"
"prices/promotional-code>`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`促銷代碼`\\ ：允許客戶兌換\\ :ref:`禮品卡 <ewallet_gift/gift-"
"cards>`\\ 並套用\\ :doc:`折扣代碼 <../../sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>`\\ 或\\ :ref:`促銷代碼 <ecommerce/prices/promotional-"
"code>`\\ ；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:194
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add to Wishlist`: :ref:`Enable wishlists <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/wishlists>` to allow signed-in users to remove a product "
"from their cart and add it to their wishlist using the :guilabel:`Save for "
"Later` option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`加入願望清單`\\ ：:ref:`啟用願望清單 <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/wishlists>`\\ ，允許已登入的使用者使用\\ :guilabel:`稍後"
"儲存`\\ 選項從購物車中移除產品並將其加入願望清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:199
msgid ""
"If a :doc:`fiscal position <../../finance/accounting/taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>` is detected automatically, the product tax is determined "
"based on the customer's IP address."
msgstr ""
"如果自動偵測到\\ :doc:`財務規則 <../../finance/accounting/taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>`\\ ，產品稅額將根據客戶的 IP 位址決定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:201
msgid ""
"If the installed :doc:`payment provider <../../finance/payment_providers>` "
"supports :ref:`express checkout <payment_providers/express_checkout>`, a "
"dedicated button is displayed, allowing customers to go straight from the "
"cart to the confirmation page without filling out the contact form."
msgstr ""
"如果已安裝的\\ :doc:`付款服務商 <../../finance/payment_providers>`\\ 支援"
"\\ :ref:`快速結帳 <payment_providers/express_checkout>`\\ ，系統會顯示專屬按"
"鈕，讓客戶可以直接從購物車前往確認頁面，無需填寫聯絡人表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:209
msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:211
msgid "Once they have reviewed their order:"
msgstr "在審閱訂單後："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:213
msgid ""
"Unsigned-in customers are prompted to :guilabel:`Sign in` or enter "
"their :guilabel:`Name` and :guilabel:`Email` address, along with their "
"delivery address and phone details;"
msgstr ""
"未登入的顧客會被提示\\ :guilabel:`登入`\\ 或輸入其\\ :guilabel:`姓名`\\ 與"
"\\ :guilabel:`電子郵件`\\ 地址，以及配送地址和電話詳細資訊；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:215
msgid ""
"Signed-in customers can select the appropriate :guilabel:`Delivery address`."
msgstr "已登入的客戶可以選擇適當的\\ :guilabel:`配送地址`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:217
msgid ""
"They can then :doc:`choose a delivery method <shipping>`, select or enter "
"their :guilabel:`Billing Address` (or toggle the :guilabel:`Same as delivery "
"address` switch if the billing and delivery addresses are identical), and "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` to proceed to the next step."
msgstr ""
"接著可以\\ :doc:`選擇配送方式 <shipping>`\\ 、選取或輸入\\ :guilabel:`帳單地"
"址`\\ （或者，如果帳單地址與配送地址相同，可切換\\ :guilabel:`與配送地址相同"
"`\\ 開關），然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`確認`\\ 以進行下一步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:222
msgid ""
"For B2B customers, you can also :ref:`enable <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>` optional :ref:`B2B fields <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>` "
"in the website editor."
msgstr ""
"對於 B2B 客戶，您也可以在網站編輯器中\\ :ref:`啟用 <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>`\\ 選用的\\ :ref:`B2B 欄位 <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:224
msgid ""
"You can add a checkbox for users without an account to sign up for a "
"newsletter. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable "
"the :guilabel:`Newsletter` feature, and select a :guilabel:`Newsletter List`."
msgstr ""
"您可以為沒有帳戶的使用者加入一個勾選方塊，以便訂閱電子報。要執行此操作，請前"
"往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`\\ ，向下捲動到\\ :guilabel:`電子"
"商務`\\ 區段，啟用\\ :guilabel:`電子報`\\ 功能，並選擇一個\\ :guilabel:`電子"
"報清單`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:228
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`Pick up in store <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>` "
"delivery method is selected, the customer can :guilabel:`Choose a pick-up "
"point` and, if applicable, filter them by country, provided several pick-up "
"points are available."
msgstr ""
"當選取\\ :ref:`門市取貨 <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>`\\ 運送方式時，客"
"戶可以\\ :guilabel:`選擇取貨點`\\ ，如果適用且有多個取貨點，還可依國家/地區進"
"行篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:231
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`Expected Delivery <ecommerce/shipping/custom-method>` option "
"is configured, the customer views the expected delivery date or can select a "
"desired delivery date."
msgstr ""
"當設定了\\ :ref:`預計到貨日 <ecommerce/shipping/custom-method>`\\ 選項時，客"
"戶可查看預計交貨日期或選擇所需的交貨日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:237
msgid "Automatic address validation"
msgstr "自動地址驗證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:239
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`Google Places API </applications/general/integrations/"
"address_autocomplete>` to ensure that partner delivery addresses are valid. "
"Addresses are automatically validated as the user types during checkout."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ :doc:`Google Places API </applications/general/integrations/"
"address_autocomplete>`\\ 確保合作夥伴的送貨地址有效。在結帳過程中，使用者輸入"
"時會自動驗證地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:243
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, the :ref:`Google Places API <address_autocomplete/"
"places-api-configuration>` needs to be configured first. Then, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`General` section, enable :guilabel:`Google Address "
"Validation`, then paste the :ref:`Google Places API key "
"<address_autocomplete/generate_api_key>` in the :guilabel:`API Key` field."
msgstr ""
"若要啟用此功能，需要先配置\\ :ref:`Google Places API <address_autocomplete/"
"places-api-configuration>`\\ 。然後前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> "
"Settings`\\ 。在\\ :guilabel:`一般`\\ 區段中，啟用\\ :guilabel:`Google 地址驗"
"證`\\ ，然後將\\ :ref:`Google Places API 金鑰 <address_autocomplete/"
"generate_api_key>`\\ 貼到\\ :guilabel:`API 金鑰`\\ 欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:252
msgid "Extra info"
msgstr "額外資訊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:254
msgid ""
"You can add an :guilabel:`Extra Info` step in the checkout process to "
"collect additional customer information through an online form, which is "
"then included in the :ref:`sales order <ecommerce/handling/sales>`. To do "
"so, :ref:`enable <ecommerce/checkout/customize_steps>` the :guilabel:`Extra "
"Step` option in the website editor. The form can be :doc:`customized <../"
"website/web_design/building_blocks/forms>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"您可以在結帳過程中新增一個\\ :guilabel:`額外資訊`\\ 步驟，透過線上表單收集額"
"外的客戶資訊，這些資訊隨後會包含在\\ :ref:`銷售訂單 <ecommerce/handling/"
"sales>`\\ 中。若要執行此操作，請在網站編輯器中\\ :ref:`啟用 <ecommerce/"
"checkout/customize_steps>`\\ 「\\ :guilabel:`額外步驟`\\ 」選項。表單可以根據"
"需要進行\\ :doc:`自訂 <../website/web_design/building_blocks/forms>`\\。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:263
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "付款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:265
msgid ""
"At the :guilabel:`Payment` step, customers can choose a :guilabel:`Payment "
"method`, enter their payment details, and click :guilabel:`Pay now`."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`付款`\\ 步驟中，顧客可以選擇\\ :guilabel:`付款方式`、輸入付款"
"詳細資訊，並按一下\\ :guilabel:`立即付款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:269
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pay now` button label can be customized using "
"the :doc:`website editor <../website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""
"可以使用\\ :guilabel:`立即付款`\\ 按鈕標籤，透過\\ :doc:`網站編輯器 <../"
"website/web_design>`\\ 進行自訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:273
msgid ":doc:`E-commerce payments <payments>`"
msgstr ":doc:`電子商務付款 <payments>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:274
msgid ""
":doc:`Online payment providers </applications/finance/payment_providers>`"
msgstr ":doc:`線上支付服務商 </applications/finance/payment_providers>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:277
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:41
msgid "Terms and conditions"
msgstr "條款和條件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:279
msgid ""
"To require customers to agree to the :doc:`terms and conditions <../../"
"finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions>` before payment, open "
"the website editor and toggle the :guilabel:`Accept Terms` switch in "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"若要要求客戶在付款前同意\\ :doc:`條款和條件 <../../finance/accounting/"
"customer_invoices/terms_conditions>`\\ ，請開啟網站編輯器，並在\\ :guilabel:`"
"樣式`\\ 分頁中切換\\ :guilabel:`接受條款`\\ 開關。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:284
msgid "eWallets and gift cards"
msgstr "電子錢包與禮品卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:286
msgid ""
"Customers can pay with an eWallet or gift card during checkout. To offer "
"these options, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"and enable :menuselection:`Discounts, Loyalty & Gift Card` in "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section. Then, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Gift cards & eWallet` and :doc:`create a gift card and/or "
"eWallet program </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"ewallets_giftcards>`."
msgstr ""
"客戶可以在結帳時使用電子錢包或禮品卡付款。若要提供這些選項，請前往"
"\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`\\ ，並在\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ "
"區段中啟用\\ :menuselection:`折扣、忠誠度與禮品卡`\\ 。然後，前往"
"\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 電子商務 --> 禮品卡與電子錢包`\\ 並\\ :doc:`建立"
"禮品卡和/或電子錢包計畫 </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"ewallets_giftcards>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:292
msgid "Gift card and eWallet options at checkout"
msgstr "結帳時的禮品卡和電子錢包選項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:298
msgid "Order confirmation"
msgstr "訂單確認"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:300
msgid ""
"The final step of the checkout process is the order confirmation page, which "
"provides a summary of the customer's purchase details. A sales order is "
"automatically created in the backend."
msgstr ""
"結帳流程的最後一步是訂單確認頁面，其提供了顧客購買詳情的摘要。系統會在後臺自"
"動建立銷售訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:303
msgid ""
"To automatically send notification emails and documents, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll down "
"to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section. Then configure the following settings:"
msgstr ""
"若要自動寄送通知電郵和文件，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 設定 --> 設"
"定`\\ 並向下滾動至\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 區段。然後，設定以下選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:307
msgid ""
"To send an order confirmation email: Under :guilabel:`Order Confirmation`, "
"select an :guilabel:`Email` :doc:`template </applications/general/companies/"
"email_template>`, or, if the :doc:`WhatsApp app </applications/productivity/"
"whatsapp>` is installed, a :guilabel:`WhatsApp` :ref:`template <productivity/"
"whatsapp/templates>` from the dropdown list. To edit the selected template, "
"click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal link`) arrow."
msgstr ""
"若要寄送訂單確認電郵：在\\ :guilabel:`訂單確認`\\ 下，選取一個\\ "
":guilabel:`電郵`\\ :doc:`模板 </applications/general/companies/"
"email_template>`，或者，如果已安裝\\ :doc:`WhatsApp 應用程式 </applications/"
"productivity/whatsapp>`，可從下拉選單中選取一個\\ :guilabel:`WhatsApp`\\ "
":ref:`模板 <productivity/whatsapp/templates>`。若要編輯所選模板，請按一下\\ "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right`\\ (:guilabel:`內部連結`) 箭頭。"

