#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:9
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce enables the configuration of products, categories, variants, "
"and pricing. It also manages customer accounts and access, supporting both "
"B2B and B2C business models."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 電子商務可配置產品、類別、變體及定價，亦可管理顧客帳戶與存取權限，支援 "
"B2B 與 B2C 業務模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:14
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:3
msgid "Products"
msgstr "產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:14
msgid ""
"Configure products, manage their visibility, add images and videos, create "
"product combos, and attach digital files. Define selling strategies, "
"translate product information, and manage stock and packaging."
msgstr ""
"配置產品、管理其可見性、加入圖片與影片、建立產品組合，並附加數位檔案。定義銷"
"售策略、翻譯產品資訊，以及管理庫存與包裝。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:22
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:3
msgid "Categories and variants"
msgstr "類別和變體"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:22
msgid ""
"Use product variants and attributes to offer multiple product options. "
"Create attribute and e-commerce categories to better organize the shop and "
"product pages."
msgstr ""
"使用產品變體與屬性以提供多種產品選項。建立屬性與電子商務類別，以更妥善地組織"
"商店與產品頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:29
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:13
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:3
msgid "Prices"
msgstr "價格"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:29
msgid ""
"Configure different prices and taxes using prices per unit, pricelists, and "
"discounts. Prices can also be hidden, and sales can be restricted when "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"使用單價、價目表及折扣配置不同價格與稅金。必要時，也可隱藏價格並限制銷售。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:36
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:67
msgid "Customer accounts"
msgstr "客戶帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:36
msgid ""
"Control access to the shop, the checkout, and the customer portal, and use "
"customer accounts to support B2B and B2C operations."
msgstr ""
"控制對商店、結帳及顧客門戶網站的存取，並使用顧客帳戶支援 B2B 與 B2C 營運。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:3
msgid "B2B and B2C"
msgstr "B2B 和 B2C"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:42
msgid ""
"Configure separate websites and shops for B2B and B2C businesses and "
"customize them to meet the specific needs of each business model."
msgstr ""
"為 B2B 與 B2C 業務配置獨立的網站與商店，並自訂以滿足各業務模式的特定需求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce is designed to fulfill the needs of both B2B and B2C "
"companies. It allows you to configure :doc:`prices <prices>`, "
"manage :doc:`access <customer_accounts>` for specific customers, "
"and :ref:`customize the website <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` to "
"support B2B, B2C, or both business models."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 電子商務旨在滿足 B2B 與 B2C 公司的需求。它允許您配置\\ :doc:`價格 "
"<prices>`、管理特定顧客的\\ :doc:`存取權限 <customer_accounts>`，以及"
"\\ :ref:`自訂網站 <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>`\\ 以支援 B2B、B2C 或"
"兩種業務模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:15
msgid ""
"While B2C businesses sell directly to the end consumer with a :ref:`tax-"
"included <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>` price, B2B businesses "
"usually :ref:`exclude taxes <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>` and "
"may even prefer to hide prices altogether, showcasing only their products "
"instead. To configure a B2B-specific online shop, make sure the :ref:`Tax-"
"Excluded <ecommerce/prices/taxes>` option is enabled, and complete the "
"configuration to :ref:`hide the pricing <ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>`."
msgstr ""
"B2C 企業以\\ :ref:`含稅 <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`\\ 價格直接"
"向終端消費者銷售，而 B2B 企業通常\\ :ref:`不含稅 <ecommerce-price-management-"
"tax-display>`，甚至可能偏好完全隱藏價格，僅展示產品。若要配置 B2B 專用的線上"
"商店，請確保已啟用\\ :ref:`不含稅 <ecommerce/prices/taxes>`\\ 選項，並完成配"
"置以\\ :ref:`隱藏定價 <ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:24
msgid ""
"To make sure that only customers with an :ref:`account and granted access "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>` can see the prices, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Customers`, click the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon from the search bar, and select "
"the :guilabel:`Archived` filter. Then click the :guilabel:`Public user` "
"card, go to the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab, and add the zero-priced "
"pricelist configured to :ref:`cover all countries <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>`. Keep the :guilabel:`Public User` contact :guilabel:`Archived` at "
"all times. Website visitors now see the products without prices, while only "
"customers with an :ref:`account invitation <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"account-creation>` and an assigned :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` can view the pricing in the customer portal."
msgstr ""
"若要確保只有擁有\\ :ref:`帳戶並被授予存取權限 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"account-creation>`\\ 的客戶才能看到價格，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 電"
"子商務 --> 客戶`\\ ，按一下搜尋列中的\\ :icon:`fa-caret-down`\\ :guilabel:`"
"（下拉式選單）`\\ 圖示，然後選擇\\ :guilabel:`已封存`\\ 篩選條件。接著按一下"
"\\ :guilabel:`公開使用者`\\ 卡片，前往\\ :guilabel:`銷售與採購`\\ 分頁，並加"
"入配置為\\ :ref:`涵蓋所有國家/地區 <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`\\ 的零"
"價格價目表。始終保持\\ :guilabel:`公開使用者`\\ 聯絡人為\\ :guilabel:`已封存"
"`\\ 狀態。網站訪客現在可以看到沒有價格的產品，而只有擁有\\ :ref:`帳戶邀請 "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>`\\ 並已分配\\ :ref:`價目表 "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`\\ 的客戶才能在客戶門戶網站中查看價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:36
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/B2B_B2C`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/B2B_B2C`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:37
msgid ":ref:`Discounts <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`"
msgstr ":ref:`折扣 <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:42
msgid "Access request"
msgstr "存取請求"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:44
msgid ""
"When running a B2B business, you usually :ref:`hide the pricing <ecommerce/"
"b2b_b2c/prices>` on the web shop and make it available for :ref:`logged-in "
"users <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` only. To prevent anyone "
"from signing up freely, set the :ref:`Customer Account <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/account-creation>` setting option to :guilabel:`On "
"invitation`. To create a page where customers request access, open "
"the :doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/"
"web_design>`, :doc:`create a form <../../website/web_design/building_blocks/"
"forms>`, customize it, and in the :guilabel:`Action` field, "
"select :guilabel:`Create a customer`."
msgstr ""
"經營 B2B 業務時，您通常會\\ :ref:`隱藏價格 <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>`\\，僅"
"對\\ :ref:`已登入使用者 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>`\\ 開放網店"
"內容。若要防止任何人自由註冊，請將\\ :ref:`客戶帳號 <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/account-creation>`\\ 設定選項設為\\ :guilabel:`應邀請`\\。"
"若要建立一個讓客戶申請存取的頁面，請開啟\\ :doc:`網站編輯器 </applications/"
"websites/website/web_design>`\\，\\ :doc:`建立一個表單 <../../website/"
"web_design/building_blocks/forms>`\\，對其進行自訂，並在\\ :guilabel:`動作`\\"
" 欄位中選擇\\ :guilabel:`建立客戶`\\。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can assign tags created on a contact form under :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Customers` to identify what kind of customers have "
"submitted the form. To do so, open the :doc:`website editor </applications/"
"websites/website/web_design>` and select a field in the form. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab, click the :guilabel:`+ Field` button in "
"the :guilabel:`Field` section heading and set the field's :guilabel:`Type` "
"to :guilabel:`Tags`. Toggle the tags that should be automatically assigned "
"when a customer fills in the form and set the field's :guilabel:`Visibility "
"Rule` to :guilabel:`Hidden`."
msgstr ""
"你可以指定在聯絡表單上建立的標籤，以識別哪些顧客提交了表單，該標籤可在\\ "
":menuselection:`網站 --> 設定 --> 顧客`\\ 下管理。若要這樣做，請開啟\\ "
":doc:`網站編輯器 </applications/websites/website/web_design>`\\ 並選取表單中"
"的一個欄位。然後，在\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 標籤頁中，按一下\\ :guilabel:`+ 欄"
"位`\\ 按鈕，位於\\ :guilabel:`欄位`\\ 區段標題，並將該欄位的\\ :guilabel:`類"
"型`\\ 設為\\ :guilabel:`標籤`。切換在顧客填寫表單時應自動指定的標籤，並將該欄"
"位的\\ :guilabel:`顯示規則`\\ 設為\\ :guilabel:`隱藏`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:62
msgid ""
"When a customer submits the form, a new contact is automatically created in "
"the database. The contact is assigned the first pricelist from the list of "
"available pricelists, and, if applicable, the specified tags."
msgstr ""
"當客戶提交表單時，系統會自動在資料庫中建立新的聯絡人。該聯絡人會被分配可用價"
"目表清單中的第一個價目表，以及（如適用）指定的標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:66
msgid ""
"Submitted requests can be found under the :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Customers`. Select the customer you want to :ref:`grant portal "
"access <ecommerce/customer_accounts/grant-access>` to. Once done, the "
"selected customer is able to view the B2B prices and products. Make sure the "
"correct pricelist is assigned to their contact form."
msgstr ""
"已提交的請求可以在\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 電子商務 --> 客戶`\\ 下找到。選"
"擇您要為其\\ :ref:`授予門戶網站存取權限 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/grant-"
"access>`\\ 的客戶。完成後，選定的客戶將能夠查看 B2B 價格和產品。請確保其聯絡"
"人表單已分配正確的價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:73
msgid ""
"It is also possible to hide the entire shop from the public using "
"the :ref:`Ecommerce Access <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"setting and only make it available for logged-in customers."
msgstr ""
"也可以使用\\ :ref:`電子商務存取權限 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-"
"access>`\\ 設定將整個商店從公開狀態中隱藏，並僅供已登入的客戶使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:76
msgid ""
"Configure the :ref:`checkout policy <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>` to allow/disallow guest checkout for B2C businesses."
msgstr ""
"配置\\ :ref:`結帳政策 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`\\ 以允"
"許/不允許 B2C 企業的訪客結帳。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enable the :ref:`Shared Customer Accounts <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"multiple-websites>` feature to allow customers to use the same account "
"on :ref:`all <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` your websites."
msgstr ""
"啟用\\ :ref:`共享客戶帳戶 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/multiple-websites>`\\ "
"功能，可讓客戶在您的\\ :ref:`所有 <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>`\\ 網"
"站上使用同一個帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:83
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:351
msgid ":doc:`customer_accounts`"
msgstr ":doc:`customer_accounts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:88
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:3
msgid "Multiple websites"
msgstr "多個網站"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:90
msgid ""
"Settings are website-specific, which means it is possible to configure "
"different behaviors for each website. For example, you can set up a B2C "
"website that allows :ref:`guest checkout <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"checkout-access>` and displays :ref:`tax-included prices <ecommerce-price-"
"management-tax-display>`, and a B2B website that requires :ref:`sign-in "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>` and shows :ref:`tax-excluded "
"prices <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`. However, "
"each :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` can only be assigned to "
"one website at a time. If you want to use the same pricelist on several "
"websites, duplicate the pricelist and assign each copy to its corresponding "
"website."
msgstr ""
"設定是針對特定網站的，這意味著可以為每個網站配置不同的行為。例如，您可以設定"
"一個允許\\ :ref:`訪客結帳 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`\\ 並"
"顯示\\ :ref:`含稅價格 <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`\\ 的 B2C 網"
"站，以及一個需要\\ :ref:`登入 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>`\\ 並顯示\\ :ref:`未稅價格 <ecommerce-price-management-tax-"
"display>`\\ 的 B2B 網站。但是，每個\\ :ref:`價目表 <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`\\ 一次只能分配給一個網站。如果您想在多個網站上使用同一個價目表，"
"請複製價目表並將每個副本分配給對應的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:101
msgid ""
"If you are running a B2B and B2C business, we *strongly* recommend to create "
"two :doc:`separate websites </applications/websites/website/configuration/"
"multi_website>` and assign a :ref:`zero-priced pricelist <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/"
"prices>` to the B2B website and a regular pricelist to the B2C website. In "
"case, you prefer using a single website, configure it using :ref:`country "
"groups <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` and assigning :ref:`pricelists "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` to customers, and deactivate "
"the :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>` option."
msgstr ""
"如果您同時經營 B2B 與 B2C 業務，我們*強烈*建議建立兩個\\ :doc:`獨立網站 </"
"applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website>`，並將\\ :ref:`零"
"價格價目表 <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>`\\ 指派給 B2B 網站，將一般價目表指派給 "
"B2C 網站。若您偏好使用單一網站，請使用\\ :ref:`國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/"
"prices/country-groups>`\\ 進行配置，並將\\ :ref:`價目表 <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`\\ 指派給顧客，同時停用\\ :ref:`可選取 <ecommerce/prices/"
"selectable-pricelists>`\\ 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:113
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:30
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:3
msgid "Additional features"
msgstr "附加功能"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:118
msgid "Invoice"
msgstr "發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:120
msgid ""
"Depending on the type of business (B2B or B2C), you might want to issue an "
"invoice. An invoice can either be generated automatically (for B2B) or on "
"demand of the customer (for B2C). This process can be automated if (and "
"when) the online payment is :ref:`confirmed <ecommerce/handling/sales>`. To "
"automate invoicing, enable the :ref:`Automatic Invoice <ecommerce/handling/"
"invoices>` setting. If this feature has not been enabled, the customer only "
"receives an order confirmation."
msgstr ""
"根據業務類型（B2B 或 B2C），您可能需要開立發票。發票可以自動產生（B2B）或依客"
"戶要求開立（B2C）。此流程可以在線上付款:ref:`確認 <ecommerce/handling/sales>`"
"時（如果有）自動執行。若要自動開立發票，請啟用\\ :ref:`自動發票 <ecommerce/"
"handling/invoices>`\\ 設定。如果未啟用此功能，客戶僅會收到訂單確認。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:127
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Pay on Invoice <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-invoice>` payment method "
"allows customers to place an order without upfront payment and pay after "
"they receive the invoice."
msgstr ""
"\\ :ref:`支付發票 <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-invoice>`\\ 付款方式允許顧客在無"
"需預付款的情況下下訂單，並在收到發票後付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:133
msgid "B2B fields at checkout"
msgstr "結帳時的 B2B 欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:135
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Order summary` page, open the :doc:`website editor </"
"applications/websites/website/web_design>`, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, "
"and toggle the :guilabel:`Show B2B Fields` switch to display B2B-specific "
"additional fields like :guilabel:`VAT` or :guilabel:`Company Name` during "
"the :ref:`delivery <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>` step."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`訂單摘要`\\ 頁面上，開啟\\ :doc:`網站編輯器 </applications/"
"websites/website/web_design>`，前往\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 分頁，並切換"
"\\ :guilabel:`顯示 B2B 欄位`\\ 開關，以便在\\ :ref:`配送 <ecommerce/checkout/"
"delivery>`\\ 步驟中顯示 B2B 專屬的額外欄位，例如\\ :guilabel:`VAT`\\ 或"
"\\ :guilabel:`公司名稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce provides multiple ways to configure, :doc:`present <../../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`, and sell different product options to "
"customers while organizing products by category for a better overview and "
"smoother navigation."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 電子商務提供多種方式來配置、\\ :doc:`呈現 <../../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/catalog>`\\ 和銷售不同的產品選項給客戶，同時按類別組織產品，"
"以獲得更好的概覽和更流暢的導覽。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:12
msgid "Product variants"
msgstr "產品款式變體"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:14
msgid ""
":doc:`Product variants </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/"
"variants>` are different versions of the same product, created by "
"combining :ref:`attributes <products/variants/attributes>` like color, size, "
"material, etc., which can lead to differences in price and/or availability."
