"b2b_b2c/prices>`\\ 企業特別有用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:67
msgid ""
"It is possible to configure a website form with a :guilabel:`Create a "
"Customer` :ref:`action <building_blocks/forms/action>` to automatically "
"create a customer record in the backend when filled in."
