"也可以定義客戶能存取的文件類型。若要這樣做，請按一下網站右上角的使用者名稱，"
"選擇\\ :guilabel:`我的帳戶`\\ 並開啟\\ :doc:`網站建置器 </applications/"
"websites/website/web_design>`。在\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 分頁上，根據需要啟用或"
"停用對特定文件的存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:95
msgid "Shop access"
msgstr "商店存取權限"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:97
msgid ""
"To restrict access to the entire online shop for users who are not logged-"
"in, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section and under :guilabel:`Ecommerce Access`, "
"select :guilabel:`Logged in users`. Select :guilabel:`All users` if the shop "
"should be visible to every website visitor."
msgstr ""
"若要限制未登入使用者存取整個線上商店，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 "
"--> 設定`\\ ，捲動至\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 區段，在\\ :guilabel:`電子商務"
"存取`\\ 下選擇\\ :guilabel:`已登入使用者`\\ 。若商店應對所有網站訪客可見，請"
"選擇\\ :guilabel:`所有使用者`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:103
msgid ""
"To restrict access to the shop's pricing, use :ref:`pricelists <ecommerce/"
"prices/pricelists>` with :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>`."
msgstr ""
"若要限制對商店價格的存取，請使用\\ :ref:`價目表 <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`搭配\\ :ref:`國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:109
msgid "Checkout access"
msgstr "結帳存取權限"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:111
msgid ""
"To allow customers to checkout as guests or force them to sign in/create an "
"account, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, "
"scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and configure "
"the :guilabel:`Sign in/up at checkout` setting. The following options are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"若要允許客戶以訪客身分結帳或強制他們登入/建立帳戶，請前往\\ :menuselection:`"
"網站 ‣ 配置 ‣ 設定`，向下捲動至\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 區段，並配置"
"\\ :guilabel:`結帳時登入/註冊`\\ 設定。可用的選項如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Optional`: Customers can check out as guests and register later "
"via the order confirmation email to track their order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`選填`：顧客可以以訪客身分結帳，稍後透過訂單確認電子郵件註冊以追蹤"
"其訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Disabled`: Customers can checkout as guests without creating an "
"account."
msgstr ":guilabel:`停用`\\ ：客戶可以訪客身分結帳，無需建立帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mandatory`: Customers must sign in or create an account at "
"the :ref:`Order summary <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` step to complete "
"their purchase."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`必填`：客戶必須在\\ :ref:`訂單摘要 <ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order>`\\ 步驟登入或建立帳戶才能完成購買。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:123
msgid ""
"Customer contacts created through guest checkout are :guilabel:`Archived` in "
"the backend by default. Once the customer creates an account, the relevant "
"contact form becomes unarchived."
msgstr ""
"透過訪客結帳建立的客戶聯絡人，預設會在後台\\ :guilabel:`封存`\\。一旦客戶建立"
"帳戶，相關的聯絡人表單就會解除封存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:125
msgid ""
"Settings are specific to each website, allowing you to configure a B2C "
"website with guest checkout and a B2B website that requires customers to "
"sign in."
msgstr ""
"設定針對每個網站各別配置，讓您可以配置具訪客結帳功能的 B2C 網站，以及需要客戶"
"登入的 B2B 網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:127
msgid ""
"To use the :ref:`wishlist <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"wishlists>` feature, customers must create an account to save their favorite "
"items for later."
msgstr ""
"若要使用\\ :ref:`願望清單 <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"wishlists>`\\ 功能，顧客必須建立帳戶以儲存他們喜愛的項目供日後查看。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:133
msgid "Multi-website account"
msgstr "多網站帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:135
msgid ""
"When managing multiple websites, it is possible to make customer accounts "
"available across *all* websites, allowing each customer to use a single "
"account. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, in the :guilabel:`General` section, enable the :guilabel:`Shared "
"Customer Accounts` option."
msgstr ""
"管理多個網站時，可以讓客戶帳戶在\\ *所有*\\ 網站上可用，讓每位客戶使用單一帳"
"戶。若要這樣做，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`\\ ，在"
"\\ :guilabel:`一般`\\ 區段中啟用\\ :guilabel:`共用客戶帳戶`\\ 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:141
msgid ""
"When operating both :ref:`B2B and B2C online shops <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/"
"multiple-websites>`, it is recommended to use separate websites for each "
"business model."
msgstr ""
"同時經營\\ :ref:`B2B 和 B2C 線上商店 <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>`"
"時，建議為每種商業模式使用個別的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo offers multiple options for configuring prices in e-commerce. For "
"example, you can apply :ref:`prices per unit <ecommerce/prices/price-per-"
"unit>`, offer :ref:`discounts <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`, and set "
"up :ref:`pricelists <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 為電子商務中的價格設定提供了多種選項。例如，您可以套用\\ :ref:`單位價格 "
"<ecommerce/prices/price-per-unit>`，提供\\ :ref:`折扣 <ecommerce/prices/"
"discounts>`，以及設定\\ :ref:`價目表 <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:12
msgid "Taxes"
msgstr "稅項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:14
msgid ""
"To add a tax on a product, you can either set a tax in the :guilabel:`Sales "
"Taxes` field of the product form or use :doc:`fiscal positions </"
"applications/finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>`."
msgstr ""
"若要在產品上加入稅項，您可以在產品表單的\\ :guilabel:`銷售稅`\\ 欄位中設定稅"
"項，或使用\\ :doc:`財務規則 </applications/finance/accounting/taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>`。"

