#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:56
msgid ""
":ref:`Navigate to the product form <ecommerce/products/product-creation>`."
msgstr ":ref:`前往產品表單 <ecommerce/products/product-creation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:57
msgid ""
"Set the product's :guilabel:`Sales Price` and select the unit "
