msgstr ""
"設定產品的\\ :guilabel:`銷售價格`\\ 並選擇單位（例如\\ :guilabel:`件`\\ ）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:58
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Base Unit Count` field, enter the number of units in the "
"product."
msgstr "在\\ :guilabel:`基本單位數量`\\ 欄位中，輸入產品中的單位數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:59
msgid "Select the relevant unit from the drop-down list."
