msgstr "假設您想以 $60 的價格出售 2 公升油漆桶，即每公升 $30。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:64
msgid "Cost per unit pricing on the product form."
msgstr "產品表單上的單位成本定價。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:67
