#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:81
msgid "Pricelists"
msgstr "價格表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:83
msgid ""
"Pricelists in Odoo allow for managing flexible pricing rules and offering "
"different prices and discounts based on currencies, time periods, purchase "
"volumes, :ref:`customers' location <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, and/or "
"customer type."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 中的價目表允許管理靈活的定價規則，並根據貨幣、時間段、購買量、\\ "
":ref:`客戶所在位置 <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`\\ 和/或客戶類型來提供不同的價格"
"和折扣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:87
msgid ""
"To enable pricelists for eCommerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Pricelists`, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then, "
"click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Pricelists` or go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Pricelists` and :ref:`configure "
"<sales/products/pricelist-configuration>` the relevant pricelists."
msgstr ""
"要為電子商務啟用價目表，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 設定 --> 設定`\\，"
"向下捲動至\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 區塊，啟用\\ :guilabel:`價目表`\\，然後\\"
" :guilabel:`儲存`\\。然後，按一下\\ :icon:`fa-arrow-right`\\ :guilabel:`價目"
"表`\\，或者前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 電子商務 --> 價目表`\\，並\\ "
":ref:`設定 <sales/products/pricelist-configuration>`\\ 相關價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:93
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, configure options specific to online "
"sales, such as assigning a :guilabel:`Website` to a pricelist, allowing "
"customers to :ref:`select it <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`, and/"
"or adding an :ref:`E-commerce Promotional Code <ecommerce/prices/promotional-"
"code>`."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 分頁中，配置線上銷售的特定選項，例如將"
"\\ :guilabel:`網站`\\ 指派給價目表、允許客戶\\ :ref:`選擇價目表 <ecommerce/"
"prices/selectable-pricelists>`\\ ，和/或加入\\ :ref:`電子商務促銷代碼 "
"<ecommerce/prices/promotional-code>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:99
msgid ""
"If you are using several websites and want to use the same pricelist on "
"several of them, you need to duplicate the pricelist for each website. If "
"you do not assign any website, the pricelist will not be used, unless it "
"is :ref:`selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用多個網站，並且想在其中幾個網站上使用相同的價目表，則需要為每個網站"
"複製該價目表。如果您未指派任何網站，則不會使用該價目表，除非它是\\ :ref:`可選"
"擇的 <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:103
msgid ""
"Pricelists can also be :ref:`assigned to a specific customer <sales/pricing/"
"customer-pricelist-application>`."
msgstr ""
"價目表也可以\\ :ref:`指派給特定客戶 <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:107
msgid ""
"When pricelists are enabled in the Sales app, they are automatically enabled "
"in the eCommerce app, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"當在銷售應用程式中啟用價目表時，它們會自動在電子商務應用程式中啟用，反之亦"
"然。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:109
msgid ""
"In the list of pricelists, order the pricelists by priority: the first takes "
"precedence over the second, the second over the third, and so on."
msgstr ""
"在價目表清單中，按優先順序排列價目表：第一個優先於第二個，第二個優先於第三"
"個，依此類推。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:111
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create specific pricelists for :ref:`variants "
"<products/variants/configure-variants>`."
msgstr ""
"也可以針對\\ :ref:`變體 <products/variants/configure-variants>`\\ 建立特定的"
"價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:115
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:120
msgid "Selectable pricelists"
msgstr "可選擇的價格表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:122
msgid ""
"Selectable pricelists are useful, for example, when selling products "
"in :doc:`multiple currencies <../../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"currencies>`, and allow customers to choose a pricelist using the pricelist "
"selector in the catalog, located next to the :ref:`search bar <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar-and-filters>`."
msgstr ""
"可選價目表非常實用，例如在以\\ :doc:`多種貨幣 <../../../sales/sales/"
"products_prices/prices/currencies>`\\ 銷售產品時，它允許客戶使用型錄中的價目"
"表選擇器選擇價目表，該選擇器位於\\ :ref:`搜尋列 <ecommerce/catalog/toolbar-"
"and-filters>`\\ 旁邊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:127
msgid "Pricelist selector on the e-commerce."
msgstr "電子商務上的價目表選擇器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:130
msgid "To make a pricelist selectable, enable :guilabel:`Selectable`."
msgstr "若要使價目表可供選擇，請啟用\\ :guilabel:`可選`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:133
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is designated as :guilabel:`Selectable` and not assigned to a "
"specific website, it is selectable on **all** websites."
msgstr ""
"如果價目表被指定為\\ :guilabel:`可選`\\，且未指派給特定網站，則它在**所有**網"
"站上皆可選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:135
msgid ""
"If a pricelist does *not* appear in the selector, it may be due to the "
"following situations:"
msgstr "若價目表*未*出現在選擇器中，可能是由於以下情況："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:137
msgid ""
"Only one pricelist is defined as :guilabel:`Selectable`, and "
"the :ref:`contact has a pricelist assigned <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>`."
msgstr ""
"只有一個價目表定義為\\ :guilabel:`可選`\\，且該\\ :ref:`聯絡人已指派價目表 "
"<sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:139
msgid ""
"Multiple selectable pricelists exist, but only those matching the "
"customer's :ref:`country group <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` are shown. "
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when "
"using pricelists with country groups on the e-commerce."
msgstr ""
"存在多個可選擇的價目表，但僅顯示與客戶\\ :ref:`國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/"
"prices/country-groups>`\\ 相符的價目表。在電子商務上使用帶有國家/地區群組的價"
"目表時，強烈建議停用\\ :guilabel:`可選擇`\\ 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:145
msgid ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"
msgstr ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:150
msgid "GeoIP & country groups"
msgstr "GeoIP 與國家/地區群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:152
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a specific pricelist based on the visitor's "
"location and IP address by assigning :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/"
"country-groups>` to pricelists."
msgstr ""
"可透過為價目表分配\\ :ref:`國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>`\\ ，根據訪客的位置和 IP 位址顯示特定價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:157
msgid ""
"To do so, :ref:`navigate to the relevant pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` and select the appropriate :guilabel:`Country Groups`. Create "
"or edit as many pricelists for specific regions as needed. For instance, "
"select :guilabel:`European Union` to apply the pricelist to all EU member "
"states."
msgstr ""
"為此，請\\ :ref:`前往相關價目表表單 <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`\\ ，並選擇"
"適當的\\ :guilabel:`國家/地區群組`\\ 。根據需要為特定地區建立或編輯多份價目"
"表。例如，選擇\\ :guilabel:`歐盟`\\ 可將價目表套用於所有歐盟成員國。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:162
msgid ""
"To create a new country group, click :guilabel:`Search more` in the drop-"
"down list, then :guilabel:`Create New`. Add a :guilabel:`Group Name` and "
"select the relevant :guilabel:`Countries`. Use :ref:`Custom filters <search/"
"custom-filters>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的國家群組，請按一下下拉式清單中的\\ :guilabel:`搜尋更多`\\，然後按\\"
" :guilabel:`建立新項目`\\。新增\\ :guilabel:`群組名稱`\\ 並選擇相關的\\ "
":guilabel:`國家`\\。如有需要，請使用\\ :ref:`自訂篩選器 <search/custom-"
"filters>`\\。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:167
msgid "Each country group must contain at least one country."
msgstr "每個國家/地區群組必須至少包含一個國家/地區。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:170
msgid ""
"Use the following filter to add all non-EU countries to the country group."
msgstr "使用以下篩選器，將所有非歐盟國家新增至該國家群組中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:172
msgid "`Country Groups` + `is not equal to` + `European Union`"
msgstr "「國家/地區群組」+「不等於」+「歐盟」"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:174
msgid "Filter for country group creation."
msgstr "建立國家/地區群組的篩選條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:178
msgid ""
"When using GeoIP to determine the appropriate pricelist, **all** pricelists "
"used on the e-commerce site must have a country group assigned."
msgstr ""
"當使用 GeoIP 來確定適用的價目表時，電子商務網站上使用的\\ \\ **所有\\**\\ 價"
"目表都必須指定國家群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:180
msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when "
"using pricelists with country groups. Indeed, all pricelists with the "
"relevant country group are automatically applied to the catalog, but if one "
"of them is marked as :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-"
"pricelists>`, the others will disappear as soon as customers select the "
"selectable pricelist."
msgstr ""
"強烈建議在使用含有國家/地區群組的價目表時停用\\ :guilabel:`可選`\\ 選項。事實"
"上，所有含有相關國家/地區群組的價目表都會自動套用至目錄，但如果其中一份被標記"
"為\\ :ref:`可選 <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`\\ ，則一旦顧客選擇"
"該可選價目表，其他價目表將會消失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:187
msgid "Imagine you create three pricelists:"
msgstr "假設您建立了三份價目表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:189
msgid "`EU regular prices` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr "「歐盟一般價格」，已分配「歐盟」國家/地區群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:190
msgid "`EU prices with discounts` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr "「歐盟折扣價格」，已分配「歐盟」國家/地區群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:191
msgid "`US prices` with the `US` country group assigned"
msgstr "「美國價格」，已分配「美國」國家/地區群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:193
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Selectable` option is enabled for `EU regular prices` and "
"`US prices`, and the customer is from the European Union, only the "
"pricelists `EU regular prices` and `EU prices with discounts` will be "
"available. However, since the `EU prices with discount` list is not "
"selectable, it will disappear once the customer selects the `EU regular "
"prices` list, and prices will be displayed based on the `EU regular prices` "
"pricelist in the catalog."
msgstr ""
"如果為「歐盟一般價格」和「美國價格」啟用了\\ :guilabel:`可選`\\ 選項，且顧客"
"來自歐盟，則只有「歐盟一般價格」和「歐盟折扣價格」可用。然而，由於「歐盟折扣"
"價格」清單不可選，一旦顧客選擇「歐盟一般價格」清單，它將會消失，且目錄上的價"
"格將根據「歐盟一般價格」價目表顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:200
msgid "Pricelist application"
msgstr "價目表套用"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:202
msgid ""
"On the e-commerce, the *default* pricelist is automatically selected for "
"public, non-logged-in users when no country group is assigned. "
"If :ref:`GeoIP and country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` are used, public "
"users see the pricelist of their country group by default."
msgstr ""
"在電子商務上，當未指定國家群組時，系統會自動為公開、未登入的使用者選取\\ \\* "
"預設 \\*\\ 價目表。若使用\\ :ref:`GeoIP 與國家群組 <ecommerce/prices/geoip>"
"`，公開使用者預設會看到其所在國家群組的價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:206
msgid ""
":ref:`Logged-in users <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"with :ref:`assigned pricelists <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>` see the assigned pricelist by default **if it is assigned to "
"the website** they are visiting. If not, the website's default pricelist is "
"applied (i.e., the first available pricelist assigned to the website and "
"without a country group, following the sequence order)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`登入的使用者 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>`若設有\\ "
":ref:`指定價目表 <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>`，預設會看到"
"該指定價目表，\\ \\* 前提是它已指定給他們正在瀏覽的網站 \\*\\ 。否則，系統會"
"應用網站的預設價目表（即，順序中第一個可用且未指定國家群組的網站價目表）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:212
msgid ""
"Assigned pricelists take precedence over country-based pricelists, when "
"applicable, unless the assigned pricelist is linked to a different country "
"group."
msgstr ""
"指派的價格表優先於基於國家/地區的價格表（如適用），除非指派的價格表已連結至不"
"同的國家/地區群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:216
msgid ""
"A customer from the United States visits the website. They do not have a "
"portal account. The :guilabel:`United States` pricelist is applied."
msgstr ""
"來自美國的客戶訪問網站。他們沒有門戶網站帳戶。系統套用\\ :guilabel:`美國`\\ "
"價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:219
msgid ""
"A different visitor, also from the United States, has the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` pricelist assigned in their contact form. This assignment "
"takes precedence over the country group assignment, so the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` is applied."
msgstr ""
"另一位也來自美國的訪客，在其聯絡人表單中指定了\\ :guilabel:`忠誠客戶折扣`\\ "
"價目表。此指定會優先於國家群組指定，因此系統會應用\\ :guilabel:`忠誠客戶折"
"扣`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:223
msgid "An example of various pricelists assigned to a website."
msgstr "指派給網站的各種價格表範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:230
msgid "Discounts"
msgstr "折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:235
msgid "Discounts programs"
msgstr "折扣方案"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:237
msgid ""
"To enable :doc:`discount programs </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>` for your e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, and enable the :guilabel:`Discounts, Loyalty & Gift Card` feature."
msgstr ""
"若要為您的電子商務啟用\\ :doc:`折扣計畫 </applications/sales/sales/"
"products_prices/loyalty_discount>`，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --"
"> 設定`，向下捲動至\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 區段，然後啟用\\ :guilabel:`折"
"扣、忠誠度與禮品卡`\\ 功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:241
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>` the discount "
"program, make sure the :guilabel:`Website` option is enabled, and add the "
"relevant :ref:`Pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` "
"and :guilabel:`Website` on the program form, if needed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`設定 <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>`折扣方案時，請確保已啟"
"用\\ :guilabel:`網站`\\ 選項，並根據需要在方案表單上新增相關的\\ :ref:`價目"
"表 <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`與\\ :guilabel:`網站`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:248
msgid "Permanent product discount"
msgstr "永久產品折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:250
msgid ""
"When the price of a specific product is permanently reduced, the "
"strikethrough strategy is commonly used. This involves showing the new "
"discounted price, with the original price crossed out alongside it."
msgstr ""
"當特定產品的價格永久調降時，通常會使用刪除線策略。這涉及顯示新的折扣後價格，"
"並在旁邊劃掉原價。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:254
msgid "Price strikethrough."
msgstr "價格刪除線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:257
msgid ""
"To display a permanently discounted price, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable the :guilabel:`Comparison Price` "
"option, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then :ref:`go to the product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>`, enter the new (discounted) price in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field, and the original price (strikethrough) in "
"the :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field."
msgstr ""
"若要顯示永久折扣價格，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`，向下"
"捲動到\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`，啟用\\ :guilabel:`比較價格`\\ 選項，然後"
"\\ :guilabel:`儲存`。然後，:ref:`前往產品表單 <ecommerce/products/product-"
"creation>`，在\\ :guilabel:`銷售價格`\\ 欄位中輸入新的（折扣）價格，並在"
"\\ :guilabel:`比較價格`\\ 欄位中輸入原始價格（刪除線）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:264
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field must contain a price that is higher "
"than the :guilabel:`Sales Price` for the original price to appear with a "
"strikethrough."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`比較價格`\\ 欄位必須包含高於\\ :guilabel:`銷售價格`\\ 的價格，才能"
"讓原價以刪除線顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:268
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` is not displayed if discounted pricelists "
"apply. If you want to use the :guilabel:`Compare to price` with another "
"discount, configure a pricelist with a :ref:`promotional code <ecommerce/"
"prices/promotional-code>`."
msgstr ""
"如果適用折扣價格表，則不會顯示\\ :guilabel:`比較價格`\\ 。如果您想將"
"\\ :guilabel:`比較價格`\\ 與其他折扣搭配使用，請配置包含\\ :ref:`促銷代碼 "
"<ecommerce/prices/promotional-code>`\\ 的價格表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:273
msgid "Discounted pricelists"
msgstr "折扣價格表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:275
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create :ref:`pricelists with discounts <sales/"
"products/price-rules>`. To do so, :ref:`create a pricelist <sales/products/"
"pricelist-configuration>` and :ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/"
"price-rules>`."
msgstr ""
"也可以建立\\ :ref:`含折扣的價格表 <sales/products/price-rules>`\\ 。為此，請"
"\\ :ref:`建立價格表 <sales/products/pricelist-configuration>`\\ 並\\ :ref:`配"
"置折扣 <sales/products/price-rules>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:279
msgid ""
"If a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` contains "
"a :ref:`Discount <sales/products/price-rules>` price type, the price is "
"striked through for applicable customers, even if the :ref:`Comparison Price "
"<ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>` feature has not been enabled."
msgstr ""
"如果\\ :ref:`價格表 <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`\\ 包含\\ :ref:`折扣 "
"<sales/products/price-rules>`\\ 價格類型，則對於符合資格的客戶，價格會以刪除"
"線顯示，即使未啟用\\ :ref:`比較價格 <ecommerce/prices/permanent-"
"discounts>`\\ 功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:285
msgid ""
"If using pricelists with :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, the "
"discounted pricelist must be assigned the same country group as the non-"
"discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"若使用帶有\\ :ref:`國家群組 <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`的價目表，折扣價目表必須"
"指定與非折扣價目表相同的國家群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:291
msgid "E-commerce promotional code"
msgstr "電子商務促銷代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:293
msgid ""
"To offer a discounted pricelist for customers with a specific discount code, "
"access the relevant :ref:`pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`, go "
"to the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, and add an :guilabel:`E-commerce "
"Promotional Code`, e.g., `SUMMERSALE10%`."
msgstr ""
"若要為擁有特定折扣代碼的客戶提供折扣價目表，請存取相關的\\ :ref:`價目表表單 "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`，前往\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 分頁，並新增\\ "
":guilabel:`電子商務促銷代碼`，例如\\ `SUMMERSALE10%`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, go to the :guilabel:`Rules` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, "
"and :ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/price-rules>`. When a "
"customer enters the code during :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order>`, the discount is applied according to the configuration in "
"the :guilabel:`Rules` tab."
msgstr ""
"然後，前往\\ :guilabel:`規則`\\ 分頁，按一下\\ :guilabel:`新增一行`，並\\ "
":ref:`設定折扣 <sales/products/price-rules>`。當客戶在\\ :ref:`結帳 "
"<ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`時輸入代碼，折扣會根據\\ :guilabel:`規則`\\"
" 分頁中的設定而應用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:303
msgid ""
"Make sure that the :ref:`Promo Code <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` "
"option in the website editor is enabled and, if using :ref:`country groups "
"<ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, that the discounted pricelist has the "
"same country group assigned as the non-discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"確保網站編輯器中的\\ :ref:`促銷代碼 <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`\\ 選項"
"已啟用，並且如果使用\\ :ref:`國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>`\\ ，折扣價格表必須指派與非折扣價格表相同的國家/地區群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:310
msgid "Preventing direct sales and hiding prices"
msgstr "防止直接銷售及隱藏價格"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:312
msgid ""
"Some businesses, such as :ref:`B2B shops <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` or "
"companies that sell luxury or custom items, may want to showcase their "
"products online while restricting direct purchases and hiding prices."
msgstr ""
"有些企業（例如\\ :ref:`B2B 商店 <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>`，或是銷售奢華品或"
"客製化商品的公司）可能會希望在線上展示其產品，同時限制直接購買並隱藏價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:316
msgid ""
"To control price visibility and prevent direct online sales on the e-"
"commerce site, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Hide Add To Cart`."
msgstr ""
