"表 <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`，將所有產品價格設為 `0`。此時，產品頁面上\\"
" \\ **不\\**\\ 會顯示價格。請參閱\\ :doc:`產品頁面 <../ecommerce_design/"
"product_page>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:329
msgid ""
