":guilabel:`類別`。至少\\ \\ **必須\\**\\ 選擇一個類別。只有當這些類別中產品的"
"價格\\ \\ **不\\**\\ 為 `0` 時，才會顯示價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:337
msgid ""
"Then, enter a redirect URL in the :guilabel:`Link URL` field. "
