"的\\ :doc:`產品頁面 <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`上的\\ :guilabel:`聯絡"
"我們`\\ 按鈕所取代，該按鈕可根據需要\\ :ref:`自訂 <ecommerce/checkout/"
"prevent-sale>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:343
msgid ""
"Ensure no pricelist used on the e-commerce has been marked "
"as :guilabel:`Selectable` to prevent accidentally displaying the zero-priced "
"pricelist."
msgstr ""
"確保電子商務上使用的任何價目表都未標記為\\ :guilabel:`可選擇`，以防止意外顯示"
