"creation>`\\ 並管理其在網站上的\\ :ref:`可見性 <ecommerce/products/publish-"
"products>`。產品可以以各種方式進行\\ :ref:`配置 <ecommerce/products/product-"
"configuration>`，包括加入\\ :ref:`產品圖片和影片 <ecommerce/products/"
"images>`、建立\\ :ref:`產品組合 <ecommerce/products/combos>`、實施\\ :ref:`交"
"叉銷售和向上銷售策略 <ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`、附加\\ :ref:`數位"
"檔案 <ecommerce/products/digital-files>`、:ref:`翻譯 <ecommerce/products/"
"translation>`\\ 產品資訊、:ref:`管理庫存 <ecommerce/products/stock-"
"management>`\\ 和設定\\ :ref:`包裝選項 <ecommerce/products/stock-management/"
"packagings>`。"

