#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:87
msgid ""
"To create product tags on your e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Products`, and select the product you want to create a tag "
"for. On the product form, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, then, "
"in the :guilabel:`Tags` field, select a tag or :guilabel:`Create and edit` "
"one. On the :guilabel:`Create Tags` pop-up, add a :guilabel:`Tag` name, "
"toggle the :guilabel:`Visible to customers` switch on/off, and select "
"a :guilabel:`Color`. Optionally, add an image. Then go to the product form, "
"and assign the relevant tags where needed."
msgstr ""

