#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:123
msgid "Page organization options and additional features"
msgstr "頁面組織選項和其他功能"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:125
msgid ""
"Toggle the following options on/off to enable or disable features across all "
"product pages:"
msgstr "切換以下選項以在所有產品頁面上啟用或停用功能："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:127
msgid ":guilabel:`Separators`: Organize the page and improve visual clarity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`分隔線`：組織頁面並改善視覺清晰度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Indication`: Indicate whether the price is :ref:`VAT included "
"or excluded <ecommerce/prices/taxes>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`稅金說明`：指出價格是\\ :ref:`含稅還是未稅 <ecommerce/prices/"
"taxes>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Display the tags created in the :ref:`backend <ecommerce/"
"catalog/filters>` on product pages and enable customers to filter products "
"by those tags."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`標籤`：在產品頁面上顯示在\\ :ref:`後端 <ecommerce/catalog/"
"filters>`\\ 建立的標籤，並允許客戶依這些標籤篩選產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:132
