"\\ :guilabel:`客戶評論`\\ 區段，並按一下\\ :icon:`fa-plus`（:guilabel:`加號"
"`）圖示。然後，他們可以使用\\ :icon:`fa-star-o`（:guilabel:`星號`）圖示選擇評"
"分並留下評論。:icon:`fa-star`（:guilabel:`星號`）評分會直接顯示在產品名稱下"
"方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Search Bar`: Display a search bar that can be shown or hidden "
"independently from the :ref:`shop page <ecommerce/catalog/toolbar>`."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`搜尋列`\\ ：顯示搜尋列，可以獨立於\\ :ref:`商店頁面 <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar>`\\ 顯示或隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:142
msgid ""
":ref:`Ribbon <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>` (or "
"badge): Highlight a specific product."
msgstr ""
"\\ :ref:`緞帶 <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>`\\ "
"（或徽章）：突出顯示特定產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:146
msgid ""
"It is possible to enable additional features and display information "
"previously configured in the backend:"
msgstr "可以啟用其他功能並顯示先前在後端中配置的資訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:149
msgid ""
":ref:`Click & Collect <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>`: Show the order "
"pick-up location and delivery availability on the product page, and allow "
"customers to select the desired pick-up point."
msgstr ""
":ref:`線上訂購到店取貨 <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>`：在產品頁面上顯示"
"訂單取貨地點與配送可用性，並允許顧客選擇所需的取貨點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:152
msgid ""
":ref:`Description <ecommerce/products/description>`: Display an e-commerce-"
"specific product description right under the product name."
msgstr ""
"\\ :ref:`說明 <ecommerce/products/description>`\\ ：在產品名稱下方直接顯示電"
