"To view all quotations and orders, navigate to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Orders`. By default, the :guilabel:`Confirmed` filter is "
"enabled. Remove this filter to display all records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:28
msgid ""
"The dashboard at the top of the :guilabel:`Orders` page provides a summary "
"of the orders and includes the following filter buttons:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Fulfill`: confirmed and paid orders (i.e., :ref:`sales orders "
"<ecommerce/handling/sales-sales-order>`)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`待履行`：已確認且已付款的訂單（即\\ :ref:`銷售訂單 <ecommerce/"
"handling/sales-sales-order>`）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Confirm`: unpaid and unconfirmed orders (i.e., :ref:`sent but "
"unconfirmed quotations <ecommerce/handling/sales-quotation-sent>`)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`待確認`：未付款且未確認的訂單（即\\ :ref:`已發送但未確認的報價單 "
"<ecommerce/handling/sales-quotation-sent>`）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Invoice`: confirmed orders that are ready for invoicing but "
"have not necessarily been fulfilled (i.e., :ref:`sales orders <ecommerce/"
"handling/sales-sales-order>`)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`待開立發票`：已確認且準備好開立發票但未必已履行的訂單（即\\ "
":ref:`銷售訂單 <ecommerce/handling/sales-sales-order>`）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:38
msgid ""
"The number of :guilabel:`Visitors`, :guilabel:`Orders`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` amount for a given period is displayed on the right "
"side of the :guilabel:`Orders` page dashboard."
msgstr ""
"特定期間的\\ :guilabel:`訪客`數、\\ :guilabel:`訂單`數以及\\ :guilabel:`銷售"
"額`會顯示在\\ :guilabel:`訂單` 頁面儀表板的右側。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:41
msgid "Orders dashboard."
msgstr "訂單儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:44
msgid ""
"To view the details of a specific order, select it from the list. The status "
"bar at the top of the order form shows its current status in the sales flow:"
msgstr ""
"若要檢視特定訂單的詳細資訊，請從列表中選擇該訂單。訂單表單頂部的狀態列會顯示"
"其在銷售流程中的目前狀態："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quotation`: A product has been :ref:`added to the cart <ecommerce/"
"checkout/add-to-cart>`, but the customer has not yet completed "
"the :ref:`checkout process <ecommerce/checkout/steps>`. If the customer is "
"not logged in, the quotation is assigned to the default *Public User* "
"contact."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`報價單`：產品已:ref:`加入購物車 <ecommerce/checkout/add-to-"
"cart>`，但客戶尚未完成:ref:`結帳流程 <ecommerce/checkout/steps>`。如果客戶未"
"登入，報價單會指派給預設的「*公開使用者*」聯絡人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quotation Sent`: The customer has completed the :ref:`checkout "
"process <ecommerce/checkout/steps>`, but the :ref:`payment <ecommerce/"
"checkout/payment>` has not yet been confirmed (orders with this status are "
"displayed when the :guilabel:`To Confirm` :ref:`dashboard button <ecommerce/"
"handling/sales-dashboard>` is selected)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`報價單已發送`：客戶已完成\\ :ref:`結帳流程 <ecommerce/checkout/"
"steps>`，但尚未確認\\ :ref:`付款 <ecommerce/checkout/payment>`（當選擇\\ "
":guilabel:`待確認`\\ :ref:`儀表板按鈕 <ecommerce/handling/sales-dashboard>` "
"時，會顯示具有此狀態的訂單）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Order`: The customer has completed the :ref:`checkout "
"process <ecommerce/checkout/steps>`, and the :ref:`payment <ecommerce/"
"checkout/payment>` has been successfully received (orders with this status "
"are displayed when the :guilabel:`To Fulfill` or :guilabel:`To "
"Invoice` :ref:`dashboard buttons <ecommerce/handling/sales-dashboard>` are "
"selected, depending on the configured workflow)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售訂單`：客戶已完成\\ :ref:`結帳流程 <ecommerce/checkout/steps>"
"`，並且已成功收到\\ :ref:`付款 <ecommerce/checkout/payment>`（視設定的流程而"
"定，當選擇\\ :guilabel:`待履行` 或\\ :guilabel:`待開立發票`\\ :ref:`儀表板按"
"鈕 <ecommerce/handling/sales-dashboard>` 時，會顯示具有此狀態的訂單）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:70
msgid ""
"This three-step process is not visible to customers. However, they can view "
"their orders and check their status through the customer :doc:`portal </"
"applications/general/users/user_portals>`."
msgstr ""
"此三步驟流程對客戶不可見。然而，客戶可以透過客戶\\ :doc:`門戶網站 </"
"applications/general/users/user_portals>`\\ 檢視訂單並查看其狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:73
msgid ""
"If the customer pays via :ref:`wire transfer <payment_providers/"
"bank_payments/wire_transfer>`, the quotation is *not* automatically "
"confirmed. In this case, the customer receives a notification on "
"the :guilabel:`My account` page of their :doc:`customer account "
"<configuration/customer_accounts>` to review and pay for the order. After "
"the payment is received, the order must be manually confirmed in the backend."
msgstr ""
"如果客戶透過\\ :ref:`電匯 <payment_providers/bank_payments/wire_transfer>`\\ "
"付款，報價單*不會*自動確認。在這種情況下，客戶會在其\\ :doc:`客戶帳戶 "
"<configuration/customer_accounts>`\\ 的\\ :guilabel:`我的帳戶`\\ 頁面上收到通"
"知，以查看並支付訂單。收到付款後，必須在後端手動確認訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:80
msgid ""
"E-commerce orders can be automatically assigned to a specific sales team or "
"salesperson. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. In the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, under :guilabel:`Orders "
"Assignment`, select the relevant :guilabel:`Sales Team` "
"or :guilabel:`Salesperson`."
msgstr ""
"電子商務訂單可以自動指派給特定的銷售團隊或銷售人員。為此，請前往"
"\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`\\ 。在\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 區"
"段中的\\ :guilabel:`訂單指派`\\ 下，選擇相關的\\ :guilabel:`銷售團隊`\\ 或"
"\\ :guilabel:`銷售人員`\\ 。"

