#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:92
msgid "Abandoned carts"
msgstr "放棄的購物車"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:94
msgid ""
"An abandoned cart is created when a customer adds products to the cart but "
"does not go through the :ref:`checkout process <ecommerce/checkout/steps>` "
"or leaves the website before completing it. It is possible to automatically "
"send an email reminder to the customer for these pending orders."
msgstr ""
"當客戶將產品加入購物車但未完成\\ :ref:`結帳流程 <ecommerce/checkout/"
"steps>`\\ 或在完成前離開網站時，就會建立放棄的購物車。系統可以針對這些待處理"
"的訂單自動傳送電子郵件提醒給客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:98
msgid "To enable abandoned cart reminders:"
msgstr "若要啟用放棄的購物車提醒："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:101
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable :guilabel:`Follow up abandoned "
"carts`."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`電子商務`\\ 區段中，啟用\\ :guilabel:`追蹤放棄的購物車`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:102
msgid ""
"Set the time delay after which the reminder email is sent in "
"the :guilabel:`Send after` field, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`傳送於`\\ 欄位中設定傳送提醒電子郵件的時間延遲，然後按一下"
"\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:104
msgid ""
"If needed, click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Customize Abandoned "
"Email Template` link to customize the :doc:`email template </applications/"
"general/companies/email_template>`."
msgstr ""
"如需要，按一下\\ :icon:`fa-arrow-right`\\ :guilabel:`自訂放棄購物車電子郵件範"
"本`\\ 連結以自訂\\ :doc:`電子郵件範本 </applications/general/companies/"
"email_template>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:107
msgid ""
"To view all abandoned carts, go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Orders` and remove the :guilabel:`Confirmed` filter. Open the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` dropdown menu and, under :guilabel:`Filters`, "
"select :guilabel:`Abandoned`."
msgstr ""
"若要檢視所有放棄的購物車，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 電子商務 --> 訂單"
"`\\ 並移除\\ :guilabel:`已確認`\\ 篩選條件。開啟\\ :icon:`fa-caret-down`\\ 下"
"拉式選單，並在\\ :guilabel:`篩選條件`\\ 下選擇\\ :guilabel:`已放棄`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:112
msgid ""
"To receive reminders, customers must have entered their contact details "
"during checkout or be logged in when adding items to the cart. Without the "
"customer details, it remains a :ref:`quotation <ecommerce/handling/sales>` "
"with no follow-up."
msgstr ""
"若要接收提醒，客戶必須在結帳期間輸入其聯絡詳細資料，或在將項目加入購物車時已"
"登入。若無客戶詳細資料，此訂單將保持為\\ :ref:`報價單 <ecommerce/handling/"
"sales>`\\ 狀態且不會有後續追蹤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:115
msgid ""
"Abandoned cart reminders are only sent for carts created after the feature "
"is enabled. Existing abandoned carts are not affected."
msgstr ""
"放棄的購物車提醒僅會傳送給在啟用此功能後建立的購物車。現有的放棄購物車不受影"
"響。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:121
msgid "Request product reviews"
msgstr "要求產品評論"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:123
msgid ""
"Once an order is confirmed, you can automatically send customers a rating "
"request, allowing them to leave a review for the products they purchased."
msgstr "訂單確認後，您可以自動向客戶發送評分請求，讓他們為所購買的產品留下評論。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:126
msgid "To enable automated rating requests:"
msgstr "若要啟用自動評分請求："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:130
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable :guilabel:`Request ratings`."
msgstr "在\\ :guilabel:`電子商務` 部分，啟用\\ :guilabel:`要求評分`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:131
msgid ""
"Define how many :guilabel:`days after order confirmation` the request should "
"be sent."
msgstr "定義在訂單確認後多少\\ :guilabel:`天數`應發送請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:132
msgid ""
"The default :guilabel:`Email` template is selected automatically. If needed, "
"select a different template from the dropdown list. To edit the "
"selected :doc:`email template </applications/general/companies/"
"email_template>`, click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal "
"link`) arrow."
msgstr ""
"系統會自動選取預設的\\ :guilabel:`電子郵件` 範本。如有需要，請從下拉列表中選"
"取其他範本。若要編輯所選的\\ :doc:`電子郵件範本 </applications/general/"
"companies/email_template>`，請按一下\\ :icon:`fa-arrow-right` （:guilabel:`內"
"部連結`）箭頭。"

