#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:144
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Inventory app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` must be "
"installed to process deliveries."
msgstr ""
"必須安裝\\ :doc:`庫存應用程式 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory>`\\ "
"才能處理交貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:146
msgid ""
"Delivery orders are not generated for :guilabel:`Service` "
"or :doc:`subscription </applications/sales/subscriptions>` products."
msgstr ""
"不會為\\ :guilabel:`服務`\\ 或\\ :doc:`訂閱 </applications/sales/"
"subscriptions>`\\ 產品產生交貨單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:149
msgid ""
"Once a sales order is confirmed, a delivery order is automatically created. "
"To access it, click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button "
"on the sales order."
msgstr ""
"一旦銷售單確認後，系統會自動建立交貨單。若要存取交貨單，請在銷售單上按一下"
"\\ :icon:`fa-truck`\\ :guilabel:`交貨`\\ 智慧按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:152
msgid ""
"The next step is preparing e-commerce orders in the warehouse. Depending on "
"order volume, refill and stock management strategies, or available "
"resources, different :doc:`stock handling flows for receipts and deliveries "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations>` can be implemented. These flows may involve manually "
"receiving, :doc:`picking </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/picking_methods>`, and :doc:`packing </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"multipack>` products, printing :doc:`shipping labels </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels>`, "
"and :doc:`shipping  <shipping>` orders to customers, or handling these "
"processes through :doc:`dropshipping </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/dropshipping>` "
"or :doc:`consignment flows </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/owned_stock>`."
msgstr ""
"下一步是在倉庫中準備電子商務訂單。根據訂單量、補貨與庫存管理策略或可用資源，"
"可以實施不同的\\ :doc:`收貨與交貨的庫存處理流程 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations>`\\ 。這些流"
"程可能涉及手動接收、\\ :doc:`揀貨 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/picking_methods>`\\ 和\\ :doc:`包裝 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"multipack>`\\ 產品、列印\\ :doc:`運送標籤 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels>`\\ 以及將訂單"
"\\ :doc:`運送  <shipping>`\\ 給客戶，或透過\\ :doc:`直接運送 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"dropshipping>`\\ 或\\ :doc:`寄售流程 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/owned_stock>`\\ 處理這些流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:167
msgid ""
"After completing the warehouse operations, return to the delivery order and "
"click :guilabel:`Validate` once the order has been shipped."
msgstr ""
"完成倉庫作業後，返回交貨單，並在訂單已運送後按一下\\ :guilabel:`驗證`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:171
msgid ""
"To enable automatic confirmation emails for completed delivery orders "
"(:guilabel:`Done` status), go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration "
"--> Settings`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Shipping` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Confirmation Email`."
msgstr ""
"若要針對已完成的交貨單（:guilabel:`完成`\\ 狀態）啟用自動確認電子郵件，請前往"
"\\ :menuselection:`庫存 --> 配置 --> 設定`\\ ，捲動至\\ :guilabel:`運送`\\ 區"
"段，並啟用\\ :guilabel:`電子郵件確認`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:180
msgid ""
"To ensure that products ordered by customers are reserved in stock, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Operation Types`, click "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Orders` operation type, and set "
"the :guilabel:`Reservation Method` field to :doc:`At Confirmation </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods/at_confirmation>`. When enabled, product quantities are "
"automatically reserved once the order is confirmed, preventing items from "
"becoming unavailable after the order is placed."
msgstr ""
"若要確保客戶訂購的產品保留在庫存中，請前往\\ :menuselection:`庫存 --> 配置 --"
"> 作業類型`\\ ，按一下\\ :guilabel:`交貨單`\\ 作業類型，並將\\ :guilabel:`保"
"留方法`\\ 欄位設定為\\ :doc:`確認時 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/reservation_methods/at_confirmation>`\\ 。啟用"
"後，產品數量會在訂單確認後自動保留，防止項目在下單後變為不可用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:188
msgid ""
"If the customer pays by :ref:`wire transfer <payment_providers/bank_payments/"
"wire_transfer>`, products are not reserved in stock until the payment is "
"received and the order is manually confirmed."
msgstr ""
"如果客戶使用\\ :ref:`電匯 <payment_providers/bank_payments/wire_transfer>`\\ "
"付款，則產品在收到付款並手動確認訂單之前不會保留在庫存中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:193
msgid ":doc:`shipping`"
msgstr ":doc:`shipping`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:198
msgid "Returns and refunds"
msgstr "退貨與退款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:200
msgid ""
"To allow customers to initiate :doc:`returns </applications/sales/sales/"
"products_prices/returns>` through the :doc:`customer portal </applications/"
"general/users/user_portals>`, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Operations` "
"section, and enable :guilabel:`Allow Spontaneous Returns`. Then, specify how "
"many :guilabel:`days after delivery` customers can return products, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"若要允許客戶透過\\ :doc:`退貨 </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"returns>` 發起流程，請透過\\ :doc:`客戶入口網站 </applications/general/users/"
"user_portals>` 前往\\ :menuselection:`庫存 --> 設定 --> 設定`，向下捲動至\\ "
":guilabel:`作業` 部分，並啟用\\ :guilabel:`允許主動退貨`。然後，指定客戶可在"
"交付後多少\\ :guilabel:`天數`內退回產品，並按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:206
msgid ""
"Once enabled, click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Manage Return Reasons` "
"to view all configured :guilabel:`Return Reasons`. To create a new reason, "
"click :guilabel:`New` and enter the reason in the :guilabel:`Reason` field."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，請按一下\\ :icon:`fa-arrow-right`\\ :guilabel:`管理退貨原因` 以檢視所"
"有已設定的\\ :guilabel:`退貨原因`。若要建立新原因，請按一下\\ :guilabel:`新"
"增`，並在\\ :guilabel:`原因` 欄位中輸入原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:211
msgid ""
"At least one return reason must exist to allow customers to complete the "
"return process."
