#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:3
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo **Live Chat** includes several reports that allow for the monitoring of "
"operator performance and the identification of trends in customer "
"conversations."
msgstr ""
"Odoo\\ **線上客服**\\ 包含多個報表，可用於監控客服人員績效和識別客戶對話中的"
"趨勢。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:8
