msgstr ""
"要存取所有可用報表的下拉式選單，請前往\\ :menuselection:`線上客服應用程式 --"
"> 報表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:25
msgid "Sessions History"
msgstr "對話視窗歷程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:27
msgid ""
"The *Sessions History* report displays an overview of live chat sessions, "
"including session dates, participant name and country, session duration, the "
"number of messages, and the rating. It also provides access to the complete "
"transcripts of live chat sessions."
msgstr ""
"*工作階段歷程記錄*\\ 報表顯示線上客服工作階段的概覽，包括工作階段日期、參與者"
"姓名和國家/地區、工作階段持續時間、訊息數量和評分。它還提供線上客服工作階段完"
"整記錄的存取權限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:31
msgid ""
"To access this report, navigate to :menuselection:`Live Chat app --> Report "
"--> Sessions History`. Each live chat session is represented by a Kanban "
"card."
msgstr ""
"要存取此報表，請前往\\ :menuselection:`線上客服應用程式 --> 報表 --> 工作階段"
"歷程記錄`。每個線上客服工作階段由一張看板卡片表示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:34
msgid "Example of the Sessions History report from the Live Chat application."
msgstr "線上客服應用程式的工作階段歷程記錄報表範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:37
msgid ""
"To view the transcript from a specific session, click the Kanban card. This "
"opens the *Discuss* thread for the conversation."
msgstr ""
"要檢視特定工作階段的記錄，請按一下看板卡片。這將開啟該對話的\\ *聊天*\\ 討論"
"串。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:40
msgid ""
"In the *Discuss* thread, the conversation view displays the entire "
"transcript of the conversation. If the visitor left a rating, it is included "
"at the end of the transcript."
msgstr ""
"在\\ *聊天*\\ 對話串中，對話檢視會顯示整個對話記錄。如果訪客留下了評價，評價"
"會包含在記錄的末尾。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:43
msgid "View of the chat transcript in the Discuss application."
msgstr "聊天應用程式中聊天記錄的檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:47
msgid "Export sessions history"
msgstr "匯出對話歷史記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:49
msgid ""
"The information in this report can be exported, or inserted into a "
"spreadsheet."
msgstr "此報表中的資訊可以匯出或插入試算表中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:51
msgid ""
"On the *Sessions History* report, click the :icon:`oi-view-"
"list` :guilabel:`(List)` icon to switch to list view. Next, click "
"the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon to the right of "
"the :guilabel:`History` page title to reveal a drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"在\\ *對話歷史記錄*\\ 報表上，按一下\\ :icon:`oi-view-list`\\ :guilabel:`清單"
"`\\ 圖示以切換到清單檢視。接下來，按一下\\ :guilabel:`歷史記錄`\\ 頁面標題右"
"側的\\ :icon:`fa-cog`\\ :guilabel:`齒輪`\\ 圖示以顯示下拉式選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:55
msgid ""
"From the drop-down menu, click :guilabel:`Export All` to export all sessions "
"to a spreadsheet, or :guilabel:`Insert list in spreadsheet` to insert the "
"information in a new, or existing, spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"從下拉式選單中，按一下\\ :guilabel:`全部匯出`\\ 可將所有對話匯出至試算表，或"
"按一下\\ :guilabel:`將清單插入試算表`\\ 可將資訊插入新的或現有的試算表中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:58
msgid ""
"To only export select sessions, first select the desired sessions to be "
"exported from the list, by clicking the checkbox to the left of each "
"individual session. With the sessions selected, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` icon at the top of the page, and "
"click :guilabel:`Export` or :guilabel:`Insert list in spreadsheet`."
msgstr ""
"若只要匯出選定的對話，請先從清單中選擇要匯出的對話，方法是按一下每個對話左側"
"的勾選方格。選擇對話後，按一下頁面頂部的\\ :icon:`fa-cog`\\ :guilabel:`動作"
"`\\ 圖示，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`匯出`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`將清單插入試算表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:66
msgid "Session Statistics"
msgstr "對話統計"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:68
msgid ""
"The *Session Statistics* report provides a statistical overview of live chat "
"sessions. The default view for this report displays sessions grouped by the "
"date of creation."
msgstr ""
"*對話統計資料*\\ 報表提供線上客服對話的統計總覽。此報表的預設檢視會顯示按建立"
"日期分組的對話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:71
msgid ""
"To access this report, navigate to :menuselection:`Live Chat app --> Reports "
"--> Session Statistics`."
msgstr ""
"若要存取此報表，請導覽至\\ :menuselection:`線上客服應用程式 --> 報表 --> 對話"
"統計資料`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:74
msgid ""
"Example of the Sessions Statistics report from the Live Chat application."
msgstr "線上客服應用程式中對話統計資料報表的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:77
msgid ""
"The stacked bar graph view of the *Session Statistics* report, with results "
"grouped by Creation Date (hour), then by rating."
msgstr ""
"*對話統計資料*\\ 報表的堆疊長條圖檢視，結果按建立日期（小時）分組，然後按評價"
"分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:112
msgid ""
"To view a different measure, click the :guilabel:`Measures` drop-down menu "
"at the top-left of the report. The measures available for this report "
"include:"
msgstr ""
"若要檢視不同的度量，請按一下報表左上方的\\ :guilabel:`度量`\\ 下拉式選單。此"
"報表可用的度量包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:83
msgid ":guilabel:`# of speakers`: number of participants in the conversation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`發言者數量`：對話中的參與者數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days of activity`: number of days since the operator's first "
"session."
msgstr ":guilabel:`活動天數`：自客服人員的第一次對話以來的天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration of Session (min)`: the duration of a conversation, in "
"minutes."
msgstr ":guilabel:`對話持續時間（分鐘）`：對話的持續時間，以分鐘為單位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is visitor anonymous`: denotes whether the conversation "
"participant is anonymous."
msgstr ":guilabel:`訪客是否匿名`：表示對話參與者是否為匿名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Messages per session`: the total number of messages sent in a "
"conversation. This measure is included in the default view."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`每次對話的訊息數`：對話中傳送的訊息總數。此度量包含在預設檢視中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rating`: the rating received by an operator at the end of a "
"session, if one was provided."
msgstr ":guilabel:`評價`：客服人員在對話結束時收到的評價（如果有提供）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Session not rated`: denotes if a session did **not** receive a "
"rating at the end of the conversation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`對話未評價`：表示對話結束時是否\\ **未**\\ 收到評價。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time to answer (sec)`: the average time, in seconds, before an "
"operator responds to a chat request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`回應時間（秒）`：客服人員回應聊天請求前的平均時間，以秒為單位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Visitor is Happy`: denotes whether a positive rating was "
"provided. If the visitor gave either a negative or neutral rating, they are "
"considered *unhappy*."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`訪客滿意`\\ ：表示是否提供了正面評價。如果訪客給予負面或中立評"
"價，則視為\\ *不滿意*\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:97
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:121
msgid ":guilabel:`Count`: the total number of sessions."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`計數`\\ ：工作階段總數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:102
msgid "Operator Analysis"
msgstr "客服人員分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:104
msgid ""
"The *Operator Analysis* report is used to monitor the performance of "
"individual live chat operators."
msgstr "*客服專員分析*\\ 報告用於監控個別線上客服專員的績效表現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:106
msgid ""
"To access the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Live Chat app --> Reports "
"--> Operator Analysis`."
msgstr ""
"若要存取報告，請前往\\ :menuselection:`線上客服應用程式 --> 報告 --> 客服專員"
"分析`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:108
msgid ""
"The default view for this report is a bar chart, which only displays "
"conversations from the current month, as indicated by the :guilabel:`This "
"Month` default search filter. Conversations are grouped by operator."
msgstr ""
"此報告的預設檢視為長條圖，僅顯示當月的對話，如\\ :guilabel:`本月`\\ 預設搜尋"
"篩選器所示。對話依客服專員分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`# of Sessions`: the number of sessions an operator participated "
"in. This measure is included by default."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`工作階段數`\\ ：客服專員參與的工作階段數量。此測量項目預設包含"
"在內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:117
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Average duration`: the average duration of a conversation, in "
"seconds."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`平均時長`\\ ：對話的平均時長（以秒為單位）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Average rating`: the average rating received by the operator."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`平均評分`\\ ：客服專員收到的平均評分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time to answer`: the average amount of time before the operator "
"responds to a chat request, in seconds."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`回應時間`\\ ：客服專員回應聊天請求前的平均時間（以秒為單位）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/reports.rst:123
msgid "Example of the Operator Analysis report from the Live Chat application."
msgstr "線上客服應用程式客服專員分析報告的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:3
msgid "Commands and canned responses"
msgstr "指令與預設回應"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:5
msgid ""
"In the Odoo **Live Chat** application, *commands* allow the user to perform "
"specific actions both inside the chat window, and through other Odoo "
"applications. The **Live Chat** app also includes *canned responses*. These "
"are customized, preconfigured substitutions that allow users to replace "
"shortcut entries in place of longer, well-thought out responses to some of "
"the most common questions and comments."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo\\ **線上客服**\\ 應用程式中，\\ *指令*\\ 允許使用者在聊天視窗內以及透"
"過其他 Odoo 應用程式執行特定動作。\\ **線上客服**\\ 應用程式還包含\\ *預設回"
"應*\\ 。這些是自訂的預先設定替代文字，允許使用者將捷徑記項替換為更長、經過深"
"思熟慮的回應，以應對一些最常見的問題和評論。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:11
msgid ""
"Both commands and canned responses save time, and allow users to maintain a "
"level of consistency throughout their conversations."
msgstr "指令與預設回應皆可節省時間，並允許使用者在對話中保持一致性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:15
msgid "Execute a command"
msgstr "執行指令"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:17
msgid ""
"Live chat *commands* are keywords that trigger preconfigured actions. When a "
"live chat *operator* is participating in a conversation with a customer or "
"website visitor, they can execute a command by typing `/`, followed by the "
"command."
msgstr ""
"線上客服\\ *指令*\\ 是觸發預先設定動作的關鍵字。當線上客服\\ *專員*\\ 與客戶"
"或網站訪客進行對話時，可以透過輸入\\ `/`\\ 後接指令來執行指令。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:21
msgid ""
"Commands, and the resulting actions, are only visible in the conversation "
"window for the live chat operator. A customer does not see any commands that "
"an operator uses in a conversation from their view of the chat."
msgstr ""
"指令及其產生的動作僅在線上客服專員的對話視窗中可見。客戶無法在其聊天檢視中看"
"到專員在對話中使用的任何指令。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:26
msgid ""
"During a conversation with a customer, a live chat operator executes the "
"command to :ref:`create a ticket <live-chat/ticket>`. After entering the "
"command, `/ticket`, the system automatically creates a ticket with the "
"information from the conversation. It also includes a link to the new "
"ticket, so the operator can go there directly to add any additional "
"information, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"在與客戶對話期間，線上客服專員執行指令以\\ :ref:`建立工單 <live-chat/"
"ticket>`\\ 。輸入指令\\ `/ticket`\\ 後，系統會自動使用對話中的資訊建立工單。"
"它還包含新工單的連結，以便專員可以直接前往該處加入任何其他必要資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:34
msgid "More information about each available command can be found below."
msgstr "有關每個可用指令的更多資訊可在下方找到。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:37
msgid "Help"
msgstr "幫助"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:39
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/help` in the chat window, an informative message that "
"includes the potential entry types an operator can make is displayed."
msgstr ""
"如果專員在聊天視窗中輸入\\ `/help`\\ ，將顯示一則資訊訊息，其中包含專員可以進"
"行的潛在記項類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:42
msgid ""
"Type `@username` to mention a user in the conversation. A notification will "
"be sent to that user's inbox or email, depending on their notification "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"輸入\\ `@username`\\ 以在對話中提及使用者。系統將根據該使用者的通知設定，向其"
"收件匣或電子郵件傳送通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:44
msgid "Type `/command` to execute a command."
msgstr "輸入\\ `/command`\\ 以執行命令。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:45
msgid ""
"Type `:shortcut` to insert a :ref:`canned response <live-chat/canned-"
"responses>`."
msgstr ""
"輸入\\ `:shortcut`\\ 以插入\\ :ref:`罐頭回覆 <live-chat/canned-responses>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:48
msgid ":doc:`/applications/productivity/discuss`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/productivity/discuss`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:49
msgid ":doc:`/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:52
msgid "Ticket & search tickets"
msgstr "工單與搜尋工單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:54
msgid ""
"The `/ticket` and `/search_tickets` commands allow operators to create "
"helpdesk tickets directly from a conversation, and search through existing "
"tickets by keyword or ticket number."
msgstr ""
"`/ticket`\\ 和\\ `/search_tickets`\\ 命令讓客服人員可以直接從對話中建立幫助台"
"工單，並透過關鍵字或工單編號搜尋現有工單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:58
msgid ""
"The `/ticket` and `/search_tickets` commands can **only** be used if the "
"**Helpdesk** app has been installed, and *Live Chat* has been activated on a "
"*Helpdesk* team. To activate *Live Chat*, go to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app "
"--> Configuration --> Helpdesk Teams`, and select a team. Scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Channels` section, and check the box labeled, :guilabel:`Live "
"Chat`."
msgstr ""
"`/ticket`\\ 和\\ `/search_tickets`\\ 命令**僅**能在已安裝\\ **幫助台**\\ 應用"
"程式，且已在\\ *幫助台*\\ 團隊上啟用\\ *線上客服*\\ 時使用。若要啟用\\ *線上"
"客服*，請前往\\ :menuselection:`幫助台應用程式 --> 配置 --> 幫助台團隊`，並選"
"擇一個團隊。捲動至\\ :guilabel:`頻道`\\ 區段，並勾選標示為\\ :guilabel:`線上"
"客服`\\ 的方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:66
msgid "Create a ticket from a live chat"
msgstr "從線上客服建立工單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:68
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/ticket` in the chat window, the conversation is used "
"to create a *Helpdesk* ticket."
msgstr ""
"如果客服人員在聊天視窗中輸入\\ `/ticket`，該對話將用於建立\\ *幫助台*\\ 工"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:71
msgid ""
"After entering the `/ticket` command, type a title for the ticket into the "
"chat window, then press `Enter`."
msgstr ""
"輸入\\ `/ticket`\\ 命令後，在聊天視窗中輸入工單標題，然後按下\\ `Enter`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:74
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:98
msgid "View of the results from a helpdesk search in a Live Chat conversation."
msgstr "線上客服對話中幫助台搜尋結果的檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:77
msgid ""
"The newly created ticket will be added to the *Helpdesk* team that has live "
"chat enabled. If more than one team has live chat enabled, the ticket will "
"automatically be assigned based on the team's priority."
msgstr ""
"新建立的工單將加入已啟用線上客服的\\ *幫助台*\\ 團隊。如果有多個團隊已啟用線"
"上客服，工單將根據團隊的優先順序自動分配。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:81
msgid ""
"The transcript from the conversation will be added to the new ticket, under "
"the :guilabel:`Description` tab."
msgstr "對話記錄將加入新工單的\\ :guilabel:`說明`\\ 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:84
msgid ""
"To access the new ticket, click on the link in the chat window, or go to "
"the :menuselection:`Helpdesk app` and click the :guilabel:`Tickets` button "
"on the Kanban card for the appropriate team."
msgstr ""
"若要存取新工單，請按一下聊天視窗中的連結，或前往\\ :menuselection:`幫助台應用"
"程式`，並按一下適當團隊看板卡片上的\\ :guilabel:`工單`\\ 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:89
msgid "Search for a ticket from a live chat"
msgstr "從線上客服搜尋工單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:91
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/search_tickets` in the chat window, they can search "
"through *Helpdesk* tickets, either by ticket number or keyword."
msgstr ""
"如果客服人員在聊天視窗中輸入\\ `/search_tickets`，即可透過工單編號或關鍵字搜"
"尋\\ *幫助台*\\ 工單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:94
msgid ""
"After entering the `/search_tickets` command, type a keyword or ticket "
"number, then press :kbd:`Enter`. If one or more related tickets are found, a "
"list of links is generated in the conversation window."
msgstr ""
"輸入\\ `/search_tickets`\\ 命令後，輸入關鍵字或工單編號，然後按下"
"\\ :kbd:`Enter`。如果找到一個或多個相關工單，對話視窗中將產生連結清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:102
msgid ""
"Results from the search command will only be seen by the operator, not the "
"customer."
msgstr "搜尋命令的結果僅客服人員可見，客戶無法看到。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:105
msgid "History"
msgstr "過往訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:107
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/history` in the chat window, it generates a list of "
"the most recent pages the visitor has viewed on the website (up to 15)."
msgstr ""
"如果客服人員在聊天視窗中輸入\\ `/history`，將產生訪客在網站上瀏覽的最近頁面清"
"單（最多 15 個）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:110
msgid ""
"View of the results from a /history command in a Live Chat conversation."
msgstr "線上客服對話中\\ /history\\ 命令結果的檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:114
msgid "Lead"
msgstr "潛在商機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:116
msgid ""
"By typing `/lead` in the chat window, an operator can create a *lead* in the "
"**CRM** application."
msgstr ""
"透過在聊天視窗中輸入\\ `/lead`\\ ，操作員可以在\\ **客戶關係**\\ 應用程式中建"
"立\\ *潛在客戶*\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:118
msgid "View of the results from a /lead command in a Live Chat conversation."
msgstr "在線上客服對話中\\ /lead\\ 指令結果的檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:122
msgid ""
"The `/lead` command can only be used if the **CRM** app has been installed."
msgstr "`/lead`\\ 指令只能在已安裝\\ **客戶關係**\\ 應用程式時使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:124
msgid ""
"After typing `/lead`, create a title for this new lead, then press `Enter`. "
"A link with the lead title appears. Click the link, or navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`CRM` app to view the :guilabel:`Pipeline`."
msgstr ""
"輸入\\ `/lead`\\ 後，為這個新的潛在客戶建立標題，然後按\\ `Enter`\\ 。畫面會"
"出現帶有潛在客戶標題的連結。按一下該連結，或前往\\ :menuselection:`客戶關係"
"`\\ 應用程式以檢視\\ :guilabel:`管線`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:129
msgid ""
"The link to the new lead can only be seen and accessed by the operator, not "
"the customer."
msgstr "新潛在客戶的連結只有操作員可以看到和存取，客戶無法看到。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:131
msgid ""
"The transcript of that specific live chat conversation (where the lead was "
"created) is added to the :guilabel:`Internal Notes` tab of the lead form."
msgstr ""
"建立潛在客戶的該次線上客服對話記錄會加入到潛在客戶表單的\\ :guilabel:`內部備"
"註`\\ 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:134
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Extra Information` tab of the lead form, "
"the :guilabel:`Source` will be listed as :guilabel:`Livechat`."
msgstr ""
"在潛在客戶表單的\\ :guilabel:`額外資訊`\\ 分頁上，:guilabel:`來源`\\ 會列為"
"\\ :guilabel:`Livechat`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:138
msgid "Leave"
msgstr "退出"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:140
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/leave` in the chat window, they can automatically "
"exit the conversation. This command does not cause the customer to be "
"removed from the conversation, nor does it automatically end the "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"如果操作員在聊天視窗中輸入\\ `/leave`\\ ，他們可以自動退出對話。此指令不會導"
"致客戶被移除出對話，也不會自動結束對話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:145
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads`"

