"accordingly. To prevent the automatic update of the *web base URL* when an "
"administrator logs in to the database, activate the :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode>`, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> System "
"Parameters --> New`, and enter `web.base.url.freeze` as the :guilabel:`Key` "
"and `True` as the :guilabel:`Value`."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用原始的 Odoo 位址（例如\\ `mycompany.odoo.com`）存取資料庫，資料庫的"
"\\ *網頁基礎網址*\\ 將會相應更新。若要在管理員登入資料庫時防止\\ *網頁基礎網"
"址*\\ 自動更新，請啟用\\ :ref:`開發者模式 <developer-mode>`，前往"
"\\ :menuselection:`設定 --> 技術 --> 系統參數 --> 新增`，並輸入\\ "
"`web.base.url.freeze`\\ 作為\\ :guilabel:`金鑰`，以及\\ `True`\\ 作為"
"\\ :guilabel:`值`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:450
msgid ""
"You can also set the *web base URL* manually. To do so, activate "
"the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, go to :menuselection:`Settings --"
"> Technical --> System Parameters`, and search for the `web.base.url` key "
"(create it if necessary) and enter the full address of your website as the "
"value (e.g., `https://www.yourdomain.com`). The URL must include the "
"protocol `https://` (or `http://`) and *not* end with a slash (`/`)."
msgstr ""
"您也可以手動設定\\ *網頁基礎網址*。若要這樣做，請啟用\\ :ref:`開發者模式 "
"<developer-mode>`，前往\\ :menuselection:`設定 --> 技術 --> 系統參數`，並搜尋"
"\\ `web.base.url`\\ 金鑰（必要時請建立），然後輸入您網站的完整位址作為值（例"
"如\\ `https://www.yourdomain.com`）。網址必須包含協定\\ `https://`（或\\ "
"`http://`），且\\ *不得*\\ 以斜線（`/`）結尾。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:459
msgid "Map a domain name to an Odoo website"
msgstr "將網域名稱對應至 Odoo 網站"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:462
msgid ""
"Mapping your domain name to your website is different than mapping it to "
"your database:"
msgstr "將您的網域名稱對應至您的網站與將其對應至您的資料庫不同："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:464
msgid ""
"It defines your domain name as the main one for your website, helping search "
"engines index it correctly."
msgstr "它將您的網域名稱定義為您網站的主要名稱，協助搜尋引擎正確索引。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:466
msgid ""
"It defines your domain name as the base URL for your database, including "
"portal links sent to your customers via email."
msgstr ""
"它將您的網域名稱定義為資料庫的基礎網址，包括透過電子郵件傳送給客戶的門戶網站"
"連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:468
msgid ""
"If you have multiple websites, it maps your domain name to the appropriate "
"website."
msgstr "如果您有多個網站，它會將您的網域名稱對應至適當的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:470
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`. If you have "
"multiple websites, select the one you want to configure. In "
"the :guilabel:`Domain` field, enter the URL of your website (e.g., `https://"
"www.yourdomain.com`) and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`。如果您有多個網站，請選擇您要"
"配置的網站。在\\ :guilabel:`網域`\\ 欄位中，輸入您網站的網址（例如\\ "
"`https://www.yourdomain.com`），然後點擊\\ :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:475
msgid ""
"Mapping your domain name to your Odoo website prevents Google Search from "
"indexing your original database address (e.g., `mycompany.odoo.com`)."
msgstr ""
"將您的網域名稱對應至您的 Odoo 網站可防止 Google 搜尋為您的原始資料庫地址（例"
"如\\ `mycompany.odoo.com`）建立索引。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:478
msgid ""
"If both addresses are already indexed, it may take some time for the "
"indexation of the second address to be removed from Google Search. You can "
"use the `Google Search Console <https://search.google.com/search-console/"
"welcome>`_ to fix the issue."
msgstr ""
"如果兩個位址都已被索引，第二個位址的索引可能需要一些時間才能從 Google 搜尋中"
"移除。您可以使用\\ `Google Search Console<https://search.google.com/search-"
"console/welcome>`_\\ 來解決此問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:487
msgid ""
"Adding a subdomain label to a domain name (e.g., `subdomain.yourdomain.com`) "
"allows creating :doc:`multiple websites <multi_website>` with a single "
"domain name. To do so:"
msgstr ""
"在網域名稱中加入子網域標籤（例如\\ `subdomain.yourdomain.com`）可讓您使用單一"
"網域名稱建立\\ :doc:`多個網站 <multi_website>`。若要這樣做："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:490
msgid ""
"Add a CNAME record to forward your subdomain (e.g., "
"`subdomain.yourdomain.com`) to the address of your Odoo database (e.g., "
"`mycompany.odoo.com`)."
msgstr ""
"加入 CNAME 記錄，將您的子網域（例如\\ `subdomain.yourdomain.com`）轉送到您的 "
"Odoo 資料庫位址（例如\\ `mycompany.odoo.com`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:3
msgid "Google Search Console"
msgstr "Google 搜尋控制台"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:5
msgid ""
"Google Search Console is a free web service provided by Google that allows "
"website owners to monitor, maintain, and troubleshoot their site's presence "
"in Google Search results. It offers valuable insights into how Google views "
"and interacts with your site, helping you optimize its performance."
msgstr ""
"Google Search Console 是 Google 提供的免費網路服務，讓網站擁有者能夠監控、維"
"護和排解其網站在 Google 搜尋結果中的存在。它提供有關 Google 如何檢視您的網站"
"並與之互動的寶貴資訊，協助您最佳化網站效能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:10
msgid ""
"To enable Google Search Console for your website, go to `Google Search "
"Console <https://search.google.com/search-console/welcome>`_. Then, select "
"the property type :ref:`GSC-Domain` or :ref:`GSC-URL prefix`."
msgstr ""
"若要為您的網站啟用 Google Search Console，請前往\\ `Google Search Console "
"<https://search.google.com/search-console/welcome>`_。然後，選擇資源類型"
"\\ :ref:`GSC-Domain`\\ 或\\ :ref:`GSC-URL prefix`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:14
msgid "Google Search Console domain or URL prefix"
msgstr "Google Search Console 網域或網址前綴"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:20
msgid "Domain property"
msgstr "網域資源"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:22
msgid ""
"A domain property in Search Console tracks all versions of your website, "
"including subdomains and protocols (http/https). This comprehensive view "
"allows you to analyze your overall website's search performance and make "
"informed decisions to optimize its visibility. Enter the domain, e.g., "
"`example.com` and click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"Search Console 中的網域資源會追蹤您網站的所有版本，包括子網域和通訊協定"
"（http/https）。此全面性檢視可讓您分析整體網站的搜尋效能，並做出明智的決策以"
"最佳化其可見度。請輸入網域，例如\\ `example.com`\\ 並按一下\\ :guilabel:`繼續"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:28
msgid ""
"The domain property type can only be verified via `DNS record <https://"
"support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#domain_name_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_."
msgstr ""
"網域資源類型只能透過\\ `DNS 記錄 <https://support.google.com/webmasters/"
"answer/9008080?hl=en#domain_name_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_\\ 進行驗"
"證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:30
msgid ""
"Google suggests creating at least one domain property to represent your "
"site, as it is the most complete view of your website information."
msgstr ""
"Google 建議至少建立一個網域資源來代表您的網站，因為這是您網站資訊最完整的檢"
"視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:36
msgid "URL prefix property"
msgstr "網址前綴資源"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:38
msgid ""
"This type of verification is usually simpler as you have multiple "
"verification methods, such as using your existing Google Analytics or Tag "
"Manager account. It also makes sense to view a section of your website "
"separately. For example, if you work with a consultant on a specific part of "
"your website, you might want to verify this part separately to limit access "
"to your data. Enter the URL, e.g., `https://example.odoo.com/` and "
"click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"此類型的驗證通常較為簡單，因為您有多種驗證方法，例如使用現有的 Google "
"Analytics 或 Tag Manager 帳戶。單獨檢視網站的某個部分也很合理。例如，如果您與"
"顧問合作處理網站的特定部分，您可能希望單獨驗證此部分以限制對您資料的存取。請"
"輸入網址，例如\\ `https://example.odoo.com/`\\ 並按一下\\ :guilabel:`繼續`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:46
msgid "Site ownership verification"
msgstr "網站所有權驗證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:48
msgid ""
"Before using Google Search Console for your website, you must verify your "
"site ownership. This verification process is a security measure that "
"protects both you and Google. It ensures that only authorized users have "
"access to sensitive data and that you have control over how your website is "
"treated in Google Search."
msgstr ""
"在為您的網站使用 Google Search Console 之前，您必須驗證您的網站所有權。此驗證"
"程序是一項安全措施，可保護您和 Google。它確保只有授權使用者才能存取敏感資料，"
"並且您可以控制您的網站在 Google 搜尋中的處理方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:53
msgid "Five methods are available to do this:"
msgstr "有五種方法可以執行此操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:57
msgid ":ref:`GSC-HTML-file-upload`"
msgstr ":ref:`GSC-HTML-file-upload`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:58
msgid ""
"`DNS record <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#domain_name_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_"
msgstr ""
"`DNS 記錄 <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#domain_name_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:59
msgid ""
"`HTML tag <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#meta_tag_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_"
msgstr ""
"`HTML 標籤 <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#meta_tag_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:60
msgid ""
"`Google Analytics tracking code <https://support.google.com/webmasters/"
"answer/9008080?hl=en#google_analytics_verification>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google Analytics 追蹤代碼 <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/"
"9008080?hl=en#google_analytics_verification>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:61
msgid ""
"`Google Tag Manager container snippet <https://support.google.com/webmasters/"
"answer/9008080?hl=en#google_tag_manager_verification>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google 代碼管理工具容器程式碼片段 <https://support.google.com/webmasters/"
"answer/9008080?hl=en#google_tag_manager_verification>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:64
msgid ""
"The best method for you depends on your comfort level and technical "
"expertise. For beginners, using a file upload or HTML tag might be easiest. "
"Those options are convenient if you already use :ref:`Google Analytics "
"<analytics/google-analytics>` or :ref:`Google Tag Manager <analytics/google-"
"tag-manager>`. You need to access your domain registrar's settings for "
"domain verification."
msgstr ""
"最適合您的方法取決於您的舒適程度和技術專業知識。對於初學者來說，使用檔案上傳"
"或 HTML 標籤可能最簡單。如果您已經使用\\ :ref:`Google Analytics <analytics/"
"google-analytics>`\\ 或\\ :ref:`Google 代碼管理工具 <analytics/google-tag-"
"manager>`，這些選項會很方便。您需要存取您的網域註冊商的設定才能進行網域驗證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:73
msgid "HTML file upload"
msgstr "HTML 檔案上傳"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:75
msgid ""
"This method involves uploading an HTML file provided by Google containing "
"the verification code you have to put in your Odoo's Website Settings. "
"Google verifies ownership by checking for this code."
msgstr ""
"此方法涉及上傳 Google 提供的 HTML 檔案，其中包含您必須放入 Odoo 網站設定中的"
"驗證代碼。Google 通過檢查此代碼來驗證所有權。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:78
msgid ""
"Once you added your website URL under the URL prefix option and "
"clicked :guilabel:`continue`, expand the HTML file section where you find a "
"download :icon:`fa-download` button."
msgstr ""
"在網址前綴選項下加入您的網站網址並按一下\\ :guilabel:`繼續`\\ 後，展開 HTML "
"檔案區段，您會在其中找到下載\\ :icon:`fa-download`\\ 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:81
msgid "HTML file download"
msgstr "HTML 檔案下載"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:84
msgid ""
"Download your HTML verification file and copy the verification code (e.g., "
"`google123abc.html`)."
msgstr "下載您的 HTML 驗證檔案並複製驗證代碼（例如 `google123abc.html`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:86
msgid "Open and copy html file"
msgstr "開啟並複製 html 檔案"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:89
msgid ""
"In your Odoo database, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, and enable :guilabel:`Google Search Console` in "
"the :guilabel:`SEO` section. Paste the verification code (e.g., "
"`google123abc.html`) in the dedicated field."
msgstr ""
"在您的 Odoo 資料庫中，前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並在"
"\\ :guilabel:`SEO`\\ 區段中啟用\\ :guilabel:`Google Search Console`。將驗證代"
"碼（例如 `google123abc.html`）貼到專用欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:93
msgid "Paste html code in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 中貼上 html 代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:96
msgid ""
"In Google Search Console, click :guilabel:`Verify`. If you perform the steps "
"above correctly, verification should be done immediately."
msgstr ""
"在 Google Search Console 中，按一下\\ :guilabel:`驗證`。如果您正確執行上述步"
"驟，驗證應該會立即完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:102
msgid "HTML tag"
msgstr "HTML 標籤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:104
msgid ""
"This method involves copying a meta tag provided by Google and pasting it "
"into your Odoo website. To verify your site ownership using an HTML tag, "
"follow these instructions:"
msgstr ""
"此方法涉及複製 Google 提供的中繼標記並將其貼到您的 Odoo 網站中。要使用 HTML "
"標籤驗證您的網站所有權，請遵循以下說明："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:107
msgid "Expand the HTML tag section."
msgstr "展開 HTML 標籤區段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:109
msgid "Open HTML tag section."
msgstr "開啟 HTML 標籤區段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:112
msgid ":guilabel:`Copy` the HTML tag to clipboard."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`複製`\\ HTML 標籤至剪貼簿。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:113
msgid ""
"On your Odoo website, click :guilabel:`Edit` in the upper-right corner, go "
"to the :guilabel:`Theme` tab, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Advanced` "
"section, then click :guilabel:`<head> and </body>` next to :guilabel:`Code "
"Injection`. Paste the copied tag into the first field (:guilabel:`<head>`), "
"and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"在您的 Odoo 網站，按一下右上角的\\ :guilabel:`編輯`\\ ，前往\\ :guilabel:`主"
"題`\\ 分頁，向下捲動至\\ :guilabel:`進階`\\ 區段，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`程"
"式碼注入`\\ 旁的\\ :guilabel:`<head> 和 </body>`\\ 。將複製的標籤貼至第一個欄"
"位（\\ :guilabel:`<head>`\\ ），然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:118
msgid "Paste tag in head field."
msgstr "將標籤貼至 head 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:121
msgid ""
"Return to :abbr:`GSC (Google Search Console)` and click :guilabel:`Verify`."
msgstr ""
"返回\\ :abbr:`GSC（Google Search Console）`\\ 並按一下\\ :guilabel:`驗證"
"`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:124
msgid ":doc:`domain_names`"
msgstr ":doc:`domain_names`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo allows you to :doc:`create <../website_creation>` multiple websites "
"from the same database. This can be useful, for example, if you have "
"multiple brands operating under your organization, or if you want to create "
"separate websites for different products/services or audiences."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 讓您可以從同一個資料庫\\ :doc:`建立 <../website_creation>`\\ 多個網站。"
"舉例來說，如果貴組織旗下經營多個品牌，或想針對不同產品/服務或受眾建立獨立網"
"站，這項功能會相當實用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:10
msgid "Creating another website"
msgstr "建立另一個網站"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:12
msgid ""
"Creating multiple websites requires having *at least* one :doc:`domain name "
"<domain_names>`. Different alternatives exist, but before creating another "
"website, you should either"
msgstr ""
"建立多個網站需要\\ *至少*\\ 一個\\ :doc:`網域名稱 <domain_names>`。有不同的替"
"代方案，但在建立另一個網站之前，您應該："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:15
msgid ""
":ref:`Register a domain name for free with Odoo <domain-name/register>` for "
"your first website, then, for your second website, either:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`向 Odoo 免費註冊網域名稱 <domain-name/register>`\\ 作為您的第一個網站，"
"然後針對第二個網站，可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:18
msgid ""
":ref:`Use a subdomain of your free Odoo domain name <domain-name/register/"
"subdomains>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`使用免費 Odoo 網域名稱的子網域 <domain-name/register/subdomains>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:19
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:25
msgid ":ref:`Use a domain name you purchased <domain-name/existing>`."
msgstr ":ref:`使用您購買的網域名稱 <domain-name/existing>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`Use a domain name you purchased <domain-name/existing>` for your first "
"website, then, for your second website, either:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`使用您購買的網域名稱 <domain-name/existing>`\\ 作為您的第一個網站，然後"
"針對第二個網站，可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:24
msgid ""
":ref:`Use a subdomain of your purchased domain name <domain-name/existing/"
"subdomains>`."
