"按一下\\ :guilabel:`已翻譯為`\\ 欄位旁的綠色按鈕，以自動翻譯所有以黃色突顯的"
"文字。您也可以手動翻譯或調整文字，無論是以綠色或黃色突顯，只需選擇並編輯它。"
"完成翻譯後，請按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:93
msgid "Entering the translation mode"
msgstr "進入翻譯模式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:97
msgid ""
"The core URL structure remains consistent across languages, while specific "
"elements like product names or categories are translated. For example, "
"`https://www.mywebsite.com/shop/product/my-product-1` is the default version "
"of a product page, while `https://www.mywebsite.com/fr/shop/product/mon-"
"produit-1` is the translated version of the same product page. The structure "
"(`/shop/product/`) remains unchanged, but the product name (`my-product`) is "
"translated (`mon-produit`)."
msgstr ""
"核心網址結構在各種語言中保持一致,而產品名稱或類別等特定元素則會被翻譯。例如，"
"`https://www.mywebsite.com/shop/product/my-product-1` 是產品頁面的預設版本，"
"而 `https://www.mywebsite.com/fr/shop/product/mon-produit-1` 是同一產品頁面的"
"翻譯版本。結構（`/shop/product/`）保持不變，但產品名稱（`my-product`）被翻譯"
"為（`mon-produit`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:103
msgid ""
