"網站時，只會顯示與該語言相關的關鍵字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:123
msgid ":doc:`Search Engine Optimization <../structure/seo>`"
msgstr ":doc:`搜尋引擎最佳化 <../structure/seo>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **mail groups** feature allows website visitors to have a public "
"discussion by email. They can join a group to receive emails from other "
"group members (i.e., website users who have subscribed to the group) and "
"send new ones to all group members."
msgstr ""
"**郵件群組**功能允許網站訪客透過電子郵件進行公開討論。他們可以加入群組以接收"
"其他群組成員（即訂閱該群組的網站使用者）的電子郵件，並向所有群組成員傳送新郵"
"件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:9
msgid ""
"To activate the feature, :ref:`install <general/install>` "
"the :guilabel:`Website Mail Group` (`website_mail_group`) module."
msgstr ""
"若要啟用此功能，請\\ :ref:`安裝 <general/install>`\\ :guilabel:`網站郵件群組`"
"（`website_mail_group`）模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:13
msgid ""
"The **mail groups** feature is not to be confused with the :doc:`../../"
"marketing/email_marketing/mailing_lists` in the Email Marketing app."
msgstr ""
"**郵件群組**功能不應與電子郵件推廣應用程式中的\\ :doc:`../../marketing/"
"email_marketing/mailing_lists`\\ 混淆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:19
msgid "Configuring mail groups"
msgstr "配置郵件群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:21
msgid "To configure mail groups, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "若要配置郵件群組，請按以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:23
msgid ""
"Configure a custom email alias domain by accessing the **General settings**, "
"scrolling down to the :guilabel:`Discuss` section, enabling "
"the :guilabel:`Custom Email Server` feature, and entering "
"the :guilabel:`Alias domain` (e.g., `@mycompany.com`)."
msgstr ""
"配置自訂電子郵件別名網域：前往**一般設定**，向下捲動到\\ :guilabel:`聊天`\\ "
"區段，啟用\\ :guilabel:`自訂電子郵件伺服器`\\ 功能，並輸入\\ :guilabel:`別名"
"網域`（例如 `@mycompany.com`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:26
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, then "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 郵寄清單`，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`"
"新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:27
msgid ""
"Specify a :guilabel:`Group Name`, the :guilabel:`Email Alias`, and "
"a :guilabel:`Description`."
msgstr ""
"指定\\ :guilabel:`群組名稱`、:guilabel:`電子郵件別名`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`描述"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:28
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Moderate this group` and specify "
"the :guilabel:`Moderators` if you wish to :ref:`moderate messages <website/"
"mailing_lists/moderate>` from this group. Alternatively, if the group is not "
"moderated, you can define :guilabel:`Responsible Users` who can manage the "
"messages in the group."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望\\ :ref:`審核訊息 <website/mailing_lists/moderate>`，請啟用"
"\\ :guilabel:`審核此群組`\\ 並指定\\ :guilabel:`審核人員`。或者，如果群組不需"
"審核，您可以定義\\ :guilabel:`負責使用者`\\ 來管理群組中的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:32
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Privacy` tab, define who can subscribe to the mail group:"
msgstr "在\\ :guilabel:`隱私`\\ 分頁中，定義誰可以訂閱郵件群組："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Everyone`: to make the mail group public so anyone can subscribe "
"to it;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`所有人`：使郵件群組公開，任何人都可以訂閱；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Members only`: to only allow users defined as members to "
"subscribe to the mail group;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`僅限成員`：僅允許定義為成員的使用者訂閱郵件群組；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Selected group of users`: to only allow users from "
"the :guilabel:`Authorized group` to subscribe to the mail group."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`選定的使用者群組`：僅允許來自\\ :guilabel:`授權群組`\\ 的使用者訂"
"閱郵件群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:39
msgid ""
"If the mail group is moderated, you can automatically notify authors when "
"their message is pending moderation by enabling :guilabel:`Automatic "
"notification` in the :guilabel:`Notify Members` tab and writing "
"the :guilabel:`Notification message`."
msgstr ""
"如果郵件群組需要審核，您可以在\\ :guilabel:`通知成員`\\ 分頁中啟用"
"\\ :guilabel:`自動通知`\\ 並撰寫\\ :guilabel:`通知訊息`，以在作者的訊息待審核"
"時自動通知他們。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:42
msgid ""
"If you wish to send out guidelines to new subscribers, "
"enable :guilabel:`Send guidelines to new subscribers` and write them in "
"the :guilabel:`Guidelines` tab. This is particularly useful when the mail "
"group is moderated."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望向新訂閱者發送指南，請啟用\\ :guilabel:`傳送指南給新訂閱者`\\ 並在"
"\\ :guilabel:`指南`\\ 分頁中撰寫指南。這在郵件群組需要審核時特別有用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:47
msgid "Using mail groups"
msgstr "使用郵件群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:50
msgid "Subscribing/unsubscribing"
msgstr "訂閱/取消訂閱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:52
msgid ""
"Based on the :ref:`configuration of the mail group <website/mailing_lists/"
"configure_groups>`, users can subscribe to and unsubscribe from mail groups "
"from the website page (`/groups` by default)."
msgstr ""
"根據\\ :ref:`郵件群組的配置 <website/mailing_lists/configure_groups>`\\ ，使"
"用者可以從網站頁面（預設為 `/groups`）訂閱和取消訂閱郵件群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:55
msgid "Mail group web page."
msgstr "郵件群組網頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:58
msgid ""
"Internal users can also do this from :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, using the :guilabel:`Join` "
"and :guilabel:`Leave` buttons."
msgstr ""
"內部使用者也可以從\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 郵寄清單`\\ 執行此操"
"作，使用\\ :guilabel:`加入`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`離開`\\ 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:62
msgid "Sending messages"
msgstr "傳送訊息中"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:64
msgid ""
"To send messages to a mail group, website users can email the :ref:`mail "
"group's email address <website/mailing_lists/configure_groups>`. Internal "
"users can also create messages directly from Odoo. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, select the "
"mail group, click the :guilabel:`Emails` smart button, and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Then, fill in the fields and click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"若要傳送訊息給郵件群組，網站使用者可以傳送電子郵件至\\ :ref:`郵件群組的電子郵"
"件地址 <website/mailing_lists/configure_groups>`\\ 。內部使用者也可以直接從 "
"Odoo 建立訊息。若要執行此操作，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 郵"
"寄清單`\\ ，選擇郵件群組，按一下\\ :guilabel:`電子郵件`\\ 智慧按鈕，然後按一"
"下\\ :guilabel:`新增`\\ 。然後填寫欄位並按一下\\ :guilabel:`傳送`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:71
msgid ""
"The list of messages can also be accessed by selecting the group from the `/"
"groups` website page."
msgstr "訊息清單也可以透過從 `/groups` 網站頁面選擇群組來存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:73
msgid ""
"Group members can also unsubscribe from the group, access the mail group "
"page, and send emails to the group using the URLs in the footer of any group "
"email they have received."
msgstr ""
"群組成員也可以使用他們收到的任何群組電子郵件頁尾中的網址來取消訂閱群組、存取"
"郵件群組頁面並傳送電子郵件給群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:76
msgid "URLs in the footer of a group email."
msgstr "群組電子郵件頁尾中的網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:82
msgid "Moderating mail group messages"
msgstr "審核郵件群組訊息"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:84
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Moderate this group` feature has been enabled for "
"the :ref:`mail group <website/mailing_lists/configure_groups>`, one of "
"the :guilabel:`Moderators` must approve the group's messages before they are "
"dispatched to the other members."
msgstr ""
"如果已為\\ :ref:`郵件群組 <website/mailing_lists/configure_groups>`\\ 啟用"
"\\ :guilabel:`審核此群組`\\ 功能，則其中一位\\ :guilabel:`審核員`\\ 必須在訊"
"息發送給其他成員之前批准群組的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:88
msgid ""
"To moderate messages, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Mailing Lists`, select the mail group, and click the :guilabel:`To review` "
"smart button. You can moderate messages using the buttons at the end of the "
"message line or select a message to view its content and moderate it "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"若要審核訊息，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 郵寄清單`\\ ，選擇郵"
"件群組，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`待審核`\\ 智慧按鈕。您可以使用訊息資料行末端"
"的按鈕來審核訊息，或選擇一則訊息以檢視其內容並相應地進行審核。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:93
msgid "Moderation buttons in the message line."
msgstr "訊息資料行中的審核按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:96
msgid "The following actions are available:"
msgstr "以下動作可用："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Accept`: to accept the email and send it to the mail group "
"members."
msgstr ":guilabel:`接受`\\ ：接受電子郵件並傳送給郵件群組成員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reject`: to reject the email. In the pop-up window that opens, "
"click :guilabel:`Reject Silently` to reject the email without notifying the "
"author, or specify an explanation for rejecting the message, then "
"click :guilabel:`Send & Reject` to reject the message and send the "
"explanation to the author."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`拒絕`\\ ：拒絕電子郵件。在開啟的彈出視窗中，按一下\\ :guilabel:`靜"
"默拒絕`\\ 以在不通知作者的情況下拒絕電子郵件，或指定拒絕訊息的說明，然後按一"
"下\\ :guilabel:`傳送並拒絕`\\ 以拒絕訊息並將說明傳送給作者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Whitelist`: to whitelist the author, i.e. automatically accept "
"all of their emails. As a result, a :ref:`moderation rule <website/"
"mailing_lists/moderate>` is created for the author's email address with the "
"status :guilabel:`Always allow`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`加入白名單`\\ ：將作者加入白名單，即自動接受他們的所有電子郵件。因"
"此，會為作者的電子郵件地址建立一條\\ :ref:`審核規則 <website/mailing_lists/"
"moderate>`\\ ，狀態為\\ :guilabel:`永遠允許`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ban`: to blacklist the author, i.e. automatically discard all "
"their emails. In the pop-up window that opens, click :guilabel:`Ban` to ban "
"the author without notifying them, or specify an explanation, then "
"click :guilabel:`Send & Ban` to ban the author and send them the "
"explanation. As a result, a :ref:`moderation rule <website/mailing_lists/"
"moderate>` is created for the author's email address with the "
"status :guilabel:`Permanent ban`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`封禁`\\ ：將作者加入黑名單，即自動捨棄他們的所有電子郵件。在開啟的"
"彈出視窗中，按一下\\ :guilabel:`封禁`\\ 以在不通知作者的情況下封禁他們，或指"
"定說明，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`傳送並封禁`\\ 以封禁作者並將說明傳送給他們。"
"因此，會為作者的電子郵件地址建立一條\\ :ref:`審核規則 <website/mailing_lists/"
"moderate>`\\ ，狀態為\\ :guilabel:`永久封禁`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:113
msgid ""
"Messages can also be moderated from the group's list of messages. Go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Groups --> Mailing List Groups`, select the "
"mail group and click the :guilabel:`Emails` smart button."
msgstr ""
"訊息也可以從群組的訊息清單中進行審核。前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 群組 --"
"> 郵寄清單群組`\\ ，選擇郵件群組並按一下\\ :guilabel:`電子郵件`\\ 智慧按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:120
msgid "Whitelisting/Blacklisting authors"
msgstr "將作者設為白名單/黑名單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:122
msgid ""
"You can whitelist or blacklist an author either directly :ref:`from a mail "
"group message <website/mailing_lists/moderate>`, or by creating a moderation "
"rule. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Moderation Rules` and click :guilabel:`New`. Then, select "
"the :guilabel:`Group`, specify the author's :guilabel:`Email` and set "
"the :guilabel:`Status` field."
msgstr ""
"您可以直接\\ :ref:`從郵件群組訊息 <website/mailing_lists/moderate>`\\ 將作者"
"設為白名單或黑名單，或透過建立審核規則來進行。若要這樣做，請前往"
"\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 審核規則`\\ 並按一下\\ :guilabel:`新增"
"`\\ 。然後，選擇\\ :guilabel:`群組`\\ ，指定作者的\\ :guilabel:`電子郵件`\\ "
"並設定\\ :guilabel:`狀態`\\ 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:129
msgid ""
"You can also access the mail group's moderation rules by going "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, selecting "
"the group, then clicking the :guilabel:`Moderations` smart button."
msgstr ""
"您也可以前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 郵寄清單`\\ 來存取郵件群組的"
"審核規則，選擇群組，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`審核`\\ 智慧按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:3
msgid "Website analytics"
msgstr "網站分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:5
msgid ""
"Website analytics helps website owners monitor how people use their site. It "
"provides data on visitor demographics, behavior, and interactions, helping "
"improve websites and marketing strategies."
msgstr ""
"網站分析可協助網站擁有者監控訪客如何使用其網站。它提供訪客人口統計、行為和互"
"動的資料，有助於改善網站和行銷策略。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can track your Odoo website's traffic using :ref:`analytics/plausible` "
"or :ref:`analytics/google-analytics`. We recommend using Plausible.io as it "
"is privacy-friendly, lightweight, and easy to use."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用\\ :ref:`analytics/plausible`\\ 或\\ :ref:`analytics/google-"
"analytics`\\ 來追蹤您的 Odoo 網站流量。我們建議使用 Plausible.io，因為它重視"
"隱私、輕量且易於使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:15
msgid "Plausible.io"
msgstr "Plausible.io"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:17
msgid ""
"Odoo hosts its own Plausible.io server, and the Plausible Analytics "
"dashboard is integrated into Odoo and can be accessed "
"via :menuselection:`Website --> Reporting --> Analytics`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 以其自行主機的 Plausible.io 伺服器為基礎，並將 Plausible 分析儒板整合到 "
"Odoo 中，可透過\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 報表 --> 分析`\\ 進行訪唏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:20
msgid ""
"Databases hosted on Odoo Online benefit from a free, ready-to-use "
"Plausible.io solution with automatically generated credentials and a "
"preconfigured Plausible account. To enable it, go to :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`, then, in the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Plausible Analytics`, and click :guilabel:`Save`. "
"The credentials are automatically filled in the :guilabel:`Shared Link Auth` "
"and the :guilabel:`Site` fields."
msgstr ""
"託管於 Odoo Online 的資料庫可享用免費、即插即用的 Plausible.io 解決方案，其憑"
"證資訊和 Plausible 帳號均為預先設置完成。要啟用此功能，請前往\\ "
":menuselection:`網站 --> 設置 --> 設定`\\ ，然後在\\ :guilabel:`追蹤與 SEO`\\"
" 區段中，啟用\\ :guilabel:`Plausible 分析`\\ ，並按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ "
"。憑證資訊會自動填入到\\ :guilabel:`共享連結認證`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`網站`\\ "
"欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:27
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`See Analytics Report` link to "
"open the corresponding report."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :icon:`fa-arrow-right`\\ :guilabel:`查看分析報表`\\ 連結以開啟相應報"
"表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:31
msgid ""
"**If you already have a Plausible.io account** and you want to connect it to "
"your Odoo Online database, you must create two `ir.config.parameters` to use "
"Plausible.io's servers. To do so, enable the :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>` and go to :menuselection:`General Settings --> Technical --> System "
"Parameters`. Click :guilabel:`New` and fill in the following :guilabel:`Key` "
"and :guilabel:`Value` fields:"
msgstr ""
"**如果您已經擁有 Plausible.io 帳戶**並希望將其連線到您的 Odoo 雲端版資料庫，"
"您必須建立兩個 `ir.config.parameters` 才能使用 Plausible.io 的伺服器。若要這"
"樣做，請啟用\\ :ref:`開發者模式 <developer-mode>`\\ 並前往\\ :menuselection:`"
"一般設定 --> 技術 --> 系統參數`\\ 。按一下\\ :guilabel:`新增`\\ 並填寫以下"
"\\ :guilabel:`鍵`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`值`\\ 欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:40
msgid "Key"
msgstr "鍵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:41
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:42
msgid "`website.plausible_script`"
msgstr "`website.plausible_script`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:43
msgid "`https://plausible.io/js/plausible.js`"
msgstr "`https://plausible.io/js/plausible.js`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:44
msgid "`website.plausible_server`"
msgstr "`website.plausible_server`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:45
msgid "`https://plausible.io`"
msgstr "`https://plausible.io`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:47
msgid ""
"Then, go to the Plausible website and follow the steps to :ref:`set up your "
"account <analytics/account-setting>` and link it to your Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"然後，前往 Plausible 網站並依照步驟\\ :ref:`設定您的帳戶 <analytics/account-"
"setting>`\\ 並將其連結到您的 Odoo 資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:51
msgid ""
"Deactivating the free Plausible.io account linked to your **Odoo Online** "
"database will also remove the existing keys. As a result, new keys will be "
"generated, while all historical data will remain associated with the old "
"keys. If you plan to deactivate the account, it is recommended to save the "
"existing keys to preserve access to that data."
msgstr ""
"停用與您的 **Odoo 雲端版**資料庫連結的免費 Plausible.io 帳戶也會移除現有的金"
"鑰。因此，將產生新的金鑰，而所有歷史資料將繼續與舊金鑰關聯。如果您打算停用該"
"帳戶，建議您儲存現有金鑰以保留對這些資料的存取權限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:56
msgid ""
"If your database is hosted on Odoo.sh or On-premise, you need to create your "
"own Plausible.io account or use an existing one and link it to your "
"database. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"如果您的資料庫是託管在 Odoo.sh 或本地端，您需要建立自己的 Plausible.io 帳號，"
"或使用現有帳號並將其連結至您的資料庫。要做到這一點，請遵循以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:61
msgid ""
"`Create <https://plausible.io/register>`_ or `sign in <https://plausible.io/"
"login>`_ to a Plausible.io account."
msgstr ""
"`建立 <https://plausible.io/register>`_ 或 `登入 <https://plausible.io/login>"
"`_ Plausible.io 帳號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:63
msgid ""
"If you are creating a new account, go through the registration and "
"activation steps. On the :guilabel:`Add a website` page, enter your "
"website :guilabel:`Domain` name without including `www` or `http` (e.g., "
"`example.com`), and click :guilabel:`Add site`. On the :guilabel:`Add "
"tracking to your site` page, follow the instructions to install Plausible on "
"your site. Once done, click :guilabel:`I've installed it` to proceed to the "
"next step."
msgstr ""
"如果您正在建立新帳號，請完成註冊和激活步驟。在\\ :guilabel:`新增網站`\\ 頁面"
"上，輸入您的網站\\ :guilabel:`網域`\\ 名稱（不要包含 `www` 或 `http`，例如 "
"`example.com`），並按一下\\ :guilabel:`新增網站`\\ 。在\\ :guilabel:`為您的網"
"站新增追蹤`\\ 頁面上，遵循指示在您的網站上安裝 Plausible。完成後，按一下\\ "
":guilabel:`我已安裝`\\ 以進行下一步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:68
msgid ""
"Once done, click the Plausible.io logo in the upper-left part of the page to "
"access the `list of websites <https://plausible.io/sites>`_, then click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`ellipsis`) icon next to the website "
"and select :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Settings`."
msgstr ""
"完成後，按一下頁面左上角的 Plausible.io 標誌以存取 `網站清單 <https://"
"plausible.io/sites>`_\\ ，然後按一下網站旁邊的\\ :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`\\ "
"（\\ :guilabel:`ellipsis`\\ ）圖示，並選擇\\ :icon:`fa-cog`\\ "
"\\ :guilabel:`Settings`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:72
msgid "Click the gear icon in the list of websites."
msgstr "在網站清單中按一下齒輪圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:75
msgid ""
"In the sidebar, select :guilabel:`Visibility`, then click :guilabel:`Add "
"shared link`."
msgstr ""
"在側邊欄中，選擇\\ :guilabel:`可見度`\\ ，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`加入共用連"
"結`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:76
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`Name`, keep the :guilabel:`Password protect` option "
"disabled, as the Plausible analytics dashboard integration in Odoo does not "
"support it, then click :guilabel:`Create shared link`."
msgstr ""
"輸入\\ :guilabel:`Name`\\ ，保持\\ :guilabel:`Password protect`\\ 選項停用，"
"因為 Odoo 中的 Plausible 分析 Dashboard 整合不支援此功能，然後按一下"
"\\ :guilabel:`Create shared link`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:79
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-files-o` :guilabel:`COPY` to add the shared link to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr "按一下\\ :icon:`fa-files-o`\\ :guilabel:`複製`\\ 以將共享連結新增到剪貼簿。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:81
msgid "Copy the shared link URL from Plausible.io"
msgstr "從 Plausible.io 複製共用連結網址"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:127
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:175
msgid "In Odoo, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中，前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:85
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` section, enable :guilabel:`Plausible "
"Analytics`, then paste the :guilabel:`Shared Link Auth` and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO`\\ 區段中，啟用\\ :guilabel:`Plausible "
"Analytics`\\ ，然後貼上\\ :guilabel:`Shared Link Auth`\\ 並按一下"
"\\ :guilabel:`Save`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:89
msgid ""
"If you have :doc:`multiple websites <../configuration/multi_website>`, add "
"them to your Plausible.io account by going to `<https://plausible.io/"
"sites>`_ and clicking :guilabel:`+ Add Website`. In the Odoo Website "
"settings, ensure that the correct website is selected from the dropdown menu "
"at the top of the page before pasting the shared link."
msgstr ""
"如果您有\\ :doc:`多個網站 <../configuration/multi_website>`\\ ，請前往 "
"`<https://plausible.io/sites>`_ 並按一下\\ :guilabel:`+ 新增網站`\\ ，將它們"
"新增到您的 Plausible.io 帳號中。在 Odoo 網站設定中，在貼上共享連結之前，請確"
"認頁面頂部下拉選單中已選取正確的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:93
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically pushes two custom goals: `Lead Generation` and `Shop`. "
"Custom goals can be added via Plausible.io. To do so, click the :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`ellipsis`) button on the relevant website card, then "
"navigate to :guilabel:`Goals` in the sidebar menu, and click :guilabel:`Add "
"goal` :icon:`fa-caret-down`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會自動推送兩個自訂目標：`Lead Generation` 與 `Shop`。自訂目標可透過 "
"Plausible.io 新增。若要這樣做，請按一下\\ :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`省略號`) 按鈕，然後在側邊欄選單中導覽至\\ :guilabel:`目標`，並按"
"一下\\ :guilabel:`新增目標`\\ :icon:`fa-caret-down`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:99
msgid "`Plausible Analytics documentation <https://plausible.io/docs>`_"
msgstr "`Plausible Analytics 使用說明 <https://plausible.io/docs>`_"

