msgstr ""
"使用以下連結建立或登入 Google 帳戶：`<https://analytics.google.com>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:109
msgid ""
"If you are setting up Google Analytics for the first time, "
"click :guilabel:`Start measuring` and go through the account creation step."
msgstr ""
"如果您是第一次設定 Google Analytics（分析），請按一下\\ :guilabel:`開始評估"
