#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:111
msgid ""
"If you already have a Google Analytics account, sign in and click "
"the :icon:`fa-cog` icon in the bottom-left corner of the page to access "
"the :guilabel:`Admin` page. Then, click :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Create` :icon:`fa-caret-down` and "
"select :guilabel:`Property` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"如果您已經擁有 Google Analytics 帳號，請登入並按一下\\ :icon:`fa-cog`\\ 圖祮"
"，位於頁面左下角，以存取\\ :guilabel:`管理`\\ 頁面。然後，按一下\\ :icon:`fa-"
"plus`\\ :guilabel:`建立`\\ :icon:`fa-caret-down`\\ 並從下拉選單中選取\\ "
":guilabel:`資產`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:115
msgid ""
"Complete the next steps: `property creation <https://support.google.com/"
"analytics/answer/9304153?hl=en/"
"&visit_id=638278591144564289-3612494643&rd=2#property>`_, :guilabel:`Business "
