"duplicate-page>`, :ref:`deleted <website/pages/delete-page>`, "
"and :ref:`redirected <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 可讓您\\ :ref:`建立 <website/pages/page_creation>`\\ 各種類型的網頁，包"
"括透過\\ :ref:`AI 人工智慧 <website/pages/ai-generator>`\\ 的協助，:ref:`發"
"佈 <website/pages/un-publish-page>`\\ 這些網頁，並透過設定\\ :ref:`頁面屬性 "
"<website/pages/page_properties>`\\ 來定義其結構和可見性。頁面可以被\\ :ref:`"
"複製 <website/pages/duplicate-page>`、:ref:`刪除 <website/pages/delete-"
"page>`\\ 以及\\ :ref:`重新導向 <website/pages/URL-redirection>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:16
msgid "Page types"
msgstr "頁面類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Static** pages, such as the homepage or :ref:`custom <website/pages/"
"page_creation>` pages, contain fixed content that does not change "
"dynamically. You can manually create these pages, define their URLs, and "
"adapt their :ref:`properties <website/pages/page_properties>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"**靜態**頁面，例如首頁或\\ :ref:`自訂 <website/pages/page_creation>`\\ 頁面，"
"包含固定內容且不會動態變更。您可以手動建立這些頁面、定義其網址，並根據需要調"
"整其\\ :ref:`屬性 <website/pages/page_properties>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Dynamic** pages, on the other hand, display content that changes "
"automatically based on the data in the database and user interaction (e.g., "
"filtering). They are generated automatically by Odoo, for example, when "
"installing an app or module (e.g., `/shop` or `/blog`) or publishing a "
"new :doc:`product <../../ecommerce>` or :doc:`blog post <../../blog>`. "
"Dynamic pages are managed differently from static pages."
msgstr ""
"**動態**頁面則會根據資料庫中的資料和使用者互動（例如篩選）自動顯示變更的內"
"容。這些頁面由 Odoo 自動產生，例如在安裝應用程式或模組時（例如 `/shop` 或 `/"
"blog`），或是發佈新的\\ :doc:`產品 <../../ecommerce>`\\ 或\\ :doc:`部落格文"
"章 <../../blog>`\\ 時。動態頁面的管理方式與靜態頁面不同。"

