msgstr ""
"更新連結（或設定\\ :ref:`重新導向 <website/pages/URL-redirection>`\\ ）後，勾"
"選\\ :guilabel:`我確定要執行此操作。`\\ 勾選方格，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`刪"
"除`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:189
msgid "URL redirect mapping"
msgstr "網址重新導向對應"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:191
msgid ""
"URL redirect mapping involves sending visitors and search engines to a URL "
"other than the one they initially requested. This technique is used, for "
"example, to prevent broken links when :ref:`deleting a page <website/pages/"
"delete-page>`, :ref:`modifying its URL <website/pages/page_properties>`, or "
"migrating the site from another platform to an Odoo :doc:`domain <../"
"configuration/domain_names>`. It can also be used to improve :doc:`seo`."
msgstr ""
"網址重新導向對應涉及將訪客和搜尋引擎傳送至與他們最初請求的網址不同的網址。例"
"如，此技術用於在\\ :ref:`刪除頁面 <website/pages/delete-page>`\\ 、\\ :ref:`"
"修改其網址 <website/pages/page_properties>`\\ 或將網站從另一個平台遷移至 "
"Odoo\\ :doc:`網域 <../configuration/domain_names>`\\ 時防止連結失效。它也可用"
"於改善\\ :doc:`seo`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:198
msgid ""
"A redirect record is added automatically every time you :ref:`modify a "
"page's URL <website/pages/page_properties>` and enable :guilabel:`Redirect "
"Old URL`."
msgstr ""
"每次\\ :ref:`修改頁面網址 <website/pages/page_properties>`\\ 並啟用"
"\\ :guilabel:`重新導向舊網址`\\ 時，系統會自動加入重新導向記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:200
msgid ""
"Redirections can be configured for :ref:`static and dynamic pages <website/"
"pages/page_type>`."
msgstr ""
"可以為\\ :ref:`靜態和動態頁面 <website/pages/page_type>`\\ 配置重新導向。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:202
msgid ""
"To access existing URL redirections and create new ones, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Redirects`, "
"click :guilabel:`New` in the :guilabel:`Rewrite` view, then adapt the fields:"
msgstr ""
"若要存取現有的網址重新導向並建立新的重新導向，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網"
"站 --> 設定 --> 重新導向`\\ ，按一下\\ :guilabel:`新增`\\ ，位於\\ "
":guilabel:`重寫`\\ 檢視中，然後調整欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:206
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: Enter a name to identify the redirect."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`名稱`\\ ：輸入名稱以識別該重新導向。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:207
msgid ":guilabel:`Action`: Select the type of redirection:"
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`動作`\\ ：選擇重新導向的類型："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`404 Not found`: Visitors land on a 404 error page when they try "
"to access an unpublished or deleted page."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`404 找不到`\\ ：當訪客嘗試存取未發布或已刪除的頁面時，會進入 "
"404 錯誤頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`301 Moved permanently`: for permanent redirections of unpublished "
"or deleted :ref:`static pages <website/pages/page_type>`. The new URL is "
"shown in search engine results, and the redirect is cached by browsers."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`301 永久移動`\\ ：用於未發布或已刪除\\ :ref:`靜態頁面 <website/"
"pages/page_type>`\\ 的永久重新導向。新網址會顯示在搜尋引擎結果中，且重新導向"
"會被瀏覽器快取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`302 Moved temporarily`: for short-term redirections, for example, "
"if you are redesigning or updating a page. The new URL is neither cached by "
"browsers nor shown in search engine results."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`302 暫時移動`\\ ：用於短期重新導向，例如，如果您正在重新設計或"
"更新頁面。新網址既不會被瀏覽器快取，也不會顯示在搜尋引擎結果中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`308 Redirect / Rewrite`: for permanent redirections where the "
"original URL is rewritten (typically used for :ref:`dynamic pages <website/"
"pages/page_type>`). The URL is renamed; the new name appears in search "
"engine results and is cached by browsers. Use this redirect type to rename a "
"dynamic page, for example, if you wish to rename `/shop` into `/market`."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`308 重新導向 / 重寫`\\ ：用於重寫原始網址的永久重新導向（通常用"
"於\\ :ref:`動態頁面 <website/pages/page_type>`\\ ）。網址已重新命名；新名稱會"
"顯示在搜尋引擎結果中，並被瀏覽器快取。使用此重新導向類型重新命名動態頁面，例"
"如，如果您希望將 `/shop` 重新命名為 `/market`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:223
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL from`: Enter the URL to be redirected (e.g., `/about-the-"
"company`) or search for the desired :ref:`dynamic page <website/pages/"
"page_type>` and select it from the list."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`來源網址`\\ ：輸入要重新導向的網址（例如\\ `/about-the-"
"company`）或搜尋所需的\\ :ref:`動態頁面 <website/pages/page_type>`\\ 並從清單"
"中選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL to`: For 301, 302, and 308 redirects, enter the URL to be "
"redirected to. If you want to redirect to an external URL, include the "
"protocol (e.g., `https://`)."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`目標網址`\\ ：對於 301、302 和 308 重新導向，輸入要重新導向至的"
"網址。如果您要重新導向至外部網址，請包含通訊協定（例如\\ `https://`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:227
msgid ":guilabel:`Website`: Select a specific website."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`網站`\\ ：選擇特定網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:228
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Active`: Toggle the switch off to deactivate the redirection."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`啟用`\\ ：關閉開關以停用重新導向。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:231
msgid ""
"You can also define the order in which redirections are performed, e.g., in "
"the case of redirect chains (i.e., a series of redirects where one URL is "
"redirected to another one, which is itself further redirected to another "
"URL). To do so, :doc:`activate the developer mode </applications/general/"
"developer_mode>`, access the :guilabel:`Rewrite` form, and define "
"a :guilabel:`Sequence`."
msgstr ""
"您也可以定義重新導向執行的順序，例如在重新導向鏈的情況下（即一系列重新導向，"
"其中一個網址被重新導向至另一個網址，而該網址本身又被重新導向至另一個網址）。"
"若要這樣做，請\\ :doc:`啟用開發者模式 </applications/general/developer_mode>"
"`\\ ，存取\\ :guilabel:`重寫`\\ 表單，並定義一個\\ :guilabel:`順序`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:238
msgid ""
"301 and 302 redirects are commonly used to redirect traffic "
"from :ref:`unpublished <website/pages/un-publish-page>` or :ref:`deleted "
"<website/pages/delete-page>` *static* pages to new pages. The 308 redirect "
"is typically used for permanent URL rewrites, especially for *dynamic* "
"pages. A 404 status is used when a page no longer exists, and no redirection "
"is configured."
msgstr ""
"301 和 302 重新導向通常用於將流量從\\ :ref:`未發布 <website/pages/un-publish-"
"page>`\\ 或\\ :ref:`已刪除 <website/pages/delete-page>`\\ 的*靜態*頁面重新導"
"向至新頁面。308 重新導向通常用於永久網址重寫，特別是*動態*頁面。當頁面不再存"
"在且未配置重新導向時，會使用 404 狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:245
msgid ""
"`Google documentation on redirects and search <https://developers.google.com/"
"search/docs/crawling-indexing/301-redirects>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google 關於重新導向與搜尋的使用說明\\ <https://developers.google.com/search/"
"docs/crawling-indexing/301-redirects>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:246
msgid ":doc:`seo`"
msgstr ":doc:`seo`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:5
msgid ""
"Search Engine Optimization, often abbreviated as SEO, is a digital marketing "
"strategy to improve a website's visibility and ranking in search engine "
"results (e.g., in Google). It involves optimizing various elements on your "
"website, including its content, social sharing, URLs, images, and page speed."
msgstr ""
"搜尋引擎最佳化（通常簡稱為 SEO）是一種數位行銷策略，用於提升網站在搜尋引擎結"
"果（例如 Google）中的可見度和排名。它涉及最佳化網站上的各種元素，包括內容、社"
"群分享、網址、圖片和頁面速度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:11
msgid ""
"Several modules are provided to help build the website's content, such "
"as :doc:`eCommerce <../../ecommerce>`, :doc:`Blog <../../"
"blog>`, :doc:`eLearning <../../elearning>`, and :doc:`Forum <../../forum>`."
msgstr ""
"提供了多個模組來協助建立網站內容，例如\\ :doc:`電子商務 <../../"
"ecommerce>`、:doc:`部落格 <../../blog>`、:doc:`網上學習 <../../elearning>`\\ "
"和\\ :doc:`論壇 <../../forum>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:14
msgid ""
"All provided :doc:`themes <../web_design/themes>` are built with the "
"`Bootstrap <https://getbootstrap.com/>`_ CSS framework to ensure responsive "
"layouts across desktop, tablet, or mobile, which can support SEO."
msgstr ""
"所有提供的\\ :doc:`主題 <../web_design/themes>`\\ 均採用 `Bootstrap <https://"
"getbootstrap.com/>`_ CSS 框架建立，以確保桌面、平板或行動裝置的響應式佈局，可"
"支援 SEO。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:19
msgid ""
"`Magic Sheet - Optimize your website [PDF] <https://drive.google.com/drive/"
"folders/1Ywip4tWF2DPkcBaEbeXJxIZg2CjkwKgb>`_"
msgstr ""
"`精妙筆記 - 優化網站設定 [PDF] <https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/"
"1Ywip4tWF2DPkcBaEbeXJxIZg2CjkwKgb>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:23
msgid "Content optimization"
msgstr "內容最佳化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:25
msgid ""
"To optimize a webpage's SEO, access the page, then go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Optimize SEO`."
msgstr ""
"若要最佳化網頁的 SEO，請存取該頁面，然後前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 網站 "
"--> 最佳化 SEO`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:28
msgid "Search Engine Optimization"
msgstr "搜尋引擎最佳化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:32
msgid ""
"Changing the title of a blog post or the name of a product automatically "
"updates the link to the related webpage. The old link still functions as "
"a :ref:`301 redirect <website/pages/URL-redirection>` is created, "
"maintaining the SEO."
msgstr ""
"變更部落格文章的標題或產品名稱會自動更新相關網頁的連結。舊連結仍然有效，因為"
"已建立\\ :ref:`301 重新導向 <website/pages/URL-redirection>`，維持 SEO。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:37
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Fill with AI` to automatically generate a meta title, a "
"description, and get keyword suggestions."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :guilabel:`使用 AI 人工智能填寫`\\ 以自動產生標題、描述和關鍵字建"
"議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:39
msgid ""
"Remove incorrect URLs from the :guilabel:`Broken Link` field and select "
"valid ones to prevent errors."
msgstr ""
"從\\ :guilabel:`無效連結`\\ 欄位中移除錯誤的網址，並選擇有效的網址以避免錯"
"誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:43
msgid "Keywords and meta tags"
msgstr "關鍵字和中繼標籤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:45
msgid "There are two types of keywords in SEO, which serve different purposes."
msgstr "SEO 中有兩種類型的關鍵字，它們的用途不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:48
msgid "In-text keywords"
msgstr "文內關鍵字"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:50
msgid ""
"In-text keywords appear naturally throughout a page’s visible content "
"(titles, headings, and body text) and help search engines determine the "
"topic and relevance of the page. These keywords have a real impact on "
"ranking. They cannot be edited in the :guilabel:`optimize SEO` pop-up."
msgstr ""
"文內關鍵字會自然地出現在頁面的可見內容（標題、標頭和正文）中，有助於搜尋引擎"
"判斷頁面的主題和相關性。這些關鍵字對排名有實際影響。它們無法在\\ :guilabel:`"
"最佳化 SEO`\\ 彈出視窗中進行編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:55
msgid "It is strongly recommended to only use one H1 title per page for SEO."
msgstr "強烈建議每個頁面僅使用一個 H1 標題，以利於 SEO。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:60
msgid "Meta tags and meta keywords"
msgstr "中繼標籤和中繼關鍵字"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Meta tags** are HTML elements that provide information about a webpage to "
"search engines and website visitors. They play a crucial role in SEO by "
"helping search engines understand the content and context of a webpage and "
"attract visitors with appealing content. They can be edited in "
"the :guilabel:`optimize SEO` pop-up. There are two types of meta tags:"
msgstr ""
"**中繼標記**是 HTML 元素，為搜尋引擎和網站訪客提供有關網頁的資訊。它們在 SEO "
"中扮演關鍵角色，協助搜尋引擎了解網頁的內容和情境，並以吸引人的內容吸引訪客。"
"可在\\ :guilabel:`最佳化 SEO`\\ 彈出視窗中編輯。中繼標記有兩種類型："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Title` tags specify a webpage's title and are displayed as a "
"clickable link in search engine results. They should be concise, "
"descriptive, and relevant to the page's content. You can update the title "
"tag of your webpage or keep it empty to use the default value based on the "
"page’s content."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`標題`\\ 標籤指定網頁的標題，並在搜尋引擎結果中顯示為可點擊的連結。"
"標題應簡潔、具描述性且與頁面內容相關。您可以更新網頁的標題標籤，或保持空白以"
"使用基於頁面內容的預設值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description` tags summarize the webpage's content, often "
"displayed in search engine results below the title. They are used to "
"encourage the user to visit the page. Update the description tag of the "
"webpage, or keep it empty to use the default description based on the page's "
"content."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`描述`\\ 標記摘要說明網頁內容，通常在搜尋引擎結果中顯示於標題下方。"
"用於鼓勵使用者造訪該頁面。更新網頁的描述標記，或保持空白以使用根據頁面內容的"
"預設描述。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:78
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Preview` card displays how the title and description tags "
"should appear in search results. It also includes the URL of your page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預覽`\\ 卡片顯示標題和描述標籤在搜尋結果中的呈現方式。它還包含您頁"
"面的網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Meta keywords** are placed in a hidden HTML tag `<meta "
"name=\"keywords\">`. Once used to describe a page’s topic, this tag is now "
"ignored by major search engines and has little or no impact on SEO. To "
"edit :guilabel:`Keywords`, enter the keywords you consider essential in this "
"field and click :guilabel:`Add` to see how they are used at different levels "
"in your content (H1, H2, page title, page description, page content) and the "
"related searches in Google. The tool also suggests relevant keywords."
msgstr ""
"**中繼關鍵字**會放在隱藏的 HTML 標籤「<meta name=\"keywords\">」中。此標籤曾"
"用於描述頁面的主題，但現在主要搜尋引擎已忽略它，對 SEO 的影響很小或沒有影響。"
"若要編輯\\ :guilabel:`關鍵字`\\ ，請在此欄位中輸入您認為必要的關鍵字，然後按"
"一下\\ :guilabel:`加入`\\ ，以查看它們在內容的不同層級（H1、H2、頁面標題、頁"
"面說明、頁面內容）中如何使用，以及 Google 中的相關搜尋。該工具也會建議相關的"
"關鍵字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:91
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:64
msgid "Images"
msgstr "圖片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:93
msgid ""
"The size of images has a significant impact on page speed, which is an "
"essential criterion for search engines to optimize SEO ranking."
msgstr ""
"圖片大小對頁面速度有顯著影響，而頁面速度是搜尋引擎最佳化 SEO 排名的重要標準。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:97
msgid ""
"Compare how your website ranks using `Google Page Speed <https://"
"pagespeed.web.dev/?utm_source=psi&utm_medium=redirect>`_ or `Pingdom Website "
"Speed Test <https://tools.pingdom.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ `Google Page Speed <https://pagespeed.web.dev/?"
"utm_source=psi&utm_medium=redirect>`_\\ 或\\ `Pingdom Website Speed Test "
"<https://tools.pingdom.com/>`_\\ 比較您網站的排名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:100
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically compresses uploaded images and converts them to `Webp`. "
"With this file format, photos are smaller, which increases the page loading "
"speed and, therefore, gives a better ranking in SEO. All images used in Odoo "
"official :doc:`themes <../web_design/themes>` are also compressed by default."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會自動壓縮上傳的圖片並將其轉換為 `Webp`。使用此檔案格式，照片較小，可提"
"升頁面載入速度，因此在 SEO 中獲得更好的排名。Odoo 官方\\ :doc:`主題 <../"
"web_design/themes>`\\ 中使用的所有圖片預設也會被壓縮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:106
msgid "Third-party themes may not compress images efficiently."
msgstr "第三方主題可能無法有效壓縮圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:109
msgid ""
"**To modify an image** from a webpage, select the image, "
"click :guilabel:`Edit`, then go to the :guilabel:`Customize` tab, and adapt "
"the :guilabel:`Format` in the :guilabel:`Image` section."
msgstr ""
"**若要修改**網頁中的圖片，請選擇圖片，按一下\\ :guilabel:`編輯`，然後前往"
"\\ :guilabel:`自訂`\\ 分頁，並在\\ :guilabel:`圖片`\\ 區段中調整"
"\\ :guilabel:`格式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:113
msgid ""
"Alt tags are used to provide context to what an image is displaying, "
"informing search engine crawlers and allowing them to index an image "
"correctly. Adding alt tags keywords in the :guilabel:`Description` field is "
"essential from an SEO perspective. This description is added to the HTML "
"code of your image, and it is shown when the image cannot be displayed."
msgstr ""
"替代文字標籤用於提供圖片顯示內容的背景資訊，告知搜尋引擎爬蟲並讓它們能夠正確"
"索引圖片。從 SEO 角度來看，在\\ :guilabel:`描述`\\ 欄位中加入替代文字關鍵字至"
"關重要。此描述會加入到圖片的 HTML 程式碼中，並在圖片無法顯示時顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:119
msgid "Image for social share"
msgstr "社群分享圖片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:121
msgid ""
"When you share a page on social media, the website logo is selected by "
"default. Search the :doc:`Unsplash image library <../../../general/"
"integrations/unsplash>` or upload any other image by clicking the :icon:`fa-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(upload)` button."
msgstr ""
"在社群媒體上分享頁面時，預設會選擇網站標誌。搜尋\\ :doc:`Unsplash 圖片庫 "
"<../../../general/integrations/unsplash>`\\ 或按一下\\ :icon:`fa-"
"upload` :guilabel:`上傳`\\ 按鈕來上傳任何其他圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:126
msgid ""
"To set a default social share image, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` section, "
"enable :guilabel:`Default Social Share Image`."
msgstr ""
"若要設定預設的社群分享圖片，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定"
"`。在\\ :guilabel:`追蹤與 SEO`\\ 區段下，啟用\\ :guilabel:`預設社群分享圖片"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:131
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Social Preview` card displays how the page's information "
"would appear when shared."
msgstr ":guilabel:`社群預覽`\\ 卡片顯示頁面資訊在分享時的呈現方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:135
msgid "Indexation"
msgstr "索引"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:137
msgid ""
"Website indexation is the process by which search engines, such as Google, "
"discover, analyze, and store information about a website's content in their "
"database. Search engine bots, known as crawlers or spiders, visit web pages "
"and follow links to collect data, including text, images, and other media. "
"The purpose of indexation is to make a website's content searchable and "
"discoverable to users. Without being indexed, a website or a specific page "
"on that site will not appear in search engine results, regardless of how "
"relevant or well-designed it is. Indexation is a fundamental step "
"in :abbr:`SEO (Search Engine Optimization)`, serving as the foundation for a "
"website's visibility and organic traffic."
msgstr ""
"網站索引是搜尋引擎（例如 Google）探索、分析並將網站內容資訊儲存在其資料庫中的"
"過程。稱為爬蟲或蜘蛛的搜尋引擎機器人會造訪網頁並跟隨連結來收集資料，包括文"
"字、圖片和其他媒體。索引的目的是使網站的內容可供使用者搜尋和探索。如果沒有被"
"索引，無論網站或該網站上的特定頁面有多相關或設計得多好，都不會出現在搜尋引擎"
"結果中。索引是\\ :abbr:`SEO（搜尋引擎最佳化）`\\ 的基本步驟，是網站能見度和自"
"然流量的基礎。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:147
msgid ""
"**When you first create your website on Odoo, it will not appear directly in "
"search engine results.** Search engines need time to crawl and index it, "
"which can take anywhere from a few days to several weeks. For Google, you "
"can use the :doc:`Search Console <../configuration/google_search_console>` "
"and request indexing for specific URLs, though this does not guarantee "
"faster results. If you have an existing website and are migrating, your "
"previous website may still appear instead of the new one during that "
"timeframe."
msgstr ""
"**當您首次在 Odoo 上建立網站時，它不會直接出現在搜尋引擎結果中。**搜尋引擎需"
"要時間來爬取和索引它，這可能需要幾天到幾週的時間。對於 Google，您可以使用"
"\\ :doc:`Search Console <../configuration/google_search_console>`\\ 並請求為"
"特定網址建立索引，但這並不能保證更快的結果。如果您有現有網站並正在遷移，則在"
"該時間範圍內，您以前的網站可能仍會顯示，而不是新網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:155
msgid "SEO impact when migrating your existing website to Odoo"
msgstr "將現有網站遷移到 Odoo 時的 SEO 影響"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:157
msgid ""
"In most cases, migrating to Odoo will not negatively impact the website's "
"SEO. While no platform can guarantee that rankings will remain unchanged, "
"follow these best practices to significantly reduce the risk."
msgstr ""
"在大多數情況下，遷移至 Odoo 不會對網站的 SEO 產生負面影響。雖然沒有任何平台可"
"以保證排名維持不變，但遵循這些最佳做法可以大幅降低風險。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:161
msgid "Keep the existing content."
msgstr "保留現有內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:162
msgid ""
"Implement :ref:`redirects <website/pages/URL-redirection>` from old URLs to "
"their new counterparts."
msgstr ""
"實施從舊\\ :ref:`網址 <website/pages/URL-redirection>`\\ 到新網址的重新導向。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:164
msgid ""
"Monitor traffic and indexation to make sure that everything is going well, "
"using :doc:`../configuration/google_search_console`."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ :doc:`../configuration/google_search_console`\\ 監控流量和索引狀態，確"
"保一切正常運作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:167
msgid ""
"By doing this, search engines reindex the site and maintain its visibility "
"in search results."
msgstr "這樣做可讓搜尋引擎重新索引網站，並維持其在搜尋結果中的可見度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:170
msgid "It is normal to experience a traffic decrease in the first days."
msgstr "在最初幾天內流量下降是正常現象。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:173
msgid "Prevent a page from being indexed"
msgstr "防止頁面被索引"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:175
msgid ""
"To effectively prevent a page from appearing in search engine results, use "
"one of the following methods:"
msgstr "要有效防止頁面出現在搜尋引擎結果中，請使用以下其中一種方法："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:178
msgid ""
"**noindex tag:** Access the page's :ref:`properties <website/pages/"
"page_properties>` and toggle the :guilabel:`Indexed` switch off."
msgstr ""
"**noindex 標籤：**存取頁面的\\ :ref:`屬性 <website/pages/"
"page_properties>`\\ ，並將\\ :guilabel:`已索引`\\ 開關切換為關閉。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:182
msgid ""
"This option is not yet available for :ref:`dynamic pages <website/pages/"
"page_type>`."
msgstr "此選項目前尚不適用於\\ :ref:`動態頁面 <website/pages/page_type>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:184
msgid ""
"**404 or 403:** Configure the page to return a 404 (Not Found) or 403 "
"(Forbidden) HTTP status code. These codes signal to search engines that the "
"page does not exist or is inaccessible, leading to its eventual removal from "
"the index."
msgstr ""
"**404 或 403：**將頁面配置為傳回 404（找不到）或 403（禁止存取）HTTP 狀態碼。"
"這些代碼會向搜尋引擎發出訊號，表示頁面不存在或無法存取，最終導致其從索引中移"
"除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:188
msgid ""
"**404:** :ref:`Configure a 404 redirection. <website/pages/URL-redirection>`"
msgstr ""
"**404：**\\ :ref:`配置 404 重新導向 <website/pages/URL-redirection>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:189
msgid ""
"**403:** Access the page's :ref:`properties <website/pages/page_properties>` "
"and toggle the :guilabel:`Visibility` switch off or :ref:`unpublish the page "
"<website/pages/un-publish-page>`."
msgstr ""
"**403：**存取頁面的\\ :ref:`屬性 <website/pages/page_properties>`\\ ，並將"
"\\ :guilabel:`可見性`\\ 開關切換為關閉，或\\ :ref:`取消發布頁面 <website/"
"pages/un-publish-page>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:193
msgid ""
"**Google Search Console:** Use Google Search Console to request the removal "
"of specific URLs from Google's index."
msgstr ""
"**Google Search Console：**使用 Google Search Console 請求從 Google 索引中移"
"除特定網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:197
msgid ":doc:`../configuration/google_search_console`"
msgstr ":doc:`../configuration/google_search_console`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:198
msgid ":doc:`pages`"
msgstr ":doc:`pages`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:201
msgid "Prevent a website from being indexed"
msgstr "防止網站被索引"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:203
msgid ""
"To prevent a website from appearing in search engine results, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings`, then in "
"the :guilabel:`Website Info` section, add a random value in "
"the :guilabel:`Domain` field. Doing so automatically inserts the following "
"tag into the page source:"
msgstr ""
"若要防止網站出現在搜尋引擎結果中，請前往\\ :menuselection:`配置 --> 設定"
"`\\ ，然後在\\ :guilabel:`網站資訊`\\ 區段的\\ :guilabel:`網域`\\ 欄位中加入"
"隨機值。這樣做會自動在頁面原始碼中插入以下標籤："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:212
msgid ""
"This tag instructs search engines not to index the site. After applying the "
"change, it may take several days or weeks for search engines to update their "
"results and remove the website."
msgstr ""
"此標籤會指示搜尋引擎不要索引該網站。套用變更後，搜尋引擎可能需要數天或數週的"
"時間來更新其結果並移除該網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:216
msgid ""
"This can be used to prevent websites from test databases from appearing in "
"search results."
msgstr "這可用於防止測試資料庫的網站出現在搜尋結果中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:219
msgid "Sitemap"
msgstr "網站地圖"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:221
msgid ""
"The sitemap points out website pages and their relation to each other to "
"search engine crawlers. Odoo generates a `/sitemap.xml` file, including all "
"URLs. For performance reasons, this file is cached and updated every 12 "
"hours."
msgstr ""
"網站地圖會向搜尋引擎檢索器指出網站頁面及其相互關係。Odoo 會產生包含所有網址的"
"\\ `/sitemap.xml`\\ 檔案。基於效能考量，此檔案會被快取並每 12 小時更新一次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:226
msgid ""
"If your website has a lot of pages, Odoo automatically creates a Sitemap "
"Index file, respecting the `sitemaps.org protocol <http://www.sitemaps.org/"
"protocol.html>`_, grouping sitemap URLs in 45000 chunks per file."
msgstr ""
"如果您的網站有大量頁面，Odoo 會自動建立網站地圖索引檔案，遵循 `sitemaps.org "
"協定 <http://www.sitemaps.org/protocol.html>`_，將網站地圖網址分組為每個檔案 "
"45000 個區塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:230
msgid ""
"Every sitemap entry has three attributes that are computed automatically:"
msgstr "每個網站地圖記項都有三個自動計算的屬性："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:232
msgid "`<loc>`: the URL of a page."
msgstr "`<loc>`：頁面的網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:233
msgid ""
"`<lastmod>`: last modification date of the resource, computed automatically "
"based on the related object. For a page related to a product, this could be "
"the last modification date of the product or the page."
msgstr ""
"`<lastmod>`：資源的最後修改日期，根據相關物件自動計算。對於與產品相關的頁面，"
"這可能是產品或頁面的最後修改日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:236
msgid ""
"`<priority>`: modules may implement their priority algorithm based on their "
"content (for example, a forum might assign a priority based on the number of "
"votes on a specific post). The priority of a static page is defined by its "
"priority field, which is normalized (16 is the default)."
msgstr ""
"`<priority>`：模組可能會根據其內容實作自己的優先順序演算法（例如，論壇可能會"
"根據特定貼文的投票數來分配優先順序）。靜態頁面的優先順序由其優先順序欄位定"
"義，該欄位已標準化（預設為 16）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:241
msgid ""
"To prevent pages from appearing in a sitemap, go to :menuselection:`Site --> "
"Properties`, and toggle off the :guilabel:`Indexed` feature."
msgstr ""
"若要防止頁面出現在網站地圖中，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 屬性`\\ ，並"
"關閉\\ :guilabel:`已索引`\\ 功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:244
msgid "toggle off the “Indexed” field"
msgstr "關閉「已索引」欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:248
msgid "robots.txt"
msgstr "robots.txt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:250
msgid ""
"A `robots.txt` file instructs search engine crawlers which parts of a "
"website they are permitted to access. Its primary purpose is to:"
msgstr ""
"`robots.txt`\\ 檔案指示搜尋引擎爬蟲可以存取網站的哪些部分。其主要目的是："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:253
msgid ""
"**Prevent overloading the website:** By guiding crawlers away from certain "
"sections, robots.txt helps manage server load."
msgstr ""
"**防止網站超載：**透過引導爬蟲遠離某些區段，robots.txt 有助於管理伺服器負載。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:255
msgid ""
"**Control access to resources and detailed descriptions:** It can prevent "
"crawlers from accessing media files (images, videos), CSS stylesheets, and "
"JavaScript files, and from reading the content (text) of specific pages."
msgstr ""
"**控制資源和詳細描述的存取：**它可以防止爬蟲存取媒體檔案（圖片、影片）、CSS "
"樣式表和 JavaScript 檔案，以及讀取特定頁面的內容（文字）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:259
msgid ""
"When indexing your website, search engines first look at the robots.txt "
"file. Odoo automatically creates one robot.txt file available on "
"`mydatabase.odoo.com/robots.txt`."
msgstr ""
"搜尋引擎在索引您的網站時，會先查看 robots.txt 檔案。Odoo 會自動建立一個可在"
"\\ `mydatabase.odoo.com/robots.txt`\\ 取得的 robots.txt 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:263
msgid ""
"Reputable bots adhere to robots.txt; others may require blocking "
"via :ref:`Cloudflare <domain-name/existing/naked/cloudflare>` on your custom "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"信譽良好的機器人會遵守 robots.txt；其他機器人可能需要透過您自訂網域上的"
"\\ :ref:`Cloudflare <domain-name/existing/naked/cloudflare>`\\ 進行封鎖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:267
msgid "Edit robots.txt"
msgstr "編輯 robots.txt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:269
msgid ""
"By editing a robots.txt file, you can control which site pages are "
"accessible to search engine crawlers. To add custom instructions to the "
"file, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`SEO` section, and click :guilabel:`Edit robots.txt`."
msgstr ""
"透過編輯 robots.txt 檔案，您可以控制搜尋引擎爬蟲可以存取哪些網站頁面。要在檔"
"案中加入自訂指令，請前往\\ :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`\\ ，向下捲"
"動到\\ :guilabel:`SEO`\\ 區段，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`編輯 robots.txt`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:274
msgid ""
"If you do not want robots to crawl the `/about-us` page of your site, you "
"can edit the robots.txt file to add `Disallow: /about-us`."
msgstr ""
"如果您不希望機器人爬取網站的 `/about-us` 頁面，可以編輯 robots.txt 檔案並加"
"入 `Disallow: /about-us`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:278
msgid ""
"While `robots.txt` prevents content from being crawled, **it does not "
"guarantee that a page will not be indexed**. A page can still appear in "
"search results if it is linked to from other crawled pages (indexed by "
"\"reference\"). Google generally does not recommend using robots.txt to "
"block webpages that you wish to keep out of search results entirely."
msgstr ""
"雖然 `robots.txt` 可以防止內容被爬取，**但它無法保證頁面不會被索引**。如果其"
"他已爬取的頁面有連結指向該頁面，該頁面仍可能出現在搜尋結果中（透過「參照」建"
"立索引）。Google 通常不建議使用 robots.txt 來封鎖您希望完全排除在搜尋結果之外"
"的網頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:284
msgid "Advanced features"
msgstr "進階功能，幫你蒐集有用資訊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:287
msgid "Structured data markup"
msgstr "結構化資料標記"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:289
msgid ""
"Structured data markup is used to generate rich snippets in search engine "
"results. It is a way for websites to send structured data to search engine "
"crawlers, helping them understand your content and create well-presented "
"search results."
msgstr ""
"結構化資料標記用於在搜尋引擎結果中產生豐富的摘要資訊。這是網站向搜尋引擎檢索"
"器傳送結構化資料的方式，幫助它們理解您的內容並建立精美的搜尋結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:293
msgid ""
"By default, Google supports many `rich snippets <https://"
"developers.google.com/search/blog/2009/05/introducing-rich-snippets>`_ for "
"content types, including Reviews, People, Products, Businesses, Events, and "
"Organizations."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，Google 支援多種內容類型的\\ `豐富摘要 <https://"
"developers.google.com/search/blog/2009/05/introducing-rich-snippets>`_\\ ，包"
"括評論、人物、產品、企業、活動和組織。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:296
msgid ""
"Microdata is a set of tags, introduced with HTML5, that help search engines "
"better understand your content and display it in a relevant way. Odoo "
"implements microdata as defined in the schema.org `specification <https://"
"schema.org/docs/gs.html>`_ for events, eCommerce products, forum posts, and "
"contact addresses. This allows your product pages to be displayed in Google "
"using extra information like the price and rating of a product:"
msgstr ""
"微資料是一組隨 HTML5 引入的標籤，可幫助搜尋引擎更好地理解您的內容並以相關方式"
"顯示。Odoo 實作 schema.org\\ `規範 <https://schema.org/docs/gs.html>`_\\ 中定"
"義的微資料，適用於活動、電子商務產品、論壇貼文和聯絡地址。這使您的產品頁面可"
"以在 Google 中使用額外資訊（如產品價格和評分）顯示："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:302
msgid "snippets in search engine results"
msgstr "搜尋引擎結果中的摘要"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:306
msgid "Hreflang HTML tags"
msgstr "Hreflang HTML 標籤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:308
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically includes `hreflang` and `x-default` tags in the code of "
"your website's multilingual pages. These HTML attributes are crucial in "
"informing search engines about a specific page's language and geographical "
"targeting."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會自動在您網站的多語言頁面程式碼中加入 `hreflang` 和 `x-default` 標籤。"
"這些 HTML 屬性對於向搜尋引擎告知特定頁面的語言和地理目標定位至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:313
msgid ":doc:`../configuration/translate`"
msgstr ":doc:`../configuration/translate`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:9
msgid ""
"Design your website using :doc:`building blocks <../website/web_design/"
"building_blocks>`, customize its :doc:`theme <../website/web_design/themes>` "
"with various options, structure and present content with :doc:`elements <../"
"website/web_design/elements>`, and display or hide building blocks "
"using :doc:`visibility settings <../website/web_design/visibility>`."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ :doc:`建置區塊 <../website/web_design/building_blocks>`\\ 設計您的網"
"站，使用各種選項自訂其\\ :doc:`主題 <../website/web_design/themes>`，使用"
"\\ :doc:`元素 <../website/web_design/elements>`\\ 組織和呈現內容，並使用"
"\\ :doc:`可見性設定 <../website/web_design/visibility>`\\ 顯示或隱藏建置區"
"塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:16
msgid ""
"Design your website by dragging and dropping building blocks, then editing "
"them to fit your content and layout needs."
msgstr ""
"透過拖放建置區塊來設計您的網站，然後編輯它們以符合您的內容和版面配置需求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:3
msgid "General theme"
msgstr "一般佈景主題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:23
msgid ""
"Customize your website’s theme by adjusting its colors, fonts, and layout."
msgstr "透過調整顏色、字型和版面配置來自訂您網站的主題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:29
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:3
msgid "Elements"
msgstr "元素"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:29
msgid ""
"Structure and present content effectively with elements such as titles, "
"lists, etc."
msgstr "使用標題、清單等元素有效地組織和呈現內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:3
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "可見性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:35
msgid "Display or hide building blocks based on several criteria."
msgstr "根據多個條件顯示或隱藏建置區塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:7
msgid ""
"Design website pages by :ref:`dragging and dropping building blocks <website/"
"building_blocks/add>`, then :ref:`arrange <website/building_blocks/"
"move_duplicate_delete>` and :ref:`edit <website/building_blocks/edit>` them "
"to fit your content and layout needs. It is also possible to "
"create :ref:`custom building blocks <website/building_blocks/custom>` "
"or :ref:`anchor links <website/building_blocks/anchor>`."
msgstr ""
"透過\\ :ref:`拖放建構區塊 <website/building_blocks/add>`\\ 來設計網站頁面，接"
"著\\ :ref:`排列 <website/building_blocks/move_duplicate_delete>`\\ 與\\ "
":ref:`編輯 <website/building_blocks/edit>`\\ 這些區塊以符合您的內容與版面配置"
"需求。您也可以建立\\ :ref:`自訂建構區塊 <website/building_blocks/custom>`\\ "
"或\\ :ref:`錨點連結 <website/building_blocks/anchor>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:13
msgid ""
"Building blocks can be added and customized using the website editor. To "
"open it, go to the relevant page and click :guilabel:`Edit` in the upper-"
"right corner."
msgstr ""
"建構區塊可透過網站編輯器加入並自訂。若要開啟編輯器，請前往相關頁面，並按一下"
"右上角的\\ :guilabel:`編輯`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorial: Design your website: text and colors <https://www.odoo.com/"
"slides/slide/design-your-website-text-and-colors-6930?fullscreen=1>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 教學：設計您的網站：文字和顏色<https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"design-your-website-text-and-colors-6930?fullscreen=1>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:22
msgid "Add a building block"
msgstr "加入建置區塊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:24
msgid ""
"To add a building block to a :doc:`website page <../structure/pages>`, "
"access the page, then drag and drop the desired building block from "
"the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Blocks` tab to the appropriate location."
msgstr ""
"若要將建構區塊加入\\ :doc:`網站頁面 <../structure/pages>`\\ ，請存取該頁面，"
"然後從\\ :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`區塊`\\ 分頁將所需的建構區塊拖放至適當位"
"置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:28
msgid "Two types of building blocks are available:"
msgstr "有兩種類型的建構區塊可用："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:30
msgid ""
"Categorical building blocks provide templates for different content "
"categories."
msgstr "類別建構區塊為不同的內容類別提供範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inner Content` building blocks allow for adding elements, such "
"as :ref:`videos <website/elements/videos>`, :ref:`images <website/elements/"
"images>`, :ref:`buttons <website/elements/buttons>`, and more, to pre-"
"existing categorical blocks as well as :doc:`headers and footers <../"
"structure/header_footer>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`內部內容`\\ 建構區塊可將元素（例如\\ :ref:`影片 <website/elements/"
"videos>`\\ 、\\ :ref:`圖片 <website/elements/images>`\\ 、\\ :ref:`按鈕 "
"<website/elements/buttons>`\\ 等）加入既有的類別區塊以及\\ :doc:`頁首與頁尾 "
"<../structure/header_footer>`\\ 中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:36
msgid ""
"When adding a categorical block, a pop-up window appears, allowing you to "
"choose from multiple templates for different categories. Once the block is "
"placed, drag and drop :guilabel:`Inner Content` blocks into it."
msgstr ""
"加入類別區塊時，會出現彈出式視窗，供您從不同類別的多個範本中進行選擇。放置該"
"區塊後，即可將\\ :guilabel:`內部內容`\\ 區塊拖放至其中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:41
msgid ""
"Use the search bar in the :guilabel:`Insert a block` pop-up window to "
"quickly find a specific block."
msgstr "使用\\ :guilabel:`插入區塊`\\ 彈出式視窗中的搜尋列，即可快速尋找特定區塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:44
msgid "Pop-up block selection"
msgstr "彈出式區塊選擇"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:48
msgid ""
"Building blocks can also be added to the login page. To access it, navigate "
"to the website's homepage, add `/web/login` to the URL, and press `Enter`."
msgstr ""
"建構區塊也可以加入至登入頁面。若要存取該頁面，請前往網站首頁，在網址後加上 `/"
"web/login`，然後按下 `Enter`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:52
msgid ""
"Some building blocks require their corresponding application or module to be "
"installed (e.g., the **Appointments** app for the :guilabel:`Appointments` "
"block)."
msgstr ""
"某些建構區塊需要安裝其對應的應用程式或模組（例如用於\\ :guilabel:`預約`\\ 區"
"塊的 **預約** 應用程式）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:56
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Social Media` :guilabel:`Inner Content` building block to "
"display links to your social media accounts. Click :guilabel:`Add New Social "
"Network` to add a platform, and :icon:`fa-minus` (:guilabel:`Remove link`) "
"to remove it. You can also edit the account URLs."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ :guilabel:`社群媒體`\\ :guilabel:`內部內容`\\ 建構區塊來顯示連結至您社"
"群媒體帳號的連結。按一下\\ :guilabel:`新增社群網路`\\ 來新增平台，並使用\\ "
":icon:`fa-minus`\\ （:guilabel:`移除連結`）來移除它。您也可以編輯帳號網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:60
msgid "Social Media inner content block"
msgstr "社交媒體內部內容區塊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:67
msgid "Embed code"
msgstr "嵌入程式碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:69
msgid ""
"Embedding code allows you to integrate content from third-party services, "
"such as YouTube videos, Google Maps, and Instagram posts."
msgstr ""
"嵌入程式碼可讓您整合來自第三方服務的內容，例如 YouTube 影片、Google 地圖及 "
"Instagram 貼文。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:72
msgid ""
"After dragging and dropping the :guilabel:`Embed Code` block from "
"the :guilabel:`Inner Content` section onto a page, click the block, then go "
"to the :guilabel:`Style` tab. Scroll down to the :guilabel:`Embed Code` "
"section, and, next to :guilabel:`Code`, click :guilabel:`Edit`. Replace the "
"placeholder code with the custom embed code."
msgstr ""
"將\\ :guilabel:`嵌入程式碼`\\ 區塊從\\ :guilabel:`內部內容`\\ 區段拖放至頁面"
"後，按一下該區塊，然後前往\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 分頁。向下捲動至\\ "
":guilabel:`嵌入程式碼`\\ 區段，並在\\ :guilabel:`程式碼`\\ 旁按一下\\ "
":guilabel:`編輯`\\ 。將預留位置程式碼替換為自訂嵌入程式碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:77
msgid "Add the link to the embedded code you want to point to."
msgstr "加入您想要指向的嵌入程式碼連結"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:82
msgid ""
"Only use embed code from sources you trust. Copying and pasting code you do "
"not understand could put your data at risk."
msgstr ""
"請僅使用來自受信任來源的嵌入程式碼。複製並貼上您不了解的程式碼可能會使您的資"
"料面臨風險。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:88
msgid "Move, duplicate, or delete a building block"
msgstr "移動、複製或刪除建構區塊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:90
msgid ""
"To adjust the position and size of a building block, use the following "
"options:"
msgstr "若要調整建構區塊的位置與大小，請使用以下選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:92
msgid ""
"Drag the turquoise borders on the block to increase or decrease the space at "
"the top or bottom."
msgstr "拖曳區塊上的青綠色邊框，以增加或減少頂部或底部的間距。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:93
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-chevron-up` (:guilabel:`Move up`) or :icon:`fa-chevron-"
"down` (:guilabel:`Move down`) icons to change the block's order."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :icon:`fa-chevron-up` (:guilabel:`上移`) 或\\ :icon:`fa-chevron-"
"down` (:guilabel:`下移`) 圖示以變更區塊的順序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:95
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-arrows` (:guilabel:`Drag and move`) icon to move the "
"block on the page."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :icon:`fa-arrows`\\ （:guilabel:`拖曳並移動`）圖示來移動頁面上的區塊"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:96
msgid ""
"When a block contains multiple :ref:`columns <website/building_blocks/"
"columns>`, move a column to the left or right by clicking :icon:`fa-chevron-"
"left` (:guilabel:`Move left`) or :icon:`fa-chevron-right` (:guilabel:`Move "
"right`)."
msgstr ""
"當區塊包含多個\\ :ref:`欄 <website/building_blocks/columns>`\\ 時，按一下\\ "
":icon:`fa-chevron-left`\\ （:guilabel:`向左移動`）或\\ :icon:`fa-chevron-"
"right`\\ （:guilabel:`向右移動`）即可將該欄向左或向右移動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:99
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-clone` (:guilabel:`Duplicate`) to create a copy of the "
"block. The duplicate is added below the original."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :icon:`fa-clone`\\ （:guilabel:`複製`）來建立區塊副本。副本將新增至"
"原始區塊下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:101
msgid "Click :icon:`fa-trash` (:guilabel:`Remove`) to delete the block."
msgstr "按一下\\ :icon:`fa-trash`\\ （:guilabel:`移除`）來刪除區塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:103
msgid "Building block options to move, duplicate , or remove it."
msgstr "用於移動、複製或移除建構區塊的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:107
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the block, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and click "
"the :icon:`fa-clone` (:guilabel:`Duplicate this block`) or :icon:`fa-trash` "
"(:guilabel:`Remove this block`) icon at the top of the tab."
msgstr ""
"或者，按一下該區塊，前往\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 分頁，然後按一下分頁頂部的\\ "
":icon:`fa-clone`\\ （:guilabel:`複製此區塊`）或\\ :icon:`fa-trash`\\ "
"（:guilabel:`移除此區塊`）圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:112
msgid ""
"To resize a block, click and drag the dots around its edges to adjust it as "
"needed."
msgstr "如需調整區塊大小，按一下並拖曳其邊緣周圍的點，以根據需要進行調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:114
msgid "Adapt block size"
msgstr "調整區塊大小"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:121
msgid "Edit a building block"
msgstr "編輯建構區塊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:123
msgid ""
"To customize a building block, click it and go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab. "
"Available customization options vary depending on the type of block "
"selected. Most blocks provide options to customize the :ref:`background "
"<website/building_blocks/background>`, :ref:`layout <website/building_blocks/"
"layout>`, :ref:`shape <website/building_blocks/shape>`, and :ref:`content "
"dimensions <website/building_blocks/content-layout>`."
msgstr ""
"若要自訂建構區塊，請按一下該區塊並前往\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 分頁。可用的自訂"
"選項會根據所選區塊的類型而異。大多數區塊都提供自訂\\ :ref:`背景 <website/"
"building_blocks/background>`、:ref:`版面配置 <website/building_blocks/layout>"
"`、:ref:`形狀 <website/building_blocks/shape>`\\ 和\\ :ref:`內容尺寸 "
"<website/building_blocks/content-layout>`\\ 的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:130
msgid ":doc:`Web design elements <elements>`"
msgstr ":doc:`網頁設計元素 <elements>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:131
msgid ":doc:`Visibility <visibility>`"
msgstr ":doc:`可見性 <visibility>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:132
msgid ":doc:`General theme <themes>`"
msgstr ":doc:`一般佈景主題 <themes>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:137
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:139
msgid ""
"To customize the background of a building block, click the color dot or "
"another :guilabel:`Background` option. Depending on the selected option, you "
"can change the background :ref:`color <website/themes/theme-colors>` and/or "
"add an :ref:`image <website/elements/images>`, :ref:`video <website/elements/"
"videos>`, and/or shape. After selecting an option, additional options are "
"available to customize it."
msgstr ""
"若要自訂建構區塊的背景，請按一下顏色點或其他\\ :guilabel:`背景`\\ 選項。根據"
"所選的選項，您可以變更背景\\ :ref:`顏色 <website/themes/theme-colors>`\\ 和/"
"或新增\\ :ref:`圖片 <website/elements/images>`、:ref:`影片 <website/elements/"
"videos>`\\ 和/或形狀。選擇選項後，會有額外的選項可用於自訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:146
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`Grid <website/building_blocks/grid>` layout, use "
"the :guilabel:`Send to back` or :guilabel:`Bring to front` icons to position "
"elements, such as images and text, behind or in front of other elements."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :ref:`網格 <website/building_blocks/grid>`\\ 版面配置中，使用\\ "
":guilabel:`置於底層`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`置於頂層`\\ 圖示，將圖片和文字等元素放"
"置在其他元素之後或之前。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:150
msgid "Move a building block to the back or front."
msgstr "將區塊移動至最後或最前面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:156
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:158
msgid ""
"Most building blocks support two layout styles: :ref:`grid <website/"
"building_blocks/grid>` and :ref:`column <website/building_blocks/columns>`. "
"To change the default layout, click the block, go to the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab, and set the :guilabel:`Layout` field to :guilabel:`Grid` "
"or :guilabel:`Column`."
msgstr ""
"大多數區塊支援兩種版面樣式：\\ :ref:`網格 <website/building_blocks/grid>`\\ "
"和\\ :ref:`欄位 <website/building_blocks/columns>`。若要變更預設版面，請按一"
"下該區塊，前往\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 分頁，並將\\ :guilabel:`版面`\\ 欄位設"
"為\\ :guilabel:`網格`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`欄位`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:166
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "矩陣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:168
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Grid` layout allows you to reposition and resize elements by "
"dragging and dropping them. You can also adjust their position and size "
"using the :guilabel:`Spacing` options."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`網格`\\ 版面讓您能夠透過拖拽來重新定位和調整元素大小。您也可以"
"使用\\ :guilabel:`間距`\\ 選項來調整元素的位置和大小。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:174
msgid "Column"
msgstr "列"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:176
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Column` layout allows you to specify the number of elements "
"per line in the block. To do so, select the block to modify, click the "
"dropdown next to the :guilabel:`Column` field, and adjust the number. You "
"can then modify a specific column's settings using the options in "
"the :guilabel:`Column` section of the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`欄位`\\ 版面讓您能夠指定區塊中每行的元素數量。若要通過這種方式"
"操作，請選取要修改的區塊，按一下\\ :guilabel:`欄位`\\ 欄位旁邊的下拉選單，並"
"調整數值。您然後可以使用\\ :guilabel:`欄位`\\ 區段中的選項，來修改特定欄位的"
"設定，該選項位於\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:182
msgid ""
"By default, :doc:`on mobile devices <visibility>`, only one element (column) "
"is visible per line to ensure that content remains easy to read and "
"accessible on smaller screens. To adjust this value, click the :icon:`fa-"
"mobile` (:guilabel:`Mobile Preview`) at the top of the website editor and "
"adapt the number of columns. Shapes are hidden by default on mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"默認情況下，\\ :doc:`在行動裝置上 <visibility>`，每行僅顯示一個元素（欄位），"
"以確保內容在較小的螢幕上仍易於閱讀與存取。若要調整此數值，請按一下網站編輯器"
"頂部的\\ :icon:`fa-mobile`（:guilabel:`行動預覽`），並調整欄位數量。在行動裝"
"置上，形狀默認為隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:190
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "圖形"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:192
msgid ""
"To add a shape to a building block, click :guilabel:`None` next to "
"the :guilabel:`Shape` setting, then select a shape. You can change "
"the :ref:`color <website/themes/theme-colors>` and :guilabel:`Transform` the "
"shape by using the :icon:`fa-arrows-h` (:guilabel:`Horizontal flip`) "
"and :icon:`fa-arrows-v` (:guilabel:`Vertical flip`) buttons."
msgstr ""
"若要將形狀新增至區塊，請按一下\\ :guilabel:`無`，該選項位於\\ :guilabel:`形"
"狀`\\ 設定旁邊，然後選擇一個形狀。您可以使用\\ :ref:`顏色 <website/themes/"
"theme-colors>`\\ 以及\\ :guilabel:`轉換`\\ 按鈕來調整形狀的顏色，並使用\\ "
":icon:`fa-arrows-h`（:guilabel:`水平翻轉`）和\\ :icon:`fa-arrows-"
"v`（:guilabel:`垂直翻轉`）按鈕來轉換該形狀。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:197
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`Remove the shape` to remove it "
"and :ref:`manage its visibility on mobile devices <website/visibility/mobile-"
"and-computer>`."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :icon:`fa-times`\\ :guilabel:`移除形狀`\\ 來將其移除，並\\ :ref:`管"
"理其在行動裝置上的顯示狀態 <website/visibility/mobile-and-computer>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:203
msgid "Content dimensions"
msgstr "內容尺寸"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:205
msgid "To adjust the content dimensions of a building block:"
msgstr "若要調整區塊的內容尺寸："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:207
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Content Width` options to make the content fill the "
"entire width of the page or add spacing around it."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ :guilabel:`內容寬度`\\ 選項，讓內容填滿頁面的整個寬度，或在其周圍添加"
"間距。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:209
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Auto` :guilabel:`Height` to :guilabel:`50%` "
"or :guilabel:`100%`."
msgstr ""
"將\\ :guilabel:`自動`\\ :guilabel:`高度`\\ 設為\\ :guilabel:`50%`\\ 或\\ "
":guilabel:`100%`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:214
msgid "Save a custom building block"
msgstr "儲存自訂建置區塊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:216
msgid ""
"Save a customized building block to reuse on other pages. To do so, select "
"it, navigate to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and click the :icon:`fa-floppy-o` "
"(:guilabel:`Save this block to use it elsewhere`) icon. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Save` button in the pop-up window to confirm."
msgstr ""
"儲存自訂區塊，以便在其他頁面重複使用。若要操作，請選取該區塊，前往\\ "
":guilabel:`樣式`\\ 分頁，並按一下\\ :icon:`fa-floppy-o`（:guilabel:`儲存此區"
"塊以在其他地方使用`）圖示。按一下彈出視窗中的\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ 按鈕以確認"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:220
msgid ""
"To add a saved building block to the page, navigate to the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Blocks` tab and drag and drop the :guilabel:`Custom` "
"categorical block. In the pop-up window that opens, click the desired block "
"in the :guilabel:`Custom` category."
msgstr ""
"若要將已儲存的區塊新增至頁面，請前往\\ :icon:`fa-plus`\\ :guilabel:`區塊`\\ "
"分頁，然後拖拽\\ :guilabel:`自訂`\\ 類別區塊。在開啟的彈出視窗中，按一下\\ "
":guilabel:`自訂`\\ 類別中想要的區塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:225
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Insert a block` pop-up window, click :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`Rename`) to rename the custom block or :icon:`fa-trash` "
"(:guilabel:`Remove`) to delete it."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`插入區塊`\\ 彈出視窗中，按一下\\ :icon:`fa-"
"pencil`（:guilabel:`重新命名`）以重新命名自訂區塊，或按一下\\ :icon:`fa-"
"trash`（:guilabel:`移除`）以將其刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:231
msgid "Create an anchor link"
msgstr "建立錨點連結"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:233
msgid ""
