#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:30
msgid ""
"By default, submitting the form redirects visitors to a *Thank you* page. "
"Use the :guilabel:`URL` field to send them to a different page. "
"Alternatively, select :guilabel:`Nothing` or :guilabel:`Show Message` in "
"the :guilabel:`On Success` field to keep visitors on the form's page."
msgstr ""
"默認情況下，提交表單會將訪客重定向至「謝謝」頁面。使用\\ :guilabel:`URL`\\ 欄"
"位將他們導向至其他頁面。或者，在\\ :guilabel:`Nothing`\\ 或\\ "
":guilabel:`Show Message`\\ 中選擇\\ :guilabel:`On Success`\\ 欄位，以使訪客留"
"在表單頁面上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:34
msgid ""
"You can also define the :guilabel:`Labels Position` and :guilabel:`Labels "
"Width`, and specify whether :guilabel:`Marked Fields` "
"are :guilabel:`Required` or :guilabel:`Optional`. Select :guilabel:`None` to "
"indicate that no fields are marked. Additionally, define "
"the :guilabel:`Marker` used to identify marked fields."
msgstr ""
"您也可以定義\\ :guilabel:`Labels Position`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`Labels Width`\\ "
"，並指定\\ :guilabel:`Marked Fields`\\ 是\\ :guilabel:`Required`\\ 還是\\ "
":guilabel:`Optional`\\ 。選擇\\ :guilabel:`None`\\ 以表示沒有欄位被標註。此外"
"，定義用於識別標註欄位的\\ :guilabel:`Marker`\\ 。"

