#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:61
msgid "All types of form fields"
msgstr "所有表單欄位類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:64
msgid ""
"Some fields are visually similar, but the data entered must follow a "
"specific format."
msgstr "有些欄位在視覺上相似，但輸入的資料必須符合特定格式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:66
