msgstr "指定欄位是否為\\ :guilabel:`必填`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:67
msgid ""
"Enable a field :guilabel:`Description`. Toggle the switch on and click the "
"default description on the form to modify it."
msgstr ""
"啟用欄位\\ :guilabel:`說明`。切換開關並按一下表單上的預設說明以進行修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:69
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Requirement` field to add "
