"information. For example, set the condition requiring the :guilabel:`Email` "
"field to contain an `@` symbol or matching a specific domain."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ :guilabel:`Requirement`\\ 欄位來新增驗證\\ :guilabel:`Conditions`，以"
"確保訪客輸入有效資訊。例如，設定需求條件，要求\\ :guilabel:`Email`\\ 欄位包"
"含 `@` 符號，或符合特定網域。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:72
msgid "Add an :ref:`animation <website/elements/animations>`."
msgstr "加入\\ :ref:`動畫 <website/elements/animations>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:73
msgid ""
"Edit the field's :doc:`visibility <../../web_design/visibility>` settings."
msgstr "編輯欄位的\\ :doc:`visibility <../../web_design/visibility>`\\ 設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:75
msgid "Depending on the selected field, the following options are available:"
msgstr "根據所選欄位，可使用以下選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:79
msgid "String and numerical fields"
msgstr "字串和數值欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:81
msgid ""
"For text and string fields, such as :guilabel:`Text`, :guilabel:`Long "
"Text`, :guilabel:`Email`, and :guilabel:`Url`, as well as numerical fields, "
"such as :guilabel:`Telephone`, :guilabel:`Number`, and :guilabel:`Decimal "
"Number`, you can define a :guilabel:`Placeholder` and a :guilabel:`Default "
"Value`."
msgstr ""
"對於文字與字串欄位（例如\\ :guilabel:`文字`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`長文字`\\ 、\\ "
":guilabel:`電子郵件`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`網址`\\ ），以及數值欄位（例如\\ "
":guilabel:`電話`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`數字`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`小數`\\ ），您可以"
"定義\\ :guilabel:`預留位置`\\ 與\\ :guilabel:`預設值`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:86
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Long Text` field, you can also specify the "
"field's :guilabel:`Height`."
msgstr ""
"針對\\ :guilabel:`Long Text`\\ 欄位，您也可以指定欄位的\\ "
":guilabel:`Height`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:88
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can set character limits for string fields and "
"the :guilabel:`Telephone` field. To do so, enable the :guilabel:`Character "
"Limit` option, then set the minimum and maximum character counts using "
"the :guilabel:`Min Characters` and :guilabel:`Max Characters` fields."
msgstr ""
"此外，您可以設定字串欄位和\\ :guilabel:`Telephone`\\ 欄位的字數限制。若要這樣"
"做，請啟用\\ :guilabel:`Character Limit`\\ 選項，然後使用\\ :guilabel:`Min "
"Characters`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`Max Characters`\\ 欄位設定最小和最大字數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:93
msgid "Selection fields"
msgstr "選擇欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:95
msgid "The following selection fields are available:"
msgstr "可使用以下選擇欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Checkbox`: Visitors can select or clear the checkbox. "
"Toggle :guilabel:`Hide Label` on to remove the label, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Default Value` to have it selected by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Checkbox`\\ ：訪客可選取或取消勾選方塊。切換\\ :guilabel:`Hide "
"Label`\\ 以移除標籤，並啟用\\ :guilabel:`Default Value`\\ 以使其默認被選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:100
msgid ":guilabel:`Multiple Checkboxes`: Visitors can select multiple options."
msgstr ":guilabel:`多選方格`：訪客可以選取多個選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:101
msgid ":guilabel:`Radio Buttons`: Visitors can select one option."
msgstr ":guilabel:`單選按鈕`：訪客可以選取一個選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Selection`: Visitors can select one option from the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`下拉選單`：訪客可以從下拉式選單中選取一個選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:104
msgid ""
"For fields with multiple options, enable the options you want to set as "
"default by toggling the switch on. To remove an option, click the :icon:`fa-"
"minus` (:guilabel:`remove`) icon. To add a new option, click :guilabel:`Add "
"New Option` and enter the option."
msgstr ""
"針對具有多個選項的欄位，請透過切換開關啟用您想要設置為默認的選項。若要移除選"
"項，請按一下\\ :icon:`fa-minus`\\ （:guilabel:`remove`）圖示。若要新增選項，"
"請按一下\\ :guilabel:`Add New Option`\\ 並輸入該選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:109
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Multiple Checkboxes` and :guilabel:`Radio Buttons`, define "
"how the options are displayed: :guilabel:`Horizontal` "
"or :guilabel:`Vertical`."
msgstr ""
"針對\\ :guilabel:`Multiple Checkboxes`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`Radio Buttons`，定義"
"選項的顯示方式：\\ :guilabel:`Horizontal`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`Vertical`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:111
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Radio Buttons` and :guilabel:`Selection` dropdown lists, "
"toggle the :guilabel:`Add Other` switch on to allow visitors to add their "
"own option. You can also define a :guilabel:`Label` "
"and :guilabel:`Placeholder`."
msgstr ""
"針對\\ :guilabel:`Radio Buttons`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`Selection`\\ 下拉清單，切"
"換\\ :guilabel:`Add Other`\\ 開關以允許訪客新增自己的選項。您也可以定義\\ "
":guilabel:`Label`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`Placeholder`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:114
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Selection` dropdown lists, toggle the :guilabel:`Allow Empty` "
"switch on to allow visitors to leave the field empty. You can also define "
"a :guilabel:`Placeholder`."
msgstr ""
"針對\\ :guilabel:`Selection`\\ 下拉清單，切換\\ :guilabel:`Allow Empty`\\ 開"
"關以允許訪客留空該欄位。您也可以定義\\ :guilabel:`Placeholder`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:117
msgid "You can also :ref:`translate <translate/translate>` selection options."
msgstr "您也可以\\ :ref:`translate <translate/translate>`\\ 選擇選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:119
msgid "Date and time"
msgstr "\" (日期和時間)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:121
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Date` and :guilabel:`Date & Time` fields allow visitors to "
"select a date and, if applicable, a time using the date selector. You can "
"also define a :guilabel:`Placeholder` and a :guilabel:`Default Value`, e.g., "
"to use a specific date/time by default."
msgstr ""
"訪客可透過\\ :guilabel:`日期`\\ 與\\ :guilabel:`日期與時間`\\ 欄位，使用日期"
"選擇器選取日期，並在適用時選取時間。您也可以定義\\ :guilabel:`佔位符`\\ 及\\ "
":guilabel:`預設值`\\ ，例如預設使用特定日期/時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:126
msgid ""
"If needed, customize the :icon:`fa-calendar` "
"(:guilabel:`calendar`) :ref:`icon <website/elements/icons>`."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可自訂\\ :icon:`fa-calendar`（\\ :guilabel:`日曆`\\ ）\\ :ref:`圖"
"示 <website/elements/icons>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:129
msgid "Files"
msgstr "文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:131
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`File Upload` field type allows visitors to upload a file. You "
"can define the :guilabel:`Max # of Files` as well as the :guilabel:`Max File "
"Size`. Optionally, enable the :guilabel:`Restrict File Types` option, then "
