msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`File Upload`\\ 欄位類型允許訪客上傳檔案。您可以定義\\ "
":guilabel:`Max # of Files`\\ 以及\\ :guilabel:`Max File Size`\\ 。或者，啟"
"用\\ :guilabel:`Restrict File Types`\\ 選項，然後啟用支援的檔案類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:135
msgid "To apply the changes, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "若要套用變更，請按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:138
msgid ""
"Drag and drop :ref:`inner content snippets <website/building_blocks/add>` "
"inside forms to create sections, add images, set titles, and include other "
"content elements."
msgstr ""
"拖拽\\ :ref:`inner content snippets <website/building_blocks/add>`\\ 至表單內"
"，以建立區段、新增圖片、設定標題以及包含其他內容元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:140
msgid ""
"Modify the text of the :guilabel:`Submit` button by clicking it and entering "
