"iframe>`_\\ 或\\ `iFrame Generator <https://www.iframe-generator.com/>`_\\ 。"
"調整寬度和高度以正確顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Add the embedded code to the non-Odoo website:** Open the relevant page's "
"HTML (in the code editor or CMS) and insert the embedded code where the form "
"should be displayed."
msgstr ""
"**將嵌入程式碼加入到非 Odoo 網站：**開啟相關頁面的 HTML（在程式碼編輯器或 "
"CMS 中），並在表單應顯示的位置插入嵌入程式碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:163
msgid "Example of an embedded code:"
msgstr "嵌入程式碼範例："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:5
msgid ""
"Elements help structure and present content effectively. They range from "
"text-based components like :ref:`titles <website/elements/"
"titles>`, :ref:`lists <website/elements/lists>` and :ref:`text highlights "
"<website/elements/text_highlights>` to interactive ones such "
"as :ref:`buttons <website/elements/buttons>` and :ref:`links <website/"
"elements/links>`. Visual elements like :ref:`images <website/elements/"
"images>`, :ref:`icons <website/elements/icons>`, :ref:`videos <website/"
"elements/videos>`, and :ref:`animations <website/elements/animations>` can "
"also be added to improve content presentation and organization."
msgstr ""
"元素有助於有效地組織和呈現內容。它們包括基於文字的組件，如\\ :ref:`標題 "
"<website/elements/titles>`\\ 、\\ :ref:`清單 <website/elements/lists>`\\ 和"
"\\ :ref:`文字醒目提示 <website/elements/text_highlights>`\\ ，以及互動式組"
"件，如\\ :ref:`按鈕 <website/elements/buttons>`\\ 和\\ :ref:`連結 <website/"
"elements/links>`\\ 。還可以加入視覺元素，如\\ :ref:`圖片 <website/elements/"
"images>`\\ 、\\ :ref:`圖示 <website/elements/icons>`\\ 、\\ :ref:`影片 "
"<website/elements/videos>`\\ 和\\ :ref:`動畫 <website/elements/"
"animations>`\\ ，以改善內容的呈現和組織。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:13
msgid "To add or modify a website element:"
msgstr "如需加入或修改網站元素："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:15
msgid "Navigate to the relevant website page and click on :guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr "導覽至相關網站頁面並按一下\\ :guilabel:`編輯`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:16
msgid ""
"Click the section on the page where you want to add or modify an element."
msgstr "按一下頁面上您要加入或修改元素的區段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:17
msgid "Make the necessary changes."
msgstr "進行必要的變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:18
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:21
msgid ""
"The default styles for headings, buttons, links, and paragraph text, for "
"example, are defined in the :doc:`Theme tab <themes>` of the website editor."
msgstr ""
"例如，標題、按鈕、連結和段落文字的預設樣式，是在網站編輯器的\\ :doc:`佈景主題"
"分頁 <themes>`\\ 中定義的。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:24
msgid "Type / to add website elements."
msgstr "輸入 / 以加入網站元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:30
msgid "Titles"
msgstr "標題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:32
msgid ""
"Titles define headings and organize website content into different levels "
"for clarity and structure. To insert a title, type `/title`, choose the "
"heading style (:guilabel:`Heading 1`, :guilabel:`Heading 2`, "
"or :guilabel:`Heading 3`), and type the text."
msgstr ""
"標題用於定義標題並將網站內容組織成不同層級，以提供清晰的結構。若要插入標題，"
"請輸入 `/title`，選擇標題樣式（\\ :guilabel:`標題 1`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`標題 "
"2`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`標題 3`\\ ），然後輸入文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:37
msgid ""
"Alternatively, type the text, select it, and choose the appropriate style "
"from the :guilabel:`Inline Text` section in the :guilabel:`Customize` tab of "
"the website editor. Additional formatting options, such as fonts and colors, "
"are also available in this section."
msgstr ""
"或者，輸入文字、選取該文字，並從網站編輯器的\\ :guilabel:`自訂`\\ 分頁中的"
"\\ :guilabel:`內聯文字`\\ 區段選擇適當的樣式。此區段中也提供其他格式選項，例"
"如字型和顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:46
msgid ""
"Buttons are interactive elements that allow to link to another page or to a "
"page anchor. To insert a button:"
msgstr "按鈕是互動式元素，可以連結到另一個頁面或頁面錨點。若要插入按鈕："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:49
msgid "Type `/button`."
msgstr "輸入 `/button`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:50
msgid "Enter the button's label in the :guilabel:`Link Label` field."
msgstr "在\\ :guilabel:`連結標籤`\\ 欄位中輸入按鈕的標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:51
msgid ""
"Add the :guilabel:`URL or Email`. Type `/` to search for a page and `#` to "
"link to an anchor."
msgstr ""
"加入\\ :guilabel:`網址或電子郵件`\\ 。輸入 `/` 以搜尋頁面，輸入 `#` 以連結到"
"錨點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:52
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Style`, :guilabel:`Size`, and :guilabel:`Layout` to "
"define the button's appearance."
msgstr ""
"設定\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`大小`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`版面配置"
"`\\ 以定義按鈕的外觀。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:54
msgid ""
"If needed, toggle the switch to open the linked page or anchor in a new tab."
msgstr "如有需要，切換開關以在新分頁中開啟連結的頁面或錨點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:55
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Apply` to save changes."
msgstr "按一下\\ :guilabel:`套用`\\ 以儲存變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:58
msgid ""
"To modify an existing button, click the button and edit the options in "
"the :guilabel:`Inline text` section of the website editor."
msgstr ""
"若要修改現有按鈕，請按一下按鈕並在網站編輯器的\\ :guilabel:`內聯文字`\\ 區段"
"中編輯選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:66
msgid "To insert an image:"
msgstr "若要插入圖片："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:68
msgid "Type `/image`."
msgstr "輸入 `/image`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:69
msgid ""
":doc:`Search the Unsplash database </applications/general/integrations/"
"unsplash>` or click :guilabel:`Upload an image` to choose a file from your "
"local images."
msgstr ""
":doc:`搜尋 Unsplash 資料庫 </applications/general/integrations/unsplash>`\\ "
"或按一下\\ :guilabel:`上載圖片`\\ 以從本機圖片中選擇檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:71
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`加入`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:72
msgid ""
"To customize the image, click on the image and edit the options in "
"the :guilabel:`Image` section of the website editor. For example:"
msgstr ""
"若要自訂圖片，請按一下圖片並在網站編輯器的\\ :guilabel:`圖片`\\ 區段中編輯選"
"項。例如："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:75
msgid ":guilabel:`Replace` the image."
msgstr ":guilabel:`替換`\\ 圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:76
msgid ""
"Define an `alt tag <https://help.siteimprove.com/support/solutions/articles/"
"80000448480-where-are-alt-tags- used-and-why-are-they-important>`_ in "
"the :guilabel:`Description` field."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`說明`\\ 欄位中定義\\ `替代標籤 <https://help.siteimprove.com/"
"support/solutions/articles/80000448480-where-are-alt-tags- used-and-why-are-"
"they-important>`_\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enter a title tag in the :guilabel:`Tooltip` field. This text will appear "
"when visitors hover their mouse over the image."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`工具提示`\\ 欄位中輸入標題標籤。當訪客將滑鼠懸停在圖片上時，"
"此文字將會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:80
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Shape`; some shapes also allow for color customization."
msgstr "加入\\ :guilabel:`形狀`\\ ；某些形狀也允許自訂顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:81
msgid ""
"Adjust the image's :guilabel:`Width`, e.g., to improve performance. A "
"smaller size may be suggested if it is sufficient for display."
msgstr ""
"調整圖片的\\ :guilabel:`寬度`\\ ，例如以提升效能。如果較小的尺寸足以顯示，系"
"統可能會建議使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:83
msgid "Resize the image using the :guilabel:`Transform` tool."
msgstr "使用\\ :guilabel:`變形`\\ 工具調整圖片大小。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:84
msgid ""
"Adjust the :guilabel:`Padding` to add space (in pixels) around the image."
msgstr "調整\\ :guilabel:`邊距`\\ 以在圖片周圍加入空間（以像素為單位）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:85
msgid "Etc."
msgstr "等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:90
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "影片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:92
msgid ""
"To add a video, type `/video`, insert the URL, and turn on the desired "
"options:"
msgstr "若要加入影片，請輸入\\ `/video`\\ ，插入網址，然後開啟所需選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Autoplay`: to automatically play the video when the page is "
"accessed. The video is automatically muted by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`自動播放`\\ ：在存取頁面時自動播放影片。影片預設會自動靜音。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:96
msgid ":guilabel:`Loop`: to play the video on a loop."
msgstr ":guilabel:`循環播放`\\ ：循環播放影片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:97
msgid ":guilabel:`Hide player controls`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`隱藏播放器控制項`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`Hide fullscreen button`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`隱藏全螢幕按鈕`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vertical`: to display the video in vertical format (portrait "
"mode)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`垂直`\\ ：以垂直格式（直向模式）顯示影片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start at`: to define the timestamp where the video should start, "
"in `MM:SS` format."
msgstr ":guilabel:`開始於`\\ ：以`分鐘：秒`格式定義影片應開始的時間戳記。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:105
msgid "Icons"
msgstr "圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:107
msgid ""
"To insert an icon, type `/image`, go to the :guilabel:`Icons` tab, select an "
"icon, and click :guilabel:`Add`. To modify an icon, click on it and use "
"the :guilabel:`Icon` section of the website editor to customize options, "
"such as :guilabel:`Color`, :guilabel:`Size`, :ref:`Animations <website/"
"elements/animations>`, :guilabel:`Shape`, etc."
msgstr ""
"若要插入圖示，請輸入\\ `/image`\\ ，前往\\ :guilabel:`圖示`\\ 分頁，選取一個"
"圖示，然後按一下\\ :guilabel:`加入`\\ 。若要修改圖示，請按一下該圖示，並使用"
"網站編輯器的\\ :guilabel:`圖示`\\ 區段自訂選項，例如\\ :guilabel:`顏色"
"`\\ 、:guilabel:`大小`\\ 、:ref:`動畫 <website/elements/"
"animations>`\\ 、:guilabel:`形狀`\\ 等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:115
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:193
msgid "Links"
msgstr "連結"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:117
msgid ""
"Links are used to connect different pages and resources, guiding visitors "
"and improving navigation. To add a link, type `/link`, then, in the pop-up "
"that opens, enter the link's :guilabel:`Label` and add the :guilabel:`URL or "
"Email`. Type `/` to search for a page and `#` to link to an :ref:`anchor "
"<website/building_blocks/anchor>`."
msgstr ""
"連結用於連接不同的頁面和資源，引導訪客並改善導覽。若要加入連結，請輸入\\ `/"
"link`\\ ，然後在開啟的彈出視窗中，輸入連結的\\ :guilabel:`標籤`\\ 並加入"
"\\ :guilabel:`網址或電子郵件`\\ 。輸入\\ `/`\\ 以搜尋頁面，輸入\\ `#`\\ 以連"
"結至\\ :ref:`錨點 <website/building_blocks/anchor>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:123
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Style` field is set to :guilabel:`Link`. Select a "
"different style to transform the link into a :ref:`button <website/elements/"
"buttons>`."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，:guilabel:`樣式`\\ 欄位設為\\ :guilabel:`連結`\\ 。選取不同的樣式"
"可將連結轉換為\\ :ref:`按鈕 <website/elements/buttons>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:129
msgid "Lists"
msgstr "清單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:131
msgid ""
"Lists help organize content clearly, making information easier to read and "
"improving web pages' structures. Type `/list` and choose from three "
"different types of lists: :guilabel:`Bulleted lists`, :guilabel:`Numbered "
"lists`, or :guilabel:`Checklists`."
msgstr ""
"清單有助於清楚組織內容，使資訊更易於閱讀並改善網頁結構。輸入\\ `/list`\\ 並從"
"三種不同類型的清單中選擇：:guilabel:`項目符號清單`\\ 、:guilabel:`編號清單"
"`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`核取清單`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:138
msgid "Text highlights"
msgstr "文字醒目提示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:140
msgid ""
"Highlights can be added to titles and text using in the :guilabel:`Inline "
"Text` section of the website editor. To add a highlight:"
msgstr ""
"可在網站編輯器的\\ :guilabel:`行內文字`\\ 區段中為標題和文字加入醒目提示。若"
"要加入醒目提示："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:143
msgid "Select the text or title you want to highlight."
msgstr "選取您要醒目提示的文字或標題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:144
msgid "In the website editor, click on :guilabel:`Highlight`."
msgstr "在網站編輯器中，按一下\\ :guilabel:`醒目提示`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:145
msgid "Select the highlight style."
msgstr "選擇醒目提示樣式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:146
msgid "Modify its :guilabel:`Color`."
msgstr "修改其\\ :guilabel:`顏色`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:147
msgid "Choose its :guilabel:`Thickness`."
msgstr "選擇其\\ :guilabel:`粗細`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:149
msgid "Highlight texts and titles"
msgstr "醒目提示文字和標題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:155
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "動畫效果"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:157
msgid ""
"Animations are used to add movement to :doc:`building blocks "
"<building_blocks>` and website elements such as images and text. Three types "
"of animation are available: :guilabel:`On Scroll`, :guilabel:`On "
"Appearance`, and :guilabel:`On Hover` (for images only)."
msgstr ""
"動畫用於為\\ :doc:`構建區塊 <building_blocks>`\\ 和網站元素（例如圖片和文字）"
"加入動態效果。有三種類型的動畫可用：\\ :guilabel:`捲動時`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`"
"出現時`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`懸停時`\\ （僅限圖片）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:161
msgid "To add an animation to a website element:"
msgstr "若要為網站元素加入動畫："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:163
msgid "Click on the element."
msgstr "按一下該元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:164
msgid ""
"In the website editor, go to the relevant section for the element "
"(e.g., :guilabel:`Button`, :guilabel:`Column`, :guilabel:`Inline Text`, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"在網站編輯器中，前往該元素的相關區段（例如\\ :guilabel:`按鈕`\\ 、"
"\\ :guilabel:`欄`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`行內文字`\\ 等）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:166
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Animation` field, select the desired animation type."
msgstr "在\\ :guilabel:`動畫`\\ 欄位中，選擇所需的動畫類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:167
msgid ""
"Customize the animation settings as needed. Available options vary based on "
"the selected animation type."
msgstr "根據需要自訂動畫設定。可用選項會根據所選的動畫類型而有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:171
msgid "Animations on scroll"
msgstr "捲動時的動畫"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:173
msgid "For animations on scroll, it is possible to:"
msgstr "對於捲動時的動畫，可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:175
msgid ""
"Choose :guilabel:`In` to add the animation when the element enters the "
"screen and :guilabel:`Out` to add it when it leaves the screen."
msgstr ""
"選擇\\ :guilabel:`進入`\\ 以在元素進入螢幕時加入動畫，並選擇\\ :guilabel:`離"
"開`\\ 以在元素離開螢幕時加入動畫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:177
msgid "Select an :guilabel:`Effect`."
msgstr "選擇\\ :guilabel:`效果`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:178
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:189
msgid "Choose the :guilabel:`Direction` of the effect."
msgstr "選擇效果的\\ :guilabel:`方向`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:179
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:192
msgid "Adapt the :guilabel:`Intensity` of the effect."
msgstr "調整效果的\\ :guilabel:`強度`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:180
msgid ""
"Define the :guilabel:`Scroll Zone`, where the first value represents the "
"percentage of the screen shown when the effect starts, and the second value "
"represents its percentage at the end."
msgstr ""
"定義\\ :guilabel:`捲動區域`\\ ，其中第一個值代表效果開始時顯示的螢幕百分比，"
"第二個值代表效果結束時的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:184
msgid "Animations on appearance"
msgstr "出現時的動畫"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:186
msgid "For animations on appearance, it is possible to:"
msgstr "對於出現時的動畫，可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:188
msgid "Choose among different effects."
msgstr "從不同的效果中選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:190
msgid ""
"Pick a :guilabel:`Trigger` option to define when the animation occurs: "
"either the :guilabel:`First Time only` or :guilabel:`Every Time`."
msgstr ""
"選擇\\ :guilabel:`觸發`\\ 選項以定義動畫何時發生：:guilabel:`僅第一次`\\ 或"
"\\ :guilabel:`每次`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:193
msgid ""
"If you want the animation to be triggered after a number of seconds, define "
"this number in the :guilabel:`Start After` field."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望動畫在指定秒數後觸發，請在\\ :guilabel:`延遲啟動`\\ 欄位中定義該秒"
"數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:195
msgid "Choose a :guilabel:`Duration` for the animation."
msgstr "為動畫選擇\\ :guilabel:`持續時間`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:198
msgid "Animations on hover (for images only)"
msgstr "懸停動畫（僅限圖片）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:200
msgid ""
"Animations :guilabel:`On hover` can be added to :ref:`images <website/"
"elements/images>`. You can choose the :guilabel:`Effect` of the animation, "
"as well as the :guilabel:`Color` and the :guilabel:`Stroke Width`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`懸停時`\\ 的動畫可以加入到\\ :ref:`圖片 <website/elements/"
"images>`\\ 中。您可以選擇動畫的\\ :guilabel:`效果`、:guilabel:`顏色`\\ 以及"
"\\ :guilabel:`筆畫寬度`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:205
msgid ":doc:`Odoo HTML editor </applications/essentials/html_editor>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Odoo HTML 編輯器 </applications/essentials/html_editor>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo provides a range of theme :ref:`customization options <website/themes/"
"page-layouts>` to define the website's :ref:`colors <website/themes/"
"colors>`, :ref:`fonts <website/themes/fonts>`, and :ref:`shadow styles "
"<website/themes/shadows>`, and the appearance of :ref:`paragraphs and "
"headings <website/themes/paragraphs-headings>`, :ref:`buttons <website/"
"themes/button-styles>`, :ref:`links <website/themes/link-style>`, "
"and :ref:`input fields <website/themes/input-fields>`. "
"Additional :ref:`advanced settings <website/themes/advanced>` are also "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 提供了一系列主題\\ :ref:`自訂選項 <website/themes/page-layouts>`，用於定"
"義網站的\\ :ref:`顏色 <website/themes/colors>`、:ref:`字型 <website/themes/"
"fonts>`以及\\ :ref:`陰影樣式 <website/themes/shadows>`，以及\\ :ref:`段落和標"
"題 <website/themes/paragraphs-headings>`、:ref:`按鈕 <website/themes/button-"
"styles>`、:ref:`連結 <website/themes/link-style>`以及\\ :ref:`輸入欄位 "
"<website/themes/input-fields>`的外觀。也提供了額外的\\ :ref:`進階設定 "
"<website/themes/advanced>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:12
msgid ""
"When setting up a website for the first time, you are prompted to select a "
"theme. Hover the mouse over the themes to see an extended preview of each "
"one. Click a theme to select it, or click the :guilabel:`View more themes` "
"button to display the full list of available themes."
msgstr ""
"首次設定網站時，系統會提示您選取主題。將滑鼠懸停在主題上可查看各主題的延伸預"
"覽。按一下主題即可選取，或按一下\\ :guilabel:`檢視更多主題`\\ 按鈕以顯示可用"
"主題的完整清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:17
msgid ""
"If you leave without selecting a theme, the website is created with the "
"default theme."
msgstr "若未選取主題即離開，網站將以預設主題建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:21
msgid ""
"To customize the theme, open the website editor, navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Theme` tab, and go to the :guilabel:`Website` section. You "
"can:"
msgstr ""
"若要自訂主題，請開啟網站編輯器，導覽至\\ :guilabel:`主題`\\ 分頁，並前往\\ "
":guilabel:`網站`\\ 區段。您可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:24
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Switch Theme` to open the theme selector. Hover the mouse "
"over the themes to see an extended preview of each one. Click :guilabel:`Use "
"this theme` to apply it to the website."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :guilabel:`切換主題`\\ 以開啟主題選擇器。將滑鼠懸停在主題上可查看各"
"主題的延伸預覽。按一下\\ :guilabel:`使用此主題`\\ 以套用至網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:26
msgid "Add a :doc:`language <../configuration/multi_website>` for the website."
msgstr "為網站加入\\ :doc:`語言 <../configuration/multi_website>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:27
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Page Layout` to change the overall display and spacing "
"of building blocks and website elements on pages."
msgstr ""
"選取\\ :guilabel:`頁面版面配置`\\ 以變更頁面上建構區塊與網站元素的整體顯示方"
"式及間距。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:29
msgid "Customize the layout's background:"
msgstr "自訂版面背景："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:31
msgid "Choose a :guilabel:`Background` :ref:`color <website/themes/colors>`."
msgstr "選擇\\ :guilabel:`背景`\\ :ref:`顏色 <website/themes/colors>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:32
msgid ""
"Add a background :ref:`image <website/elements/images>` "
"or :guilabel:`Replace` it. Then configure its :guilabel:`Position`:"
msgstr ""
"添加背景\\ :ref:`圖片 <website/elements/images>`或\\ :guilabel:`取代`它。然後"
"配置其\\ :guilabel:`位置`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:35
msgid ""
"Use the selected image as a :guilabel:`Cover` or in a :guilabel:`Repeat "
"Pattern`."
msgstr "將選定的圖片用作\\ :guilabel:`封面`或\\ :guilabel:`重複圖案`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:36
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-arrows` (:guilabel:`Background Position`) icon to adjust "
"the image position, then click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :icon:`fa-arrows`\\ (:guilabel:`背景位置`)\\ 圖示以調整圖片位置，然"
"後按一下\\ :guilabel:`套用`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:39
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save` to apply the changes to the website."
msgstr "按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存`\\ 以將變更套用至網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:44
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "配色"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:46
msgid ""
"Odoo's website editor features two main types of colors: :ref:`theme colors "
"<website/themes/theme-colors>` and :ref:`status colors <website/themes/"
"status-colors>`. Click the color palette bar to open "
"the :guilabel:`Website / Colors` menu in the :guilabel:`Theme` tab."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 網站編輯器具有兩種主要顏色：\\ :ref:`主題顏色 <website/themes/theme-"
"colors>`和\\ :ref:`狀態顏色 <website/themes/status-colors>`。按一下顏色調色板"
"條以開啟\\ :guilabel:`網站 / 顏色`\\ 選單，位於\\ :guilabel:`主題`\\ 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:53
msgid "Theme colors"
msgstr "主題色彩組合"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:55
msgid ""
"Theme colors refer to the set of colors displayed across all pages of the "
"website. They consist of five colors: three :guilabel:`Main` colors, used "
"mainly for buttons and links, and two :guilabel:`Light & Dark` colors, used "
"mainly for text and headings."
msgstr ""
"主題顏色是指在網站所有頁面上顯示的一組顏色。它們由五種顏色組成：三種\\ "
":guilabel:`主要`\\ 顏色，主要用於按鈕和連結；以及兩種\\ :guilabel:`淺色與深"
"色`\\ 顏色，主要用於文字和標題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:59
msgid "To customize the theme colors:"
msgstr "要自訂主題顏色："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:61
msgid ""
"Click the color you want to change, then select a "
"predefined :guilabel:`Solid` color or click :guilabel:`Custom` to pick a "
"specific color tone manually (or add its #HEX or RGBA code). Click :icon:`fa-"
"trash` (:guilabel:`Reset`) to remove the color selection."
msgstr ""
"按一下要變更的顏色，然後選擇預先定義的\\ :guilabel:`純色`\\ 顏色，或按一下"
"\\ :guilabel:`自訂`\\ 以手動挑選特定色調（或加入其 #HEX 或 RGBA 代碼）。按一"
"下\\ :icon:`fa-trash`\\ （:guilabel:`重設`）即可移除顏色選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:64
msgid ""
"Click the paint palette icon and choose a color palette. As a result, all "
"color customizations are reset."
msgstr "按一下調色盤圖示並選擇調色盤。如此一來，所有自訂顏色都將重設。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:67
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically creates :guilabel:`Color Presets` for the chosen colors "
"or palette. These predefined color combinations are applied to various "
"elements of the website to create a structured and visually appealing "
"design. When selecting a color palette, its presets define how those colors "
"are distributed across different elements. To modify them, "
"click :guilabel:`Color Presets`, then select a preset to open the "
"customization dropdown. Each color preset contains colors for the building "
"block’s :guilabel:`Background`, :guilabel:`Text`, :guilabel:`Headings`, :guilabel:`Links`, :guilabel:`Primary "
"Buttons`, and :guilabel:`Secondary Buttons`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會自動為所選顏色或調色盤建立\\ :guilabel:`顏色預設設定`\\ 。這些預先定義"
"的顏色組合會套用至網站的各種元素，以建立結構化且具視覺吸引力的設計。選取調色"
"盤時，其預設設定會定義這些顏色在不同元素之間的分配方式。若要修改它們，請按一"
"下\\ :guilabel:`顏色預設設定`\\ ，然後選取預設設定以開啟自訂下拉式選單。每個"
"顏色預設設定都包含建構區塊的\\ :guilabel:`背景`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`文字`\\ "
"、\\ :guilabel:`標題`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`連結`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`主要按鈕`\\ "
"和\\ :guilabel:`次要按鈕`\\ 顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:76
msgid ""
"To apply a color preset to a building block, select the building block, go "
"to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, click the color dot located next "
"to :guilabel:`Background`, and choose a :guilabel:`Theme`."
msgstr ""
"若要將顏色預設設定套用至建構區塊，請選取該建構區塊，前往\\ :guilabel:`樣式`\\"
" 分頁，按一下\\ :guilabel:`背景`\\ 旁的彩色圓點，然後選擇\\ :guilabel:`主"
"題`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:81
msgid ""
"Changing a color preset automatically updates the colors of both the default "
"preset and the building blocks that use it."
msgstr ""
"變更顏色預設設定會自動更新預設預設設定的顏色以及使用該預設設定的建置區塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:87
msgid "Status colors"
msgstr "狀態色彩"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:89
msgid ""
"Status colors indicate the status of certain actions "
"(e.g., :guilabel:`Success`, :guilabel:`Warning`, etc.). They are used in pop-"
"up messages that appear to provide feedback to users and website visitors. "
"To customize the website's :guilabel:`Status Colors`, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Advanced` section and click the dots to change their color. "
"You can also configure :guilabel:`Grays`."
msgstr ""
"狀態顏色表示某些操作的狀態（例如：\\ :guilabel:`成功`、\\ :guilabel:`警告`，"
"等）。它們用於出現在彈出訊息中，為使用者和網站訪客提供反饋。要自訂網站的\\ "
":guilabel:`狀態顏色`，請前往\\ :guilabel:`進階`\\ 區段，並按一下圓點以變更其"
"顏色。您也可以配置\\ :guilabel:`灰色`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:97
msgid ""
"Information related to a successful action on the website appears "
"in :icon:`oi-green-dot` green."
msgstr "與網站上成功操作相關的資訊會以\\ :icon:`oi-green-dot`綠色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:99
msgid "Status color selection"
msgstr "狀態色彩選擇"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:102
msgid "Success pop-up"
msgstr "成功彈出式視窗"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:108
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "字型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:110
msgid ""
"Odoo allows you to customize the font family and font size of website "
"elements, including :ref:`paragraphs and headings <website/themes/paragraphs-"
"headings>`, :ref:`buttons <website/themes/button-styles>`, and :ref:`input "
"fields <website/themes/input-fields>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 允許您自訂網站元素的字型系列和字型大小，包括\\ :ref:`段落和標題 "
"<website/themes/paragraphs-headings>`、:ref:`按鈕 <website/themes/button-"
"styles>`和\\ :ref:`輸入欄位 <website/themes/input-fields>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Font Size`: In "
"the :guilabel:`Paragraph`, :guilabel:`Headings`, :guilabel:`Button`, "
"and :guilabel:`Input Fields` sections, use the :guilabel:`Font Size` field "
"to set a default size. Click the :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`Toggle "
"more options`) icon to expand the section and define custom sizes (e.g., "
"based on the heading level, button size, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`字型大小`：在\\ :guilabel:`段落`、:guilabel:`標題`、:guilabel:`按"
"鈕`和\\ :guilabel:`輸入欄位`區段中，使用\\ :guilabel:`字型大小`欄位設定預設大"
"小。按一下\\ :icon:`fa-caret-right`（:guilabel:`切換更多選項`）圖示以展開區段"
"並定義自訂大小（例如，根據標題等級、按鈕大小等）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Font Family`: In the :guilabel:`Paragraph`, :guilabel:`Headings`, "
"and :guilabel:`Button` sections, select a font from the dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`字型系列`\\ ：在\\ :guilabel:`段落`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`標題`\\ 和"
"\\ :guilabel:`按鈕`\\ 區段中，從下拉式選單中選取字型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:122
msgid ""
"When :guilabel:`System Fonts` is selected, Odoo uses the native fonts "
"already installed on the visitor's operating system. For example, Android "
"uses **Roboto** as its default system font."
msgstr ""
"選取\\ :guilabel:`系統字型`時，Odoo 會使用訪客作業系統上已安裝的原生字型。例"
"如，Android 使用 **Roboto** 作為其預設系統字型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:126
msgid "Custom fonts"
msgstr "自訂字型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:128
msgid ""
"To add a custom font not available by default in Odoo, click "
"the :guilabel:`Font Family` dropdown and select :guilabel:`Add a Custom "
"Font` at the bottom. In the :guilabel:`Add a Google font or upload a custom "
"font` pop-up:"
msgstr ""
"若要加入 Odoo 中預設不可用的自訂字型，請按一下\\ :guilabel:`字型系列`下拉式選"
"單，然後在底部選取\\ :guilabel:`加入自訂字型`。在\\ :guilabel:`加入 Google 字"
"型或上傳自訂字型`彈出式視窗中："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:132
msgid ""
"To add a Google font, open the :guilabel:`Select a Google Font` dropdown and "
"select the desired font. Toggle off the :guilabel:`Serve font from Google "
"servers` if your website is operated from a location where regulations "
"require compliance with laws such as, but not limited to, the European "
"Union's GDPR. This will ensure the Google Font is stored on the website's "
"server rather than on Google's servers."
msgstr ""
"若要加入 Google 字型，請開啟\\ :guilabel:`選取 Google 字型`下拉式選單並選取所"
"需的字型。如果您的網站在需要遵守歐盟 GDPR 等（但不限於）法律的地區運作，請關"
"閉\\ :guilabel:`從 Google 伺服器提供字型`。這將確保 Google 字型儲存在網站的伺"
"服器上，而不是 Google 的伺服器上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:137
msgid ""
"To upload a :guilabel:`Custom Font` from your computer, "
"click :guilabel:`Choose File`."
msgstr ""
"若要從您的電腦上傳\\ :guilabel:`自訂字型`，請按一下\\ :guilabel:`選擇檔案`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:139
msgid "Once done, click :guilabel:`Save and Reload`."
msgstr "完成後，按一下\\ :guilabel:`儲存並重新載入`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:142
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Preview` of the selected font is displayed on the right side of "
"the window."
msgstr "視窗右側會顯示所選字型的\\ :guilabel:`預覽`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:145
msgid "Styles"
msgstr "樣式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:147
msgid ""
"The appearance of website elements can be further customized. For example, "
"you can customize :ref:`paragraphs and headings <website/themes/paragraphs-"
"headings>`, :ref:`buttons <website/themes/button-styles>`, :ref:`links "
"<website/themes/link-style>`, and :ref:`input fields <website/themes/input-"
"fields>`."
msgstr ""
"可以進一步自訂網站元素的外觀。例如，您可以自訂\\ :ref:`段落和標題 <website/"
"themes/paragraphs-headings>`、:ref:`按鈕 <website/themes/button-"
"styles>`、:ref:`連結 <website/themes/link-style>`和\\ :ref:`輸入欄位 "
"<website/themes/input-fields>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:155
msgid "Paragraphs & headings"
msgstr "段落與標題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:157
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Paragraph` and :guilabel:`Headings` sections offer additional "
"styling options for these text elements. You can:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`段落`和\\ :guilabel:`標題`區段為這些文字元素提供了額外的樣式選項。"
"您可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:160
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:177
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:211
msgid "Modify the :ref:`font settings <website/themes/fonts>`."
msgstr "修改\\ :ref:`字型設定 <website/themes/fonts>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:161
msgid ""
"Adjust the :guilabel:`Line Height` to define the spacing between lines of "
"text."
msgstr "調整\\ :guilabel:`行高`以定義文字行之間的間距。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:162
msgid ""
"Adjust :guilabel:`Margins` to define the spacing around paragraphs and "
"headings."
msgstr "調整\\ :guilabel:`邊界`以定義段落和標題周圍的間距。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:169
msgid ""
"To customize the style of the website's primary and secondary buttons, "
"navigate to the :guilabel:`Button` section and edit the relevant options:"
msgstr ""
"若要自訂網站主要和次要按鈕的樣式，請導覽至\\ :guilabel:`按鈕`區段並編輯相關選"
"項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:172
msgid ""
"Open the :icon:`fa-caret-down` dropdown menu next to the :guilabel:`Primary "
"Style` or :guilabel:`Secondary Style` fields to change the style for each "
"button type, such as :guilabel:`Fill`, :guilabel:`Outline`, "
"or :guilabel:`Flat`. When selecting :guilabel:`Outline`, "
"the :guilabel:`Border Width` option appears below, allowing you to adjust "
