#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:59
msgid ""
"The website import tool is a website scraper that searches for the specified "
"website and analyzes it. It then uses custom AI models to rebuild it as an "
"Odoo website. The extraction is performed page by page, preserving the "
"original website's structure and content. Images, the sitemap, "
"the :doc:`header, and the footer <structure/header_footer>` are also "
"imported. Optionally, :doc:`product data <../ecommerce/configuration/"
"products>` can also be extracted. The tool converts pages into standard "
"Odoo :doc:`building blocks <web_design/building_blocks>`, making the "
"imported website fully editable in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"網站匯入工具是一個網站抓取工具，用於搜尋指定的網站並進行分析。然後，它使用自"
"訂人工智慧模型將其重建為 Odoo 網站。提取過程逐頁執行，保留原網站的結構和內容"
"。圖片、網站地圖、\\ :doc:`頁首和頁尾 <structure/header_footer>`\\ 也會一併匯"
"入。您可以選擇性地提取\\ :doc:`產品資料 <../ecommerce/configuration/products>"
"`\\ 。該工具將頁面轉換為標準的 Odoo\\ :doc:`建構區塊 <web_design/"
"building_blocks>`\\ ，使匯入的網站可以在 Odoo 中完全編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:68
msgid ""
"The imported website is not an exact replica of the original. Manual "
"adjustments to layout, styling, or content may be needed after import."
msgstr ""
"匯入的網站並非原始網站的完美複製品。匯入後，可能需要手動調整版面配置、樣式或"
"內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:72
msgid ""
"By using this tool, you confirm that you own the website and all its "
"associated content (such as images), and that you take full responsibility "
"for their use and any potential legal implications."
msgstr ""
"使用此工具，即表示您確認您擁有該網站及其所有相關內容（例如圖片），並對其使用"
"以及任何潛在的法律影響承擔全部責任。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:75
msgid ""
"For the best results, ensure your database is up to date with the latest "
"version of Odoo."
msgstr "為獲得最佳效果，請確保您的資料庫已更新至最新版本的 Odoo。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:76
msgid ""
"Do not edit the website during the import process. Importing data overwrites "
"the content of the website currently being edited, potentially resulting in "
"the loss of unsaved changes."
msgstr ""
"請勿在匯入過程中編輯網站。匯入資料會覆寫目前編輯中的網站內容，這可能會導致未"
"儲存的變更遺失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:83
msgid "To import your current website, follow these steps:"
msgstr "若要匯入您目前的網站，請遵循以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:86
msgid ""
"In the settings banner, click :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Import Website`."
msgstr "在設定橫幅中，按一下\\ :icon:`fa-download`\\ :guilabel:`匯入網站`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:87
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Import Your Pages and Products` pop-up, enter "
"the :guilabel:`Website URL` (e.g., `https://www.example.com`)."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`匯入您的頁面與產品`\\ 彈出視窗中，輸入\\ :guilabel:`網站網"
"址`\\（例如 `https://www.example.com`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:89
msgid "Ensure :guilabel:`Import Website` is enabled."
msgstr "確保\\ :guilabel:`匯入網站`\\ 已啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:90
msgid ""
"When running an online shop, enable :guilabel:`Import Products` to extract "
"product data."
msgstr "經營線上商店時，請啟用\\ :guilabel:`匯入產品`\\ 以擷取產品資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:91
msgid ""
"If applicable, complete additional configuration steps for importing "
"products. Odoo automatically detects the e-commerce platform used by the "
"original website. Product extraction is supported only for e-commerce "
"websites that expose product data through metadata schemes or that use "
"`Shopify <https://www.shopify.com/>`_, `WooCommerce <https://woocommerce.com/"
">`_, or `PrestaShop <https://prestashop.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"如適用，請完成匯入產品的額外設定步驟。Odoo 會自動偵測原始網站使用的電子商務平"
"台。產品擷取僅支援透過詮釋資料架構公開產品資料，或使用 `Shopify <https://"
"www.shopify.com/>`_\\ 、`WooCommerce <https://woocommerce.com/>`_\\ 或 "
"`PrestaShop <https://prestashop.com/>`_ 的電子商務網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:99
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "元數據"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:101
msgid ""
"Odoo can extract product data from websites that expose product data through "
"one of the following metadata schemes:"
msgstr "Odoo 可從透過下列其中一種詮釋資料架構公開產品資料的網站中，擷取產品資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:104
msgid "JSON-LD"
msgstr "JSON-LD"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:105
msgid "RDFa"
msgstr "RDFa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:106
msgid "Open Graph"
msgstr "Open Graph"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:107
msgid "Microdata"
msgstr "Microdata"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:109
msgid ""
"If no supported API or platform is detected, product data is extracted from "
"supported metadata as a fallback."
msgstr ""
"如果未偵測到支援的 API 或平台，系統會將支援的詮釋資料作為後備來源來擷取產品資"
"料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:112
msgid "Shopify"
msgstr "Shopify"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:114
msgid ""
"`Shopify <https://www.shopify.com/>`_ provides a public API that allows Odoo "
"to extract product data without any additional configuration."
msgstr ""
"`Shopify <https://www.shopify.com/>`_ 提供公開 API，讓 Odoo 無需任何額外設定"
"即可擷取產品資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:117
msgid "WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:119
msgid ""
"`WooCommerce <https://woocommerce.com/>`_ requires `authentication <https://"
"woocommerce.com/document/woocommerce-rest-api/#generate-keys>`_ before "
"products can be imported. Once a WooCommerce website is detected, follow "
"these steps in the :guilabel:`Import Your Pages and Products` pop-up:"
msgstr ""
"`WooCommerce <https://woocommerce.com/>`_ 需要先進行 `驗證 <https://"
"woocommerce.com/document/woocommerce-rest-api/#generate-keys>`_ 才能匯入產品"
"。一旦偵測到 WooCommerce 網站，請在\\ :guilabel:`匯入您的頁面與產品`\\ 彈出視"
"窗中執行以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:124
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-key` :guilabel:`Connect via WooCommerce` next "
"to :guilabel:`Authorization`."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :icon:`fa-key`\\ :guilabel:`透過 WooCommerce 連接`\\，該選項位於\\ "
":guilabel:`授權`\\ 旁邊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:126
msgid "Log in to your WooCommerce store using your WooCommerce credentials."
msgstr "使用您的 WooCommerce 憑證登入您的 WooCommerce 商店。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:127
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Approve` to authorize Odoo to access the store's data."
msgstr "按一下\\ :guilabel:`批准`\\ 以授權 Odoo 存取商店資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:129
msgid "PrestaShop"
msgstr "PrestaShop"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:131
msgid ""
"Importing products from `PrestaShop <https://prestashop.com/>`_ requires an "
"API key. Once a PrestaShop website is detected, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"從 `PrestaShop <https://prestashop.com/>`_ 匯入產品需要 API 金鑰。一旦偵測到 "
"PrestaShop 網站，請遵循以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:134
msgid ""
"`Log in to your PrestaShop account <https://authv2.prestashop.com/login>`_ "
"and navigate to the PrestaShop back office."
msgstr ""
"`登入您的 PrestaShop 帳戶 <https://authv2.prestashop.com/login>`_ 並導航至 "
"PrestaShop 後台。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:136
