msgstr "複製產生的 API 金鑰。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:160
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Import Your Pages and Products` pop-up, paste the key into "
"the :guilabel:`PrestaShop API Key` field."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`匯入您的頁面和產品`彈出視窗中，將金鑰貼上至\\ "
":guilabel:`PrestaShop API 金鑰`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:163
msgid ""
"When running a blog, enable :guilabel:`Import Blogs` to extract blog post "
"data."
msgstr "當運行部落格時，啟用\\ :guilabel:`匯入部落格`以提取部落格貼文資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:164
msgid ""
"If applicable, complete additional configuration steps for importing blog "
"posts. Odoo automatically detects the blog platform used by the original "
"website. Blog extraction is supported only for websites that use `WordPress "
"<https://wordpress.com/>`_ or `Ghost <https://ghost.org/>`_."
msgstr ""
"如果適用，請完成匯入部落格貼文的其他設定步驟。Odoo 會自動偵測原網站使用的部落"
"格平臺。部落格提取功能僅支援使用\\ `WordPress <https://wordpress.com/>`_ 或\\"
" `Ghost <https://ghost.org/>`_的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:171
msgid "WordPress"
msgstr "WordPress"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:173
msgid ""
"`WordPress <https://wordpress.com/>`_ provides a public API that allows Odoo "
"to extract blog data without any additional configuration."
msgstr ""
"`WordPress <https://wordpress.com/>`_ 提供了公開 API，讓 Odoo 無需進行任何額"
"外設定即可提取部落格資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:176
msgid "Ghost"
msgstr "鬼魂"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:178
msgid ""
"Importing blog posts from `Ghost <https://ghost.org/>`_ requires an API key. "
"Once a Ghost website is detected, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"匯入來自\\ `Ghost <https://ghost.org/>`_ 的部落格貼文需要 API 金鑰。一旦偵測"
"到 Ghost 網站，請遵循以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:181
msgid ""
"`Log in to your Ghost Admin account <https://account.ghost.org/signin>`_."
msgstr "`登入您的 Ghost 管理員帳號\\ <https://account.ghost.org/signin>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:182
msgid ""
"Go to the :guilabel:`Advanced` section and `create an API key <ghost-api-"
"key_>`_."
msgstr "前往\\ :guilabel:`進階`區段，並\\ `建立 API 金鑰 <ghost-api-key_>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:183
msgid "Copy the generated :guilabel:`Content API key`."
msgstr "複製產生的\\ :guilabel:`內容 API 金鑰`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:184
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Import Your Pages and Products` pop-up, paste the key into "
"the :guilabel:`Ghost API Key` field."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`匯入您的頁面和產品`彈出視窗中，將金鑰貼上至\\ "
":guilabel:`Ghost API 金鑰`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:187
msgid ""
"If you want to import products or blog posts to an existing website, i.e., "
"without importing an external website, choose :guilabel:`All` or an existing "
"website in the :guilabel:`Website` field."
msgstr ""
"若您想要將產品或部落格貼文匯入至現有網站（即不匯入外部網站），請在\\ "
":guilabel:`全部`或\\ :guilabel:`網站`欄位中選擇現有網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:189
msgid "To submit the request, click :guilabel:`Import my website`."
msgstr "若要送出請求，請按一下\\ :guilabel:`匯入我的網站`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:191
msgid ""
"Once the import is complete, you will receive an email or a notification "
"with details about the number of pages, products, and blog posts imported. "
"You can then further customize the website using the :doc:`website editor "
"<web_design>`."
msgstr ""
"匯入完成後，您將收到一封電子郵件或通知，內容包含已匯入的頁面、產品和部落格貼"
"文數量的詳細資訊。您隨後可使用\\ :doc:`網站編輯器 <web_design>`進一步自訂網站"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:196
msgid ""
"You can import up to **500** pages by default. Contact `Odoo support "
"<https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ if you need more."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，您最多可以匯入\\ **500**\\ 頁。如果需要更多，請聯絡\\ <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_\\ Odoo 支援。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:198
msgid ""
"Importing products automatically installs the :doc:`eCommerce app <../"
"ecommerce>` if it is not already installed."
msgstr ""
"匯入產品時，如果尚未安裝\\ :doc:`電子商務應用程式 <../ecommerce>`\\，系統會自"
"動為您安裝。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:200
msgid ""
"The tool supports importing up to **100,000** products. "
"Alternatively, :doc:`use a .csv file </applications/sales/sales/"
"products_prices/products/import>`."
msgstr ""
"此工具支援匯入最多\\ **100,000**\\ 個產品。或者，您可以\\ :doc:`使用 .csv 檔"
"案 </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import>`\\。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:202
msgid ""
":doc:`Product variants </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/"
"variants>` are imported along with their SKUs. The extracted SKU is stored "
"in the :guilabel:`Internal Reference` field of each product variant."
msgstr ""
":doc:`產品變體 </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants>"
"`\\ 會連同其 SKU 一併匯入。提取出的 SKU 會儲存在每個產品變體的\\ "
":guilabel:`內部參考`\\ 欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:205
msgid ""
"Importing blog posts automatically installs the :doc:`Blogs app <../blog>` "
"if it is not already installed."
msgstr ""
"匯入部落格文章時，如果尚未安裝\\ :doc:`部落格應用程式 <../blog>`\\，系統會自"
"動為您安裝。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:207
msgid "The tool supports importing up to **100,000** blog posts."
msgstr "此工具支援匯入最多\\ **100,000**\\ 篇部落格文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:210
msgid ""
"Use the `Website Import Tool trial <https://www.odoo.com/fr_FR/page/"
"startwebsite>`_ to test the website import feature by importing up to 10 "
"pages from the original website into a trial database."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ `網站匯入工具試用版\\ <https://www.odoo.com/fr_FR/page/startwebsite>"
"`_\\ ，將原始網站最多 10 頁的內容匯入試用資料庫，以測試網站匯入功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/website_creation.rst:213
msgid ""
"Ensure the original website is publicly accessible and not protected "
"by :ref:`Cloudflare <website/spam_protection/cloudflare-turnstile>` or other "
"anti-bot mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"確保原始網站可公開存取，且未受到\\ :ref:`Cloudflare <website/spam_protection/"
"cloudflare-turnstile>`\\ 或其他機器人防禦機制的保護。"

